#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:10
msgid ""
"A tomb half sunk in the lagoon. Insanity is its fame, they say, and undead its game."
msgstr "半沉在潟湖里的一座坟墓。据说它以疯狂闻名，里面的游戏是亡灵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:11
msgid "A stone door in the tundra. Something heavy walks about inside."
msgstr "冻原上的一扇石门。里面有什么沉重的东西在走动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:12
msgid "The Cave of Illusion. It may or may not be there."
msgstr "幻象洞穴。它也许在，也许不在。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:13
msgid ""
"The Tower of High Magic. Where the lock should be there is only a faint shimmer."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔。本该是锁的地方，只有一缕微弱的微光。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:14
msgid ""
"Darzog's Tower. The door is black iron without a handle, and a keyhole shaped like a skull."
msgstr "达佐格之塔。门是没有把手的黑铁门，锁孔的形状像个骷髅头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:15
msgid ""
"A stair down into the foundations of Newcastle. Your foundations, now."
msgstr "一道通往纽卡斯尔地基的阶梯。现在，那也是你的地基了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:16
msgid ""
"Black oak doors under a pointed arch. Somewhere inside, a dog howls, then a man. Castle Basenji."
msgstr "尖拱下的黑橡木大门。里面某处，先是一只狗在嚎叫，接着是一个人。巴森吉城堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:17
msgid ""
"A door of sandstone between two paws the size of houses. The Sphinx asks its own name."
msgstr "两只房子般大的巨爪之间，立着一扇砂岩门。狮身人面像在问它自己的名字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:18
msgid ""
"A cave mouth breathing heat between a demon and a devil carved in black rock."
msgstr "一个洞口，在黑岩雕成的恶魔与魔鬼之间喷出热气。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:19
msgid ""
"Cool air and a smell of grass come up through the cleft, from a valley that should not be there."
msgstr "凉风夹着青草的气息，从裂缝里涌上来，来自一个本不该存在的山谷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:20
msgid ""
"Scorched rock, gnawed bones, and a smell of sulphur. The Dragon Cave smells pretty bad. Are you sure you wish to enter?"
msgstr "焦黑的岩石、啃过的骨头，还有硫磺味。龙洞闻起来相当糟糕。你确定要进去吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:21
msgid "Castle Xeen, sitting on its cloud as if it owned the sky. It does."
msgstr "辛恩城堡，端坐在它的云上，好像天空是它的。其实就是它的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:22
msgid ""
"An iron-bound gate cut into the cliff. Beyond it a crowd roars, and something roars back."
msgstr "悬崖上嵌着一扇铁箍大门。门后人群在咆哮，还有什么东西咆哮着回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:23
msgid ""
"A hidden door in the riverbank. Hidden, apart from the well-trodden path to it."
msgstr "河岸上的一扇暗门。说是暗门，却有一条被踩得很实的小路通到它跟前。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:24
msgid ""
"A pagoda in the snow, dark and silent. Nobody is watching you, very carefully."
msgstr "雪地里的一座宝塔，漆黑而寂静。没有人在看着你，而且看得非常仔细。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:25
msgid ""
"Frozen hides hang across a hole in the snow. Behind them, something snores."
msgstr "冻硬的兽皮挂在雪地里的一个洞口。皮后面，有什么东西在打呼噜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:26
msgid ""
"Count Draco's coffin, open. There are steps where the Count should be."
msgstr "德拉科伯爵的棺材，是开着的。本该躺着伯爵的地方，是一道台阶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:27
msgid "A stair under Asp, worn smooth by feet that no longer come back up."
msgstr "毒蛇镇下的一道阶梯，被脚步磨得光滑，而那些脚再也没有走回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:28
msgid ""
"The way up to the Gargoyle Eyrie. The statues on the ledges are all facing your way."
msgstr "通往石像鬼巢穴的路。崖壁上的雕像，全都面朝着你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:29
msgid ""
"A cave with a boulder rolled aside for a door. Ogres expect no visitors they cannot eat."
msgstr "一个洞穴，用一块滚到一边的巨石当门。食人妖不指望来访者，除非是吃不到的那种。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:3
msgid ""
"A warehouse with a sign on the door: KEEP OUT. THIS MEANS YOU, GUNTHER."
msgstr "一间仓库，门上挂着牌子：禁止入内。说的就是你，冈瑟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:30
msgid ""
"An iron hatch over Castleview's sewer. The smell comes up to meet you."
msgstr "堡景镇下水道上的一块铁盖。臭味迎面扑来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:31
msgid "Ellinger's Tower. A sign under the knocker reads: \"Not now.\""
msgstr "埃林格之塔。门环下的牌子写着：“现在不行。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:32
msgid "Castle Kalindra, back in phase and solid to the touch. Mostly."
msgstr "卡琳德拉城堡，又回到了现实，摸上去很实在。大部分是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:34
msgid ""
"The Western Tower, warded from both sides. The heretics inside like it that way."
msgstr "西塔，两边都设了防护。里面的异端们就喜欢这样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:35
msgid ""
"A rope hangs from a window near the tower's top. Nobody looks out of the arrow slits."
msgstr "一根绳子从塔顶附近的窗口垂下来。箭孔后面没有人探头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:36
msgid ""
"A brass plate on the door reads NO THIEVES. Under it, scratched: 'ha'."
msgstr "门上的黄铜牌写着“禁止盗贼”。下面有人刻了一句：“哈”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:37
msgid "The Great Eastern Tower. Its lock looks very smug about something."
msgstr "大东塔。它的锁看上去对什么事得意得很。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:38
msgid "The Northern Tower. Over the door: \"Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts\"."
msgstr "北塔。门上写着：“Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:39
msgid "A door in the trunk of the great tree: the Ancient Temple of Bark."
msgstr "巨树树干上的一扇门：树皮古庙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:4
msgid ""
"A dwarf adit propped with red-painted timbers. Somewhere below, a pick rings on stone and a dwarf swears."
msgstr "一条矮人的矿道，用红漆的木头撑着。下面某处，镐头敲在石头上叮当响，一个矮人在骂街。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:40 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:42
msgid "A timbered adit into the mountain."
msgstr "通向山里的一条木架矿道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:43
msgid ""
"Troll Hole. A rough shaft into the dark, with claw marks for a ladder."
msgstr "巨魔洞。一条粗糙的竖井通向黑暗，用爪痕当梯子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:45
msgid "as row 41"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:46
msgid ""
"The ruined tower on the Isle of Lost Souls. Two iron-bound leaves, and stairs going down."
msgstr "迷魂岛上的废塔。两扇铁箍门扇，还有向下的台阶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:47
msgid ""
"Graalg's fort: a stockade of whole tree trunks, sharpened at both ends."
msgstr "格拉尔格的堡寨：用整根树干围成的栅栏，两头都削尖了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:49
msgid ""
"The Great Pyramid. A door of green stone with the Pharaoh's sign on it."
msgstr "大金字塔。一扇绿石门，上面刻着法老的印记。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:50
msgid ""
"A strange craft of curved metal standing in cooled lava. Its hatch is open, as if it had been waiting."
msgstr "一艘弧形金属的奇怪飞行器，立在冷却的熔岩中。它的舱门开着，像是一直在等你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:51
msgid ""
"Castle Alamar. Every window is lit, and every one of them is looking at you."
msgstr "阿拉玛城堡。每扇窗都亮着灯，每一扇窗都在看着你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:52
msgid ""
"A hatch in the castle roof. Scratched on it: The Megadragon has the key!"
msgstr "城堡屋顶上的一个舱口。上面刻着：巨龙拿着钥匙！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:53
msgid ""
"An iron lid over Sandcaster's sewer. The sand has got in, as it gets into everything here."
msgstr "沙堡镇下水道上的一块铁盖。沙子已经钻了进去，就像它钻进这里的一切东西一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:54
msgid ""
"An iron grate in the sand, bolted on this side. Beyond it runs a long tunnel."
msgstr "沙地里的一道铁栅栏，在这一侧上了闩。栅栏后面是一条长长的隧道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:55
msgid ""
"The guild gate. Beyond it, the wizard quarter, and wizards who are sensitive to insults."
msgstr "行会大门。门后是巫师区，里面的巫师受不得侮辱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:56
msgid "The guild's back stair, down to the cellars. Members only."
msgstr "行会的后楼梯，通向地窖。仅限会员。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:57
msgid "A grated shaft down into Lakeside's sewer."
msgstr "通往湖畔镇下水道的一个带栅栏的竖井。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:58
msgid ""
"A crypt stair going down. The draught from below smells of drains and old graves."
msgstr "一道向下的墓穴阶梯。下面吹来的风，带着下水道和老坟的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:59
msgid ""
"A second strange craft, cold to the touch. Its hatch opens on a red-lit airlock."
msgstr "第二艘奇怪的飞行器，摸上去冰凉。它的舱门通向一间红光照着的气闸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:6
msgid ""
"A crooked tower on its rise. The witches fear nothing, and lock nothing. Something inside is bubbling."
msgstr "一座建在小山上的歪塔。女巫们什么都不怕，所以什么也不锁。里面有什么东西在冒泡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:60
msgid ""
"A cave in the crag, its mouth white with droppings. Something up there is watching, very still."
msgstr "峭壁上的一个洞穴，洞口被鸟粪染白。上面有什么东西在盯着你，一动不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:61
msgid ""
"Doors three times your height, with a handle you can reach by standing on each other."
msgstr "三倍于你身高的大门，把手要踩着彼此的肩膀才够得着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:62
msgid ""
"Bosco's Hall. The door stands open; Bosco is expecting company, or not worried about it."
msgstr "博斯科大厅。门开着；博斯科在等客人，或者根本不在乎。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:63
msgid "A marble grate in the road of the gods. Even their sewer is marble."
msgstr "众神之路上的一块大理石栅栏。连他们的下水道都是大理石的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:64
msgid "A stair down under the ruin, where Sheltem's mark has gone out."
msgstr "废墟下的一道阶梯，谢尔特姆的印记已经熄灭。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:65
msgid "The Sphinx's stone jaw stands open on a stair."
msgstr "狮身人面像的石颚张开着，露出一道阶梯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:66
msgid "A tower of black stone, polished like a mirror."
msgstr "一座黑石塔，被打磨得像镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:67
msgid ""
"The Dragon Tower. Two black leaves, warm to the touch, with a keyhole shaped like a dragon's eye."
msgstr "巨龙塔。两扇黑色的门扇，摸上去是温的，锁孔的形状像龙的眼睛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:7
msgid ""
"A cave mouth reeking of smoke and orc. The bones outside are not all animal."
msgstr "一个洞口，散发着烟味和兽人的臭味。外面的骨头并不都是动物的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:8
msgid ""
"The Temple of Yak. Incense, old stone, and something underneath that the incense is there to hide."
msgstr "牛神庙。香火、古石，还有香火想要掩盖的、藏在底下的什么东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:9
msgid ""
"Castle Burlock, the King's seat. The banners are clean, and the guards are not smiling."
msgstr "伯洛克城堡，国王的居所。旗帜很干净，卫兵们都没有笑容。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid "Alacorn of Falista"
msgstr "法利斯塔的独角"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid ""
"The horn of the unicorn Falista, stolen by the witches. Old Valia wants it back."
msgstr "独角兽法利斯塔的角，被女巫们偷走了。老瓦莉娅想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "Coven Key"
msgstr "女巫团钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "The key the witches of the tower carry."
msgstr "塔里的女巫们带着的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "Skeleton Key"
msgstr "万能钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "The key to Darzog's Tower."
msgstr "达佐格之塔的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid "Princess Roxanne's Tiara"
msgstr "罗珊公主的头冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid ""
"Princess Roxanne's tiara, taken by the Rivercity robbers. She wants it back."
msgstr "罗珊公主的头冠，被河城的强盗拿走了。她想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "Robbers' Ring of Keys"
msgstr "强盗钥匙串"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "The robber boss's keys to the den's vault."
msgstr "强盗头子的钥匙，能打开巢穴的金库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid ""
"Barok the Sorcerer's pendant, stolen by the sorceresses. He wants it back."
msgstr "巫师巴洛克的吊坠，被女术士们偷走了。他想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid "Barok's Pendant"
msgstr "巴洛克的吊坠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid "Larder Key"
msgstr "食品室钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid "The Ogre Chieftain's key to his larder."
msgstr "食人妖酋长的食品室钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid "Elixir of Restoration"
msgstr "复原灵药"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid "Mirabeth's cure, kept in the Temple of Yak."
msgstr "米拉贝丝的解药，存放在牛神庙里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:18
msgid "A King's Megacredit, worth a great deal to King Burlock's engineers."
msgstr "一枚国王的兆信用点，对伯洛克国王的工程师们价值不菲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:18
msgid "King's Megacredit"
msgstr "国王兆信用点"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:19
msgid "Library Key"
msgstr "图书馆钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:19
msgid "The key to Darzog's library."
msgstr "达佐格图书馆的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:193
msgid ""
"An impossibly light two-handed sword, the King's experiment, buried under Newcastle. It alone can harm Lord Xeen. (Effects: +15 Might, +15 Endurance, double damage against demons)"
msgstr "一把轻得不可思议的双手剑，是国王的实验品，埋在纽卡斯尔之下。只有它能伤到辛恩领主。（效果：+15 力量，+15 耐力，对恶魔伤害加倍）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:193
msgid "Xeen Slayer Sword"
msgstr "辛恩屠戮者之剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:194
msgid ""
"Ancient and light, it all but flies at the enemy's throat. One of the six Elder weapons; no one knows when or where they were forged. (Effects: +15 Might)"
msgstr "古老而轻盈，几乎是自己扑向敌人的咽喉。六件远古武器之一；没有人知道它们是何时何地锻造的。（效果：+15 力量）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:194
msgid "Elder Long Sword"
msgstr "远古长剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:195
msgid ""
"A long blade with a gilded guard, one of the six Elder weapons. Its owners have all been quick, and most of them unknown. (Effects: +15 Speed)"
msgstr "一柄长刃，剑格镀金，是六件远古武器之一。它的主人都身手敏捷，而且大多数没有留下姓名。（效果：+15 速度）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:195
msgid "Elder Dagger"
msgstr "远古匕首"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:196
msgid "Elder Mace"
msgstr "远古硬头锤"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:196
msgid ""
"It looks like any cleric's mace, but it thrums in the hand. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Endurance)"
msgstr "看上去和任何牧师的硬头锤一样，但握在手里会嗡嗡作响。六件远古武器之一。（效果：+15 耐力）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:197
msgid ""
"A humourless weapon, one of the six Elder weapons. It goes missing for years and turns up in some monster's hoard. (Effects: +15 Accuracy)"
msgstr "一件不苟言笑的武器，六件远古武器之一。它一失踪就是好几年，又会在某个怪物的宝藏里冒出来。（效果：+15 准确）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:197
msgid "Elder Spear"
msgstr "远古长矛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:198
msgid "Elder Staff"
msgstr "远古法杖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:198
msgid ""
"Much more a tool than a weapon: a crystal on a golden shaft that magnifies the wielder's magic. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Intellect, +20 spell points)"
msgstr "与其说是武器，不如说是工具：金杖上嵌着一颗水晶，能放大持杖者的魔力。六件远古武器之一。（效果：+15 智力，+20 魔法值）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:199
msgid ""
"A green and gold bow of exotic woods that no bowyer can make again. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Accuracy)"
