#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:670
msgid "The dial clicks home at nine. Somewhere below, stone grinds level."
msgstr "刻度盘在九点咔嗒一声到位。下面某处，石头隆隆地放平了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:672
msgid "Somewhere below, stone drops away."
msgstr "下面某处，石头塌陷下去了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10000
msgid ""
"Dead Food. It is warm, as the sign asked, and it tastes of the grave. It stays down, and leaves you harder to kill. (+2 Endurance, permanent, for each of you new to it)"
msgstr "死亡食物。它是温的，正如牌子上要求的，味道像坟墓。它能留在肚子里，让你们更难被杀死。（+2 耐力，永久，对每个第一次吃的人生效）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10008
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich rises from his bier. \"And now my hunger for the living compels me to attack you.\""
msgstr "巫妖桑德罗从棺架上坐了起来。“现在，我对活人的饥渴迫使我来攻击你们。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1002
msgid ""
"Darzog sealed his tower with a Skeleton Key, and the Archmage's study atop the Tower of High Magic keeps it for him. The study's key is sold by a talking skull deep in the Cave of Illusion, in the tundra. Skulls take gems, not gold: ten, for that key. Don't ask me what a skull does with a gem."
msgstr "达佐格用万能钥匙封了他的塔，高等魔法之塔顶上大法师的书房替他保管着它。书房的钥匙由冻原上幻象洞穴深处一个会说话的头骨出售。头骨要宝石，不要金币：这把钥匙要十颗。别问我头骨要宝石做什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10027
msgid ""
"In a jar of green glass, in a fluid that should not still be warm: a heart, beating slowly."
msgstr "一只绿玻璃罐子里，泡着一种本不该还是温的液体：里面有一颗心脏，在缓缓跳动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10041
msgid ""
"Sandro: Thank you for returning my heart. I am free of this life. You are welcome to the treasures in this room as well as this key. It opens the way to my old home on the other side of the world, a place now called the Dungeon of Death. Goodbye, brave mortals, and good luck. Remember: Alamar CAN be defeated."
msgstr "桑德罗：谢谢你们把我的心脏还给我。我从这种生命中解脱了。这个房间里的宝物，还有这把钥匙，欢迎你们取走。它能打开通往我在世界另一端的旧居的路，那个地方现在叫死亡地牢。再见，勇敢的凡人们，祝你们好运。记住：阿拉玛是可以被打败的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10053
msgid ""
"Sandro laughs, a dry sound. \"Asked nicely. Very well.\" He shows your casters how the heart is parted from the body, and what it costs. The Priests among you rise as Priests of Dark, the Wizards and Necromancers as Liches."
msgstr "桑德罗干笑了一声。“问得客气。好吧。”他给你们的施法者演示了心脏是如何从身体里分离出来的，以及要付出什么代价。你们当中的牧师成为黑暗主教，巫师和死灵法师成为巫妖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10060
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich stands up out of what is left of him. \"My heart. You have it. Give it to me, and I will be free of this life.\""
msgstr "巫妖桑德罗从残躯里站了起来。“我的心脏。你们拿着它。把它给我，我就能从这种生命中解脱。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10064
msgid ""
"Sandro: Do not come to me without my heart. You have beaten me once, and it changed nothing. Bring the heart."
msgstr "没有我的心脏，别来找我。你们打败过我一次，可这什么也没改变。把心脏带来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10069
msgid ""
"Sandro rises from the floor as if nothing happened. \"I am Sandro, the most accomplished sorcerer to ever live in Xeen. Many years ago I separated my heart from my body to cheat death. It worked, but I am not wholly alive: I am a wretched and evil monster who must kill mortals to remain alive. Retrieve my heart from the sewers below here and I will finally be released, and you may have the treasure in this room.\""
msgstr "桑德罗若无其事地从地上站起来。“我是桑德罗，辛恩有史以来最杰出的巫师。多年前，我为了欺骗死亡，把心脏从身体里分离了出去。这办法管用，但我也不算完全活着：我成了一个凄惨邪恶的怪物，必须杀死凡人才能活下去。去这里下面的下水道里把我的心脏取回来，我就能终于解脱，这个房间里的宝物也归你们。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10078
msgid ""
"The wheel turns with a groan. Down the culvert, a gate grinds up out of the water."
msgstr "轮子吱呀转动。涵洞那头，一道闸门从水里升了上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1009 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4381
msgid "Passes"
msgstr "通行证"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10095
msgid ""
"Correct! You have solved my riddle. Please take the magical things that I have left in the care of these enchanted boulders. Be sure to visit the other boulders for their treasure. The boulder crumbles to sand and leaves behind a suit of golden plate."
msgstr "答对了！你解开了我的谜语。请取走我留在这些魔法巨石看管下的魔法物品。记得去看看其他巨石，那里也有宝物。巨石化作沙子崩塌，留下一套金甲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10101
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder says nothing. It is, after all, a boulder."
msgstr "魔法巨石什么也没说。毕竟，它只是一块巨石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10141
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10157 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10189
msgid "Where the boulder stood there is only sand."
msgstr "巨石原来的地方，只剩下沙子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1011
msgid "You've got one. I don't do refunds, and I don't do two."
msgstr "你已经有一张了。我不退款，也不卖第二张。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10147
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10195
msgid ""
"The boulder crumbles to sand and leaves behind something the paladin left in its care."
msgstr "巨石化作沙子崩塌，留下了圣武士托付给它的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10118
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My first is in apple and also in pear."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第一个字母在 apple 里，也在 pear 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10134
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My second is in cave and also in lair."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第二个字母在 cave 里，也在 lair 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1015
msgid ""
"One pass into Castleview, signed by the Mayor himself. Well, by someone. A thousand gold, and the guards never look past the seal."
msgstr "一张通往堡景镇的通行证，镇长亲笔签名。嗯，是某个人签的。一千金币，卫兵看到印章就不会再往下查了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10150
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My third is in fable and also in tale."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第三个字母在 fable 里，也在 tale 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10166
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fourth is in lark and also in quail."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第四个字母在 lark 里，也在 quail 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10182
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fifth is in wind but not in gale."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第五个字母在 wind 里，但不在 gale 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10198
msgid ""
"The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My sixth is in glimpse and also in sight."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的第六个字母在 glimpse 里，也在 sight 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1020
msgid ""
"A pass is a thousand gold. Come back when you have it. The gremlins won't, if that's what you're hoping."
msgstr "一张通行证一千金币。有钱再来。地精可不会有，要是你指望这个的话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10204
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My last is in night but not in light."
msgstr "魔法巨石开口了：我的最后一个字母在 night 里，但不在 light 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10210
msgid ""
"A weathered sign reads: A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr "一块风化的牌子上写着：一位垂死的圣武士把他所有的魔法盔甲交给了这片土地上的魔法巨石保管。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10221
msgid ""
"A throne of black horn stands where every corridor ends. Whoever reaches it has walked the labyrinth. The Minotaurs among you sit, and rise as lords of the maze."
msgstr "每条走廊的尽头，都立着一座黑角王座。谁能到达这里，谁就走完了迷宫。你们当中的牛头人坐下，起身时成为迷宫之主。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10237
msgid "The Minotaur sits, and rises a lord of the maze."
msgstr "牛头人坐了下去，起身时成了迷宫之主。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10229
msgid ""
"The horned throne waits. It honours Minotaurs, and anyone else who sits gets a sore back."
msgstr "有角的王座在等着。它认牛头人，别人坐上去只会腰酸背痛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1025
msgid ""
"Still have it? Good. Keep it away from my herbs. The mint went purple."
msgstr "还留着？好。别让它靠近我的草药。薄荷都变紫了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10274
msgid "The Megadragon is dead. The sky is a little quieter."
msgstr "巨龙死了。天空安静了一点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1028
msgid ""
"Something fell out of the sky last month and made a crater by the river. In the middle was this orb. It glows, it hums, and it looks at me. I don't want it. Take it to Madame Oorla; she reads things like that."
msgstr "上个月有东西从天上掉下来，在河边砸出个坑。坑中间就是这颗圆球。它会发光，会嗡嗡响，还会盯着我看。我不想要它。拿去给乌拉夫人吧；她会看这种东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10283
msgid ""
"The Megadragon's key turns in the lock and stays there. The hatch swings down."
msgstr "巨龙的钥匙在锁里转了转就卡住了。舱口向下打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10292
msgid ""
"\"Die selfish scum!\" The genie's bolt finds the one who spoke, and leaves just enough of you to regret it."
msgstr "“去死吧，自私的渣滓！”精灵的闪电找到了说话的那个人，只留下刚好够你后悔的一口气。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10300
msgid ""
"\"Your throne awaits!\" You sit down on it. You will be sitting on it for some time: you are made of stone."
msgstr "“你的王座在等你！”你坐了上去。你会在上面坐上很长时间：你变成石头了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10310
msgid ""
"\"How noble. I hate noble.\" The genie strikes you down, and your friends feel wiser for watching. (+500 experience)"
msgstr "“多么高尚。我讨厌高尚。”精灵把你击倒，你的朋友们看了反而觉得更有智慧了。（+500 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1034
msgid ""
"Let me see... This orb belongs to the Dragon Pharaoh, in his pyramid in the desert. But first it must see Ellinger, the Queen's wizard. He locked himself in his tower with traps, so you will need his key, and at the top his tower will ask whom you seek: say his name, 'Ellinger'."
msgstr "让我看看……这颗圆球属于沙漠金字塔里的龙法老。但它得先见见女王的巫师埃林格。他把自己锁在布满陷阱的塔里，所以你们需要他的钥匙，到了塔顶，塔会问你们找谁：说出他的名字，“埃林格”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10381
msgid ""
"The gold is in your hands for one moment. \"Now that I have my powers back I've decided to teach you not to be so greedy. I'm taking my gold back, plus interest!\""
msgstr "金子在你手里只待了片刻。“现在我的力量回来了，我决定教教你别那么贪心。我要把我的金子拿回去，还要加上利息！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10388
msgid ""
"\"Well here, why don't we share it, since neither of us seem to be greedy.\" (5,000 gold)"
msgstr "“好吧，我们分了它怎么样，反正我们俩都不贪心。”（5,000 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10396
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers. Things you never studied are suddenly familiar. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr "精灵打了个响指。你们从没学过的东西，忽然变得熟悉了。（+2,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10412
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers, and ten gems roll out of the lamp, still warm."
msgstr "精灵打了个响指，十颗宝石从灯里滚了出来，还是温的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10419
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers, and gold pours out of the lamp's spout until it doesn't. (10,000 gold)"
msgstr "精灵打了个响指，金币从灯嘴里哗哗地流出来，直到流干为止。（10,000 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10427
msgid ""
"Marble steps down into running water. Even the gods' drains are marble."
msgstr "大理石台阶通向流动的水。连众神的下水道都是大理石的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10437
msgid ""
"Under the straw tick, something Cyrano has not got round to selling yet."
msgstr "稻草垫子下面，有西拉诺还没来得及卖掉的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1044
msgid "The orb"
msgstr "圆球"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10452
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: BL"
msgstr "你找到半张字条，上面写着：BL"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1046
msgid ""
"The Pharaoh's orb wants to go home, but first it must see Ellinger. I don't make the rules. The orb does."
msgstr "法老的圆球想回家，但它得先见见埃林格。规矩不是我定的。是圆球定的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10464 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10467
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: ES"
msgstr "你找到半张字条，上面写着：ES"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10479 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10482
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: IB"
msgstr "你找到半张字条，上面写着：IB"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10494 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10497
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: TR"
msgstr "你找到半张字条，上面写着：TR"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10503
msgid "Search the drains."
msgstr "搜一搜下水道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10515
msgid "Correct! You may pass."
msgstr "答对了！你们可以过去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10521
msgid "Wrong! You may not pass!"
msgstr "错了！你们不能过去！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10527
msgid "The Drawkcab Monks study the Palindrome."
msgstr "倒序僧侣研究回文。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1054
msgid "Fortune"
msgstr "命运"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10544
msgid "'Correct,' says a voice behind the door. 'Come in. Ni emoc.'"
msgstr "“对，”门后的声音说。“请进。Ni emoc。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10550
msgid ""
"WRONG!!! You call yourself a Drawkcab. You know nothing of the Drawkcab! Go to the monks for further enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr "错！！！你还敢自称倒序僧！你对倒序僧一无所知！去找僧侣们好好开开悟，等你觉得自己准备好了再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10559
msgid ""
"P, I, T, C, H, F, O, R, K. The last lid drops. A pitchfork, spelled in chests."
msgstr "P、I、T、C、H、F、O、R、K。最后一个盖子合上了。用箱子拼出了一把干草叉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1056
msgid ""
"I see a bird in a cage on an island, and a sad man in a castle. Free the one and the other will smile."
msgstr "我看见一只鸟关在岛上的笼子里，还有一个伤心的人在城堡里。放了一个，另一个就会笑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10568
msgid ""
"The ninth lid drops shut with a satisfying clunk. Nine closed chests. Somewhere, Dyson nods."
msgstr "第九个盖子“咔嗒”一声合上了，很是痛快。九个箱子全都关好了。不知哪里，戴森点了点头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10579
msgid ""
"Rooka the Queen Rat is dead. Down the tunnel, someone in a bed cheers."
msgstr "鼠后鲁卡死了。隧道那头，床上的人欢呼起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10594
msgid ""
"You find a diploma that reads: Valio Magnus, graduated 787 cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio smiles simply."
msgstr "你找到一张文凭，上面写着：瓦利奥·马格努斯，787 年以优异成绩毕业于邪恶巫术学院。瓦利奥憨憨地笑了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10598
msgid ""
"You hear Valio (the peasant hiding in the bed) yell, 'Hey, that's MY chest. Leave it alone!' You open it anyway. Inside, a diploma: Valio Magnus, cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio gets out of bed."
msgstr "你听见瓦利奥（躲在床上的农夫）大喊：“喂，那是我的箱子。别碰！”你还是打开了它。里面有一张文凭：瓦利奥·马格努斯，优异成绩，邪恶巫术学院。瓦利奥从床上爬了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1060
msgid ""
"I see the castle growing back, stone by stone. More disks. Always more disks."
msgstr "我看见城堡一块石头一块石头地长回来了。还要更多的盘。总是需要更多的盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10616
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and it crackles on the way down. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "喷泉。水清凉爽口，一路下咽还噼啪作响。（+5 风系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10628
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, with a bitter end that your stomach decides to like. (+5 Body resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "喷泉。水清凉爽口，回味带点苦，你的胃却决定喜欢它。（+5 体魄抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1064
msgid ""
"I see little round things that hum. Twenty of them. Gremlins, sprites, ogres, the towers. Ellinger counts them."
msgstr "我看见一些圆圆的小东西在嗡嗡作响。二十个。地精、小精灵、食人妖、塔楼。埃林格在数它们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10640
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and the heat of the tower seems to step back from you. (+5 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "喷泉。水清凉爽口，塔里的热气似乎也往后退了几步。（+5 火系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10652
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and colder than it looks. (+5 Water resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "喷泉。水清凉爽口，比看上去还要冷。（+5 水系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10664 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10676
msgid ""
"The key turns and the heretics' wards on the door die with a small, sulky pop."
msgstr "钥匙转动，门上异端们的结界“啪”的一声小小的、闷闷不乐地消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1068
msgid ""
"I see a tower full of traps and a man at the top who loves his boots. Go up."
msgstr "我看见一座布满陷阱的塔，塔顶有个爱他的靴子的人。上去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10685 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10705
msgid "Thank you for sparing my life. I shall be going now."
msgstr "谢谢你们饶我一命。我这就告辞。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10696
msgid ""
"Disc. Two of them, Energy Disks, set in the alcoves like offerings. Mok will not miss them."
msgstr "圆盘。两块，能量盘，像供品一样摆在壁龛里。莫克不会发现少了它们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10719
msgid ""
"Hand over hand, past the arrow slits. Nobody looks out. The window at the top is open: heretics trust their wards, not their windows."
msgstr "手脚并用地攀过一个个箭孔。没有人往外看。塔顶的窗口开着：异端们相信的是结界，不是窗户。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1072
msgid ""
"I see a woman who lost her necklace to the rats under the town, and holds a key she doesn't need. Nadia."
msgstr "我看见一个女人，她的项链被镇子下面的老鼠偷了，手里还攥着一把她用不着的钥匙。娜迪亚。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10725 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:143
msgid ""
"Split and cold. Whatever hatched here was eaten by whatever lives here now."
msgstr "裂开了，一片冰冷。在这里孵出来的东西，已经被现在住在这里的东西吃掉了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10748
msgid "The mountains are full. Empty them first."
msgstr "山里已经满了。先把它们清空。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1075
msgid "I see an orb. Somebody nearby has one. Zelda, the herbalist."
msgstr "我看见一颗圆球。附近有人有一颗。药草师泽尔达。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10752
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals refills the mines for 10,000 gold. Minerals are not cheap. Gods are worse."
msgstr "矿物之神收一万金币给矿场重新填满。矿物不便宜。神更贵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10760
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals takes your gold, which is, after all, a mineral. Somewhere in the rock, veins knit shut and fill again."
msgstr "矿物之神收下了你的金币，毕竟那也是一种矿物。岩石里的矿脉不知在何处愈合，又重新填满了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10788
msgid "You found an emerald handle."
msgstr "你找到了一个翡翠柄。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1080
msgid ""
"My necklace! It still smells of sewer, but it's mine. Here, for your trouble. And Ellinger owes me a favour. Tell him Nadia sent you."
msgstr "我的项链！上面还有下水道的味道，不过是我的。给，这是你们的辛苦费。埃林格还欠我一个人情。告诉他是娜迪亚派你来的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10816
msgid ""
"Monga Melons, three of them, ripe. Something with a great many legs objects."
msgstr "蒙加甜瓜，三个，熟透了。有一个很多腿的东西表示反对。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10823
msgid ""
"The countless futures of the Dragon stream into your brain like fire licking at tender wood. You break its grip before you are destroyed, and can only mutter the words: The possibilities are unlimited."
msgstr "巨龙无数的未来，像火舌舔着嫩木一样涌进你的脑海。你在被毁掉之前挣脱了它的掌控，只能喃喃地说出这句话：可能性是无穷的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10828
msgid ""
"The lock is instantaneous, and endless futures flash before you. The mortal shell you wear cannot hold what the mind now sees. Fire flares in your head, and the link breaks just in time."
msgstr "联结是瞬间的，无尽的未来在你眼前闪过。你这副凡人躯壳承受不了心灵所见。头脑里火光迸发，联结在最后一刻断开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10835
msgid ""
"As your mind links with the Dragon's, its knowledge fills your brain with fire. You break the link before it is overloaded, weak and drained, and find yourself saying one phrase over and over: The knowledge is limitless."
msgstr "当你的心灵与巨龙相连，它的知识像火一样灌满你的大脑。你在超载之前切断了联结，虚弱而疲惫，发现自己在反复念叨一句话：知识是无限的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10840
msgid ""
"As your mind links with the Dragon you feel its knowledge combine with your own. Your feeble mind tries to absorb the new wisdom but is found lacking. You tear yourself away, your head ringing."
msgstr "当你的心灵与巨龙相连，你感觉它的知识与你自己的融合在一起。你那孱弱的头脑想要吸收这新的智慧，却力不从心。你挣脱出来，脑袋嗡嗡作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10847
msgid ""
"The past of the Dragon fills your brain, faster and faster, towards the creation of time and beyond. You break the link in a desperate attempt at self preservation, and the words tumble from your lips: The history is endless."
msgstr "巨龙的过去越来越快地涌进你的脑海，直奔时间的创造，乃至更远。你为了保命拼命切断联结，话语脱口而出：历史是无尽的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10852
msgid ""
"Images of times long past fill your mind, and you watch worlds being uncreated. You try to break free from the grip of the Dragon and only just manage it. Your body aches as if something had been trying to leave it."
msgstr "久远年代的画面充满你的头脑，你看着一个个世界被抹除。你试图挣脱巨龙的掌控，勉强做到了。你全身酸痛，仿佛有什么东西曾想离开你的身体。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10859 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10872 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10885
msgid "Dragon Power Crystal. It has nothing more for you."
msgstr "龙之力水晶。它对你们已经没有更多可给的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10865
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+3,000 experience)"
msgstr "龙之水晶的力量以几乎致命的冲击涌入你的身体。你的身体能够吸收一部分神秘能量。（+3,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10878
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+4,000 experience)"
msgstr "龙之水晶的力量以几乎致命的冲击涌入你的身体。你的身体能够吸收一部分神秘能量。（+4,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10891
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+5,000 experience)"
msgstr "龙之水晶的力量以几乎致命的冲击涌入你的身体。你的身体能够吸收一部分神秘能量。（+5,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1090
msgid "The rats have it down there somewhere. Big rats. Organised rats."
msgstr "老鼠就把它放在下面某处。大老鼠。有组织的老鼠。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10903
msgid ""
"You lift one of the eggs out of the nest. It is heavy, leathery and warm, and something inside it turns over."
msgstr "你从巢里拿起一枚蛋。它沉甸甸的，有皮革的质感，摸上去温热，里面有什么东西翻了个身。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10910
msgid "The flask has been drained. By you, as it happens."
msgstr "烧瓶已经空了。说起来，是你喝的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10915
msgid ""
"Potion. It is thick, bitter and faintly warm, and your bones seem to set harder as it goes down. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr "药水。又稠又苦，还微微发温，咽下去的时候，你的骨头似乎变得更结实了。（+2 耐力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10929
msgid ""
"\"Very good, mortals!\" The Eye of the Dragon closes, and opens again on a crystal set in a golden shaft: the Elder Staff."
msgstr "“很好，凡人们！”巨龙之眼合上，又在一块嵌在金杖上的水晶处睁开：远古法杖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1093
msgid ""
"The rats came up the drain and took my onyx necklace right off the dresser. They live in the sewers under town. Bring it back and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr "老鼠顺着排水沟爬上来，把我梳妆台上的缟玛瑙项链叼走了。它们住在镇子下面的下水道里。把它找回来，我不会亏待你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10936
msgid "\"Die fools!\""
msgstr "“去死吧，蠢货！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10942
msgid ""
"A note amongst the bones reads: You have to be pretty smart to survive a look in one of the crystal balls on the Dragon Cloud."
msgstr "骨头堆里有一张字条，上面写着：想在巨龙云上的水晶球前看一眼还能活下来，你得相当聪明才行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10948
msgid ""
"A note amongst the bones reads: The eye of the Dragon holds the Elder Staff."
msgstr "骨头堆里有一张字条，上面写着：巨龙之眼里藏着远古法杖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10954
msgid ""
"You find a note amongst the bones that was part of this dead adventurer's diary. It reads: I think the secret of the dragon has something to do with forever, or really, really big..."
msgstr "你在骨头堆里找到一张字条，是这位死去冒险者日记的一页。上面写着：我觉得巨龙的秘密跟永远有关，或者跟非常、非常大有关……"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10960
msgid ""
"You find a note amongst the bones that was part of this dead adventurer's diary. It reads: I don't trust that druid guy. He seemed too eager to get his hands on a dragon egg, and he sure didn't look like he had ten million gold pieces!"
msgstr "你在骨头堆里找到一张字条，是这位死去冒险者日记的一页。上面写着：我不信任那个德鲁伊。他太急着想弄到一枚龙蛋，而且看他的样子，可不像有一千万金币的人！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10968
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: FI"
msgstr "你破译了奇怪的龙之符文，被碑文的简单弄得一头雾水：FI"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10976
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: IN"
msgstr "你破译了奇怪的龙之符文，被碑文的简单弄得一头雾水：IN"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10984
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: NI"
msgstr "你破译了奇怪的龙之符文，被碑文的简单弄得一头雾水：NI"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10992
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: TY"
msgstr "你破译了奇怪的龙之符文，被碑文的简单弄得一头雾水：TY"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10999
msgid "You learn nothing new from the Tome."
msgstr "你从这本书里没有学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1100
msgid "Necklace"
msgstr "项链"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11004
msgid ""
"Tome of Great Experience. You read it cover to cover, and several of its chapters read you. (+4,000 experience)"
msgstr "大经验之书。你从头读到尾，有几章还反过来读了你。（+4,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11012
msgid ""
"The black key turns with a sound like a sigh. The gate of the Dragon Tower swings in on warm air."
msgstr "黑钥匙转动，发出一声叹息般的声音。巨龙塔的大门在暖风中向里打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1102
msgid "I wear it every day now, and I don't go near the drains."
msgstr "我现在天天戴着它，而且再也不靠近下水道了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11038
msgid ""
"Well of Fantastic Skill. The water is cool and refreshing, and for a while everything seems easy. (+20 to every statistic until you rest)"
msgstr "奇妙技能之井。水清凉爽口，有一阵子，一切似乎都变得很简单。（所有属性 +20，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1112
msgid ""
"Welcome. I'm sorry you had to run the gauntlet; my defenses keep Alamar's spies from my door. I see that you hold the Dragon Pharaoh's orb. Without it he cannot fight Alamar, and you must return it to him. But he has sealed his pyramid, and the key is in Queen Kalindra's castle, which Alamar moved out of phase when he took the Queen. Twenty energy discs will bring it back, five at a time. Bring them to me. And here is a little something: your gifts are in the chest that runs away from you in the south-west of Castleview. I will tell it to stay still."
msgstr "欢迎。很抱歉你们要闯过这道关；我的防御是为了不让阿拉玛的间谍找上门。我看到你们拿着龙法老的圆球。没有它，他无法与阿拉玛作战，你们必须把它还给他。可他封了自己的金字塔，钥匙在卡琳德拉女王的城堡里，而阿拉玛抓走女王时，把城堡移出了现实。二十块能量盘能把它带回来，每次五块。把它们带给我。还有一点小心意：你们的礼物在堡景镇西南角那只躲着你们跑的箱子里。我会叫它站着别动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11134
msgid ""
"You try to open the lid of the coffin, but it is too heavy and you are too weak. From inside, someone turns over."
msgstr "你想打开棺材盖，可它太重，你又太虚弱。里面有人翻了个身。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11146
msgid ""
"You may pass. For completing the puzzle, here is your reward. (+6,000 experience)"
msgstr "你们可以过去。完成谜题的奖励在这里。（+6,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11158
msgid ""
"The Key to the Dungeon of Death turns in the skull's eye. The black iron door opens on a stair, and a smell of old incense and older dust comes up it."
msgstr "死亡地牢钥匙在头骨的眼窝里转动。黑铁门打开，露出一道楼梯，一股陈年香火和更陈的灰尘味从里面升上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11164
msgid "The gongs fall silent."
msgstr "锣声沉寂了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11176
msgid ""
"You pull the four cores out of the Lord Xeen Machine one by one. It shudders, sparks and stops. Somewhere a great many lights go out, and nothing else happens, which is how you know it worked. (+10,000 experience)"
msgstr "你一个个拔出辛恩领主机器的四颗核心。它颤抖着，冒着火花，然后停了。不知哪里，许多灯灭了，别的什么也没发生，这正是你知道成功了的原因。（+10,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11182
msgid ""
"You find a note that reads: Gone to Necropolis, will return soon. Please keep the place clean. I've de-activated most of the defenses so that you and your friends can roam around freely. The vampires have requested their privacy, so leave them alone. Have fun... (signed) Sandro"
msgstr "你找到一张字条，上面写着：去亡灵之城了，很快回来。请保持这里整洁。我已经关闭了大部分防御，你和你的朋友们可以随意走动。吸血鬼们要求隐私，别去打扰他们。玩得开心……（签名）桑德罗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11192
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Great Evil shatters with a sound like a scream cut short. (+3,000 experience)"
msgstr "大恶之圣坛碎裂了，发出一声戛然而止的尖叫。（+3,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1120
msgid ""
"You climbed my tower without the Pharaoh's orb? Then you are either very brave or very lost. Come back when you hold it."
msgstr "你没带法老的圆球就爬上了我的塔？那你们要么非常勇敢，要么非常迷路。拿到了再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11202
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Lesser Evil breaks apart. The air in the gallery is easier to breathe. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr "次恶之圣坛碎成几块。长廊里的空气顺畅了些。（+2,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11212
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Minor Evil cracks and falls in. Something small and spiteful goes out of the room. (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr "小恶之圣坛裂开塌陷。有什么渺小而恶毒的东西离开了这个房间。（+1,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11221
msgid ""
"You destroy the shrine, which destroys this dungeon, taking you with it."
msgstr "你摧毁了圣坛，也就摧毁了这座地牢，连你一起埋了进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11232
msgid ""
"The screen flashes with the response: CODE ACCEPTED. WELCOME, OPERATOR. Somewhere below, a great many fans slow down. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr "屏幕闪出回应：验证通过。欢迎你，操作员。下面某处，许多风扇慢了下来。（+2,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11239
msgid "The screen flashes with the response: You are a SUPER Goober!"
msgstr "屏幕闪出回应：你是个超级笨蛋！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11243
msgid "The screen flashes with the response: You are a Goober!"
msgstr "屏幕闪出回应：你是个笨蛋！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11249
msgid ""
"Prisoner list. One Lich, known as Vexor the Black, to be held indefinitely, for the crime of Necromancy. One Lich, known as Clemon the Dead, the same. One Lich, known as Saxar the Permanent, the same. One Lich, known as Morgrath the Grey, the same. One Lich, known as Ulvane the Unrepentant, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Iron Vithnipravad, to be held until proper reburial can be arranged. One Bone Dragon, formerly Argonax, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Drothnavod the Weighty (A.K.A. Scraps), the same."
msgstr "囚犯名单。巫妖一名，称“黑暗的维克索”，因死灵术之罪无限期关押。巫妖一名，称“死者克莱蒙”，同上。巫妖一名，称“永恒的萨克萨”，同上。巫妖一名，称“灰色的摩格拉斯”，同上。巫妖一名，称“不知悔改的乌尔文”，同上。骨龙一名，前身为铁维斯尼普拉瓦德，待安排妥当重新安葬前关押。骨龙一名，前身为阿尔戈纳克斯，同上。骨龙一名，前身为沉重的德罗斯纳沃德（又名碎屑），同上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11258
msgid ""
"The last lich comes apart like a dropped bundle of kindling. The cells are quiet, for the first time since the castle came back."
msgstr "最后一个巫妖像一捆被扔下的柴火一样散了架。自城堡回来以后，牢房里第一次安静了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4429
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4661 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4669 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:193
msgid "Alamar"
msgstr "阿拉玛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11274
msgid ""
"The last drum burns, and the caves fall silent but for dripping water. Without their drums the warband's raiders will not ride out again. Oslo will want to hear of it."
msgstr "最后一面鼓烧毁了，洞穴里只剩下滴水声。没有了鼓，战团的劫掠者不会再出来了。奥斯陆会想听到这个消息的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1128
msgid ""
"The castle can be restored to our world by casting certain complex spells powered by energy discs. Energy discs are rare magical batteries. I recently used the last of mine protecting this tower, and I haven't a clue where others may be found. Every five will restore a fourth part of the castle."
msgstr "通过施放某些由能量盘驱动的复杂法术，城堡可以回到我们的世界。能量盘是稀有的魔法电池。我最近用掉了最后一块来保护这座塔，而且我不知道还有哪里能找到。每五块能恢复城堡的四分之一。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11284
msgid ""
"A skinny farm boy scrambles to his feet. \"You came! I'm Tam, Oslo's son. They were going to sell me back to Pa for every cow he's got. I can climb out myself now. I'll run straight home and tell him!\" He swarms up the rope ladder and is gone."
msgstr "一个瘦巴巴的农家男孩手忙脚乱地爬起来。“你们来了！我是塔姆，奥斯陆的儿子。他们本想拿我向爸爸要走他所有的牛。现在我自己能爬出去了。我这就跑回家告诉他！”他顺着绳梯嗖地爬上去不见了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11294
msgid "You found some money growing on this tree!"
msgstr "你在这棵树上发现了一些长出来的钱！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11300
msgid "Pest control by Joe"
msgstr "乔的灭虫服务"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11306
msgid "This space for rent"
msgstr "此处招租"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11312
msgid "If you can read this ad, so can your customers."
msgstr "你能读到这条广告，你的顾客也能。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11318
msgid "REAL adventurers try Deep Mine Alpha!"
msgstr "真正的冒险者都去深矿阿尔法！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11324
msgid "Mountains in your way? Try due N."
msgstr "山挡路了？往正北走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11330
msgid "School of Navigation 9N"
msgstr "航海学校 9N"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11339
msgid "What did you expect, money?"
msgstr "你还指望什么，钱吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:485 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:491
msgid "You ruin their food, burn their tents, and poison their water."
msgstr "你毁了他们的粮食，烧了他们的帐篷，还给他们的水下了毒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11356
msgid ""
"The encampment burns to the sound of distant howls of anger and frustration."
msgstr "营地在远处愤怒又沮丧的嚎叫声中燃烧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11362
msgid "Asp-->"
msgstr "毒蛇镇-->"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11368
msgid ""
"Every caravan adds a stone for luck on the crossing. You add yours, and feel luckier for it. (+Luck, until you rest)"
msgstr "每支商队过沙漠都会添一块石头祈运。你也添上一块，感觉运气好了些。（+运气，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11374
msgid ""
"Your stone is already on the cairn. Piling on more would be greed, and the desert notices greed."
msgstr "你的石头已经在石堆上了。再堆就是贪心，而沙漠会留意贪心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1138
msgid ""
"Have I taken the time to tell you that you are doing a wonderful job? All of you. I mean it. These discs will free the second level of the castle from Alamar's curse. Perhaps you will find more on the newly restored section."
msgstr "我有没有抽空告诉你们，你们干得很棒？你们所有人。我是认真的。这些盘能把城堡的第二层从阿拉玛的诅咒里解放出来。也许你们会在刚恢复的部分找到更多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11380
msgid ""
"The urn is full of sand and old coins. Saul says the coins are for the sand."
msgstr "瓮里装满了沙子和旧硬币。索尔说，硬币是用来买沙子的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11386
msgid ""
"The Summer Druid's stones are warm long after dark. Their heat sinks into you. (+Fire resistance, until you rest)"
msgstr "夏之德鲁伊的石头在天黑很久以后仍是温热的。它们的热气渗进你的身体。（+火系抗性，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11392
msgid "The stones are warm, but you have had your share of their heat."
msgstr "石头是温的，但你已经领受过它们的热量了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11400
msgid ""
"You lift the bar from the desert side, and the yard gate swings open. Beyond it a coach waits, its driver asleep under a sign: WARZONE. ALL COMERS."
msgstr "你从沙漠这一侧抬起横杆，院门打开了。门外停着一辆马车，车夫睡在一块牌子下面：战区。来者不拒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11413
msgid ""
"A demon and a devil, carved in black rock. The demon's eye sockets are empty. Their skulls are not here; someone has scratched an arrow pointing inside."
msgstr "一个恶魔和一个魔鬼，雕在黑岩上。恶魔的眼窝是空的。它们的头骨不在这儿；有人刻了一个箭头指向里面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11424
msgid "The Outpost burns well. The orcs will not be coming back to it."
msgstr "前哨站烧得很旺。兽人不会再回来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11430
msgid ""
"Shrine of Fire. You pray, and the heat of the mountain seems to turn away from you. (+10 Fire resistance, until you rest)"
msgstr "火之圣坛。你祈祷，山里的热气似乎从你身边转开了。（+10 火系抗性，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11436
msgid "You don't think anyone is listening."
msgstr "你觉得没有人在听。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11442
msgid ""
"A note nailed by the pay chest: \"The dragons came south. Pay owed to the end of the month. Nobody stays.\""
msgstr "发薪箱旁钉着一张字条：“龙都往南去了。薪水欠到月底。没人留下。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11448
msgid ""
"Well of Speed. The water is gone from the cup before you know you have drunk it. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "速度之井。杯里的水在你意识到自己喝了之前就没了。（+2 速度，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11468
msgid ""
"The statue's stone mouth moves: \"I dub all who find me 'Super Explorer'.\" You feel lighter on your feet. +2 Speed."
msgstr "雕像的石嘴动了：“我授予所有找到我的人‘超级探险家’称号。”你感觉脚步轻快了些。+2 速度。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11478 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11488
msgid ""
"Bones, feathers and stolen trinkets go up together. The harpies will nest somewhere lower."
msgstr "骨头、羽毛和偷来的小玩意儿一起烧了起来。鹰身女妖会去更低的地方筑巢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11498
msgid ""
"The nest burns, and the smoke drifts down through a gap in the cloud toward Vertigo."
msgstr "巢烧了起来，烟从云缝间飘向眩晕镇。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1150
msgid ""
"Excellent work. You have brought enough discs to restore the first level of the castle. Go to the castle as soon as you can. Perhaps you will find more energy discs inside."
msgstr "干得漂亮。你们带来的盘足够恢复城堡的第一层了。尽快去城堡吧。也许你们会在里面找到更多能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11504
msgid ""
"The clouds hold under your feet. Far ahead, past the rocs, stand the black walls of Castle Xeen, and between here and there someone has set up a carnival."
msgstr "云层在你脚下托住了你。远处，大鹏鸟后面，立着辛恩城堡的黑色城墙，而在这里与那里之间，有人搭起了一座嘉年华。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11511
msgid "The great Castle Xeen recently stood here."
msgstr "伟大的辛恩城堡不久前还立在这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11521
msgid ""
"The nest goes up, and the aviary's rocs scream at you from every perch."
msgstr "巢烧了起来，鸟舍里的大鹏鸟在每根栖木上朝你尖叫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11531
msgid ""
"The nest goes up. A roc's egg cracks in the heat, and nothing comes out of it any more."
msgstr "巢烧了起来。一枚大鹏鸟蛋在热气中裂开，里面再也孵不出什么了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11541
msgid ""
"The last nest burns. Lord Xeen will have to buy his rocs somewhere else."
msgstr "最后一个巢烧完了。辛恩领主得到别处去买他的大鹏鸟了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11551 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11561
msgid ""
"Sticks the size of spars, eggshells the size of shields, and the bones of things that flew too near. It all burns."
msgstr "像桅杆一样粗的树枝，像盾牌一样大的蛋壳，还有飞得太近的东西的骨头。全都烧了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11569 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11586 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11603
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11637 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11654
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:138
msgid ""
"A gust of wind strikes you from the statue's hands. It is kept for Crusaders."
msgstr "一阵风从雕像的手中吹向你。它是留给十字军的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11573 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11590 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11607
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11624 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11641 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11658
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:135
msgid "The statue's hands are empty."
msgstr "雕像的手是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11578 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11595 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11612
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11629 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11663
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:144
msgid "The statue's open hands hold a gift for a Crusader."
msgstr "雕像摊开的手里，有一份给十字军的礼物。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1163
msgid ""
"Good, good. More discs. I still need five to restore level two of the castle. Keep the discs with you and come back when you have them."
msgstr "好，好。又有盘了。我还需要五块来恢复城堡的第二层。把盘带在身上，凑齐了再来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11669
msgid "Xeen's Aviary"
msgstr "辛恩的鸟舍"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1167
msgid ""
"Ahh! I see you have energy discs for me! I will need five to power the spells that will restore the first level of the castle. Keep the discs with you and return when you have at least five. The world of Xeen is counting on you."
msgstr "啊！我看到你们给我带了能量盘！我需要五块来驱动法术，恢复城堡的第一层。把盘带在身上，至少凑齐五块再回来。辛恩世界指望着你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11675
msgid "Danger! Go back!"
msgstr "危险！快回去！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11687
msgid "Now entering Xeendom"
msgstr "现在进入辛恩国度"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11694
msgid ""
"The Book of Languages: a grammar of every tongue of Cloudside, from the dwarves' runes to the gremlins' squeaks. Someone has underlined 'Please' and 'Thank you' in all of them."
msgstr "《语言之书》：云侧各种语言的语法，从矮人的符文到地精的吱吱声。有人在每一种语言里都给“请”和“谢谢”画了线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11700
msgid ""
"The Book of Languages: a grammar of every tongue of Cloudside, from the dwarves' runes to the gremlins' squeaks. Someone has underlined 'Please' and 'Thank you' in all of them. An afternoon with it, and the old runes on the cloud statues will make sense to you. (Linguist)"
msgstr "《语言之书》：云侧各种语言的语法，从矮人的符文到地精的吱吱声。有人在每一种语言里都给“请”和“谢谢”画了线。花一下午读它，云上雕像的古老符文就能看懂了。（语言学家）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11711
msgid "You teleported into the air outside the tower!"
msgstr "你传送到了塔外的半空中！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11717
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, today is the first day of the rest of your life."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：记住，今天是你余生的第一天。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1172
msgid ""
"No discs? Well, don't worry. When Alamar destroys the world, you won't be the only ones to die. Millions will go with you. That must be comforting."
msgstr "没有盘？好吧，别担心。等阿拉玛毁灭世界的时候，死的不会只有你们。还有数百万人陪你们一起。想想也是种安慰。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11723
msgid "The plaque reads: Don't worry, be happy."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：别担心，要快乐。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11729
msgid "The plaque reads: King Burlock's ceremonial armor."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：伯洛克国王的礼仪盔甲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11735
msgid "The plaque reads: Have a nice day."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：祝你有愉快的一天。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11741
msgid "The plaque reads: Prince Roland's ceremonial armor."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：罗兰王子的礼仪盔甲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11747
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Peasant's choice award--Best Ruler of the Year (597)"
msgstr "牌匾上写着：平民之选奖——年度最佳统治者（597 年）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1175
msgid ""
"You haven't found any energy discs yet, eh? Perhaps you fail to grasp the urgency of your mission. ALAMAR IS GOING TO DESTROY XEEN! NOW GET BACK OUT THERE AND SAVE THE WORLD!"
msgstr "你们还没找到能量盘，是吧？也许你们没有领会任务的紧迫。阿拉玛要毁灭辛恩了！现在给我回去，拯救世界！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11753
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, he who is too sharp sometimes cuts himself."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：记住，太锋利的人有时会割伤自己。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11759
msgid "The plaque reads: Speak softly, but carry a large magic sword."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：说话要轻声，但要带一把大魔法剑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11765
msgid "The plaque reads: Remember, eat less and think thin."
msgstr "牌匾上写着：记住，少吃多想，越想越瘦。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11778
msgid ""
"Green grass, still air and a clear sky, in the middle of a volcano. Nobody here seems surprised to see you."
msgstr "青草、静止的空气和晴朗的天空，就在火山中间。这里的人似乎并不惊讶会见到你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11786
msgid ""
"The cleft is clear. Cool air and a smell of grass come up from the valley."
msgstr "裂缝通了。凉风夹着青草的气息，从山谷里涌上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11794
msgid ""
"You shift the last stones from the inside. The cleft is open both ways now."
msgstr "你从里面挪开最后几块石头。裂缝现在两头都通了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11800
msgid ""
"A crystal set in the rock at eye height, watching you. From somewhere behind it, Benedict's voice: \"Smile! You're being broadcast to millions.\""
msgstr "岩石里嵌着一颗与视线齐平的水晶，在注视着你。从它后面的某处，传来本尼迪克特的声音：“笑一笑！你正在向数百万人直播。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11821
msgid ""
"Congratulations, You found Shangri-La! The water tastes of every road that led here. (+15,000 experience)"
msgstr "恭喜，你们找到了香格里拉！这水里有每一条通到这里的路的味道。（+15,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1183
msgid ""
"The Songbird is on the isle in the lake, past Lakeside. The dungeon there is all doors that ask you to cheer up. Father would never get through them."
msgstr "夜莺在湖中岛上，湖畔镇过去就是。那里的地牢全是要你振作起来的门。父亲绝对过不去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1186
msgid ""
"My father Dimitri was captain of the Queen's guard. Since she was taken he sits in the dark and won't eat. Only the Songbird of Serenity could lift his despair, and it's caged in the Dungeon of Lost Souls on the lake isle. Here is the key to its cage. Father kept it; he won't use it. The Isle eats parties, mind."
msgstr "我父亲季米特里曾是女王卫队的队长。自从她被抓走，他就坐在黑暗里不肯吃饭。只有安宁夜莺能驱散他的绝望，它被关在湖中岛的迷魂地牢里。这是鸟笼的钥匙。父亲一直留着；他不肯用。要当心，那座岛会吞掉队伍的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1193
msgid "The Queen"
msgstr "女王"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1194
msgid ""
"The Queen is gone. What is a captain without a queen? A man in a chair. Leave me be."
msgstr "女王不在了。没有女王的队长算什么？坐在椅子里的一个人。别管我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1202
msgid ""
"Dig, and say nothing at table. He smiles at me now. He never used to smile."
msgstr "挖吧，吃饭时别说话。他现在对我笑了。他以前从来不笑的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1205
msgid ""
"Crodo is home, and he says the Prince is... no. I believe him. I have watched that man not eat for a year. The King would not hear it, and the thing at his side would. So, quietly again: an Excavation Permit for Newcastle's dungeon. Emerson will dig where you tell him."
msgstr "克罗多回家了，他说王子是……不，我信他。我看着那个人一年没吃东西。国王不肯听，而他身边的那个东西会听。所以，再悄悄地：这是纽卡斯尔地牢的挖掘许可证。爱默生会按你们指的地方挖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1218
msgid ""
"Dug, shored and swept. There's a door at the bottom my men won't touch. It hums. I put a chalk mark on it: NOT MY DEPARTMENT."
msgstr "挖好了，撑好了，扫干净了。底下有一扇门，我的人不肯碰。它嗡嗡响。我在上面画了一道粉笔记号：不归我管。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1222
msgid ""
"A permit, signed and sealed, and five Megacredits. Lovely. The old dungeon was caved in by the bolt that took the castle. My men will have it open by the time you get there."
msgstr "一张签了字盖了章的许可证，外加五枚兆信用点。很好。旧地牢被带走城堡的那道闪电震塌了。你们到的时候，我的人会把它挖开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1236
msgid ""
"The permit's fine. The Megacredits aren't here. Five, please. Digging is the expensive kind of building."
msgstr "许可证没问题。兆信用点不在这儿。请交五枚。挖掘是花钱的那种建设。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1239
msgid ""
"No digging without a permit. I don't make the rules. Artemus does, and he's very fond of them."
msgstr "没有许可证不许挖。规矩不是我定的。是阿尔忒弥斯定的，而且他很喜欢这些规矩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1246
msgid ""
"That song... I have been sitting in the dark like a fool. Listen. When Alamar took the castle, he gave the Queen to Count Blackfang, and the Count made her a vampire. Only her own crown can undo it, and it is in her bedroom safe, upstairs, in the part of the castle that isn't back yet. The disk safes on this floor open to 64, 52, 31. And go to Ambrose, the Queen's Knight, at Griffin Pass. He has been trying to reach Blackfang for a year. Keep the bird. I'll hear it when you pass."
msgstr "那首歌……我像个傻瓜一样坐在黑暗里。听着。阿拉玛夺下城堡时，把女王交给了布莱克方伯爵，伯爵把她变成了吸血鬼。只有她自己的王冠能解除，它在她卧室的保险箱里，在楼上，城堡还没回来的那一部分。这一层的盘保险箱密码是 64、52、31。然后去找女王的骑士安布罗斯，他在狮鹫关。他一年来一直想联系布莱克方。留着那只鸟。你们经过的时候我会听见的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1260
msgid "The Songbird"
msgstr "夜莺"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1262
msgid ""
"Ambrose is at Griffin Pass, on the south edge of the Forbidden Zone. He asks everyone who sent them. Tell him Dimitri did, and he'll listen."
msgstr "安布罗斯在狮鹫关，禁区的南缘。他问每个人是谁派来的。告诉他是季米特里，他就会听。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1270 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3155 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3166
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3188
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "谢谢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1271
msgid ""
"Father laughed this morning. At breakfast. At nothing! Here, it's all I have that's worth anything. I took it from the guard room when nobody was guarding it."
msgstr "父亲今天早上笑了。吃早饭的时候。无缘无故地笑！给，这是我所有值钱的东西了。我从卫兵室拿的，当时没人守着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1283
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle. Double fee, as the sign says: five thousand. ... There. It hums when a griffin is near, and the griffin hums back. Mostly."
msgstr "狮鹫笼头。双倍费用，像牌子上写的：五千。……好了。附近有狮鹫时它会嗡嗡响，狮鹫也会嗡嗡回应。大多数时候。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1290
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle? Five thousand gold. Griffins are a specialty, and specialties cost extra."
msgstr "狮鹫笼头？五千金币。狮鹫是专业活儿，专业活儿要加价。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1296
msgid "The bridle"
msgstr "笼头"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1298
msgid ""
"If the griffin bites, that is the griffin's business, not the bridle's. No refunds."
msgstr "狮鹫要是咬人，那是狮鹫的事，不是笼头的事。概不退款。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1307
msgid ""
"Dimitri? Then the old bear is awake again. Good. I caught a griffin to fly into Blackfang, and the beast will not take a bridle. An enchanted one, it might. Natasha in Sandcaster could do it. Here is the bridle."
msgstr "季米特里？那就是老熊又醒了。好。我抓了一头狮鹫，好飞进布莱克方，可这畜生不肯戴笼头。魔法笼头的话，也许可以。沙堡镇的娜塔莎能做。这是笼头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1317
msgid ""
"It took it! Look at him, calm as a cart horse. Blackfang has no gate that opens to the living, but it has walls, and walls have tops. When you are ready, we fly. And take this, from the Queen's own purse; she would want it spent on her rescue."
msgstr "它戴上了！看它，像拉车的马一样温顺。布莱克方没有对活人开放的大门，但它有城墙，而城墙有顶。你们准备好了，我们就飞。还有，把这个拿去，是女王自己钱袋里的；她会希望把它花在救她上面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1326
msgid ""
"The griffin still bites anything that looks like leather. Natasha, in Sandcaster."
msgstr "狮鹫还是会咬任何看起来像皮革的东西。去找沙堡镇的娜塔莎。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1332
msgid "The griffin"
msgstr "狮鹫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1334
msgid "The griffin is fed and grumpy. Say the word, and we fly to Blackfang."
msgstr "狮鹫吃饱了，脾气不好。说一声，我们就飞往布莱克方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1342
msgid "Fly to Blackfang"
msgstr "飞往布莱克方"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1343
msgid "Hold on to something that isn't the griffin."
msgstr "抓紧点什么，别抓狮鹫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1352
msgid ""
"Congratulations! We've done it! The castle is free! I can't thank you enough. You must now find the key to the pyramid in the castle and return the orb to the Pharaoh. I must attend to certain magical duties from now till the completion of the prophecy. Go with my blessing."
msgstr "恭喜！我们成功了！城堡自由了！我感激不尽。你们现在必须在城堡里找到金字塔的钥匙，把圆球还给法老。从现在到预言完成之前，我得去处理一些魔法事务。带着我的祝福去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1364
msgid ""
"This is fantastic! Your speedy delivery has kept us on track. The dungeon returns now. Just five more discs will bring back the last of the castle."
msgstr "太棒了！你们送得这么快，让我们没有耽误进度。地牢现在回来了。再有五块盘，就能带回城堡的最后一部分。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1376
msgid ""
"So close! Just five discs will finish the castle. The key must be in that section!"
msgstr "就差一点了！只要五块盘就能让城堡完整。钥匙一定在那一部分里！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1380
msgid ""
"Thanks for the discs, but I still need five to restore the dungeon. I would like to restore the third level first, but the mathematics forbid it. Carry on."
msgstr "谢谢你们的盘，但我还需要五块才能恢复地牢。我本想先恢复第三层，但数学不允许。继续吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1384
msgid ""
"What's this? You have no discs? Do you seek to snatch defeat from the jaws of victory? There is still time to gather the rest."
msgstr "这是怎么回事？你们没有盘？是想从胜利的口中抢走失败吗？现在还来得及收集剩下的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1387
msgid ""
"Why have you come to me empty handed? Did you expect congratulations? The final hour approaches while you dawdle here!"
msgstr "你们为什么空着手来找我？指望我祝贺你们吗？你们在这里磨蹭，最后时刻正在逼近！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1393
msgid "Energy discs"
msgstr "能量盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1395
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, my friends, but I cannot spend much time talking. I must see to my magical duties, and you must see to yours. The world is depending on us."
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们，朋友们，但我没法花太多时间聊天。我得去处理我的魔法事务，你们也得去做你们的。世界要靠我们了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1405
msgid ""
"My crown. Put it on my head, quickly, before the hunger comes back. ... There. I am myself. Ambrose will fly me home after dark; the sun and I are not friends yet. Take this: the key to the Great Pyramid. Alamar wanted it so badly he took a castle to hide it."
msgstr "我的王冠。快给我戴上，趁饥饿还没回来。……好了。我又是我自己了。天黑以后安布罗斯会载我回家；我和太阳还不是朋友。拿着这个：大金字塔的钥匙。阿拉玛太想要它了，所以把整座城堡藏了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1418
msgid ""
"The safe in my bedroom. Three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Hurry. I am trying very hard not to look at your necks."
msgstr "我卧室里的保险箱。三，三十一，六十二。快点。我正努力不去看你们的脖子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1421
msgid ""
"Stay back. Count Blackfang made me what I am, and I am hungry all the time. Only my own crown can undo it. It is in the safe in my bedroom, in my own castle: three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Bring it, Crusaders. Please."
msgstr "退后。布莱克方伯爵把我变成了现在这样，我无时无刻不在饥饿。只有我自己的王冠能解除它。它在我自己城堡里卧室的保险箱里：三，三十一，六十二。把它带来，十字军们。求你们了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1429
msgid "The crown"
msgstr "王冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1431
msgid ""
"My crown, my castle, my thanks. The Pharaoh will want his orb back, and he does not like to wait. Neither, I find, do I."
msgstr "我的王冠，我的城堡，我的感谢。法老会想要回他的圆球，而且他不喜欢等。我发现，我也不喜欢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1439
msgid "Fly us out"
msgstr "带我们飞出去"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1440
msgid "Are you ready to leave this awful place, friends? Then hold on."
msgstr "朋友们，你们准备好离开这个可怕的地方了吗？那就抓紧了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1449
msgid ""
"The lava round the second meteor is cool now. What fell from the sky there is not a meteor. Go and see, and be polite to whoever wakes."
msgstr "第二块陨石周围的熔岩现在凉了。从天上掉下来的东西并不是陨石。去看看，对醒来的人要有礼貌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1453
msgid ""
"My orb. Without it I could see Alamar, but not strike him. Hear what I have seen. Alamar is not a king. He is Sheltem, a guardian the Ancients made to keep a world safe, who decided he knew better. He means to steer Xeen away from its sun and sail it like a ship. He came here in a pod from the stars. So did his pursuer, and that pod fell into lava in the Forbidden Zone. I have cooled it. Go."
msgstr "我的圆球。没有它，我能看到阿拉玛，却无法攻击他。听我说我看到了什么。阿拉玛不是国王。他是谢尔特姆，是远古者造出来保护一个世界安全的守护者，却自以为比造他的人更明白。他打算把辛恩拖离它的太阳，像船一样把它驶走。他是乘着一个舱从星空来的。追捕他的人也是，那个舱掉进了禁区的熔岩里。我已经把它冷却了。去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1462
msgid ""
"You found your way up my pyramid without my orb? I admire the effort and regret the result. Bring it."
msgstr "你们没拿我的圆球就爬上了我的金字塔？我佩服这份努力，也遗憾这个结果。把它带来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1467
msgid ""
"Olympus. Soul Storage. One box. Do not open the others' doors; the gods are touchy about their storage."
msgstr "奥林匹斯。灵魂存放处。一只盒子。不要打开别人的门；众神对自己的存放物很敏感。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1470
msgid ""
"Corak is awake. Then the prophecy is not a poem after all. You are the Chosen Ones: I say so, and the gods of Olympus will let you in on my word. Here is my pass. Lucio's boats sail from the jetties at Castleview and Sandcaster, and from Lakeside's dock. In Olympus is the only Soul Box left on Xeen. Corak needs it."
msgstr "柯拉克醒了。那么预言就不只是一首诗了。你们就是天选之人：我这么说，奥林匹斯的众神就会听我的话让你们进去。这是我的通行证。卢西奥的船从堡景镇和沙堡镇的码头，还有湖畔镇的码头出发。奥林匹斯有辛恩仅剩的一只灵魂盒。柯拉克需要它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1483
msgid "The boats"
msgstr "船"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1485
msgid ""
"Chosen Ones may ride, the Pharaoh says. He doesn't pay the fare, mind: that's yours. Up we go: Castleview's jetty, Sandcaster's, or Lakeside's dock, twice a week, and the clouds do the rest."
msgstr "天选之人可以乘船，法老这么说。不过船费他不付：那是你们的事。上去吧：堡景镇的码头、沙堡镇的码头，或者湖畔镇的码头，每周两班，剩下的交给云。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1488
msgid ""
"My boats sail the sky, friends, and only for those the Dragon Pharaoh has chosen. Come back with his word and I'll take you up to Olympus."
msgstr "我的船航行在天空，朋友们，只载龙法老选中的人。带着他的话再来，我就带你们去奥林匹斯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1491
msgid "Prince Roland"
msgstr "罗兰王子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1492
msgid ""
"Prince Roland is held by Alamar in the bottom level of the Castle. Alive, after a fashion. Alamar keeps things."
msgstr "罗兰王子被阿拉玛关在城堡最底层。还活着，算是吧。阿拉玛什么都留着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1498
msgid ""
"Ah! A Soulbox! You have done well. I will hide in the box while you take me to Sheltem. Once you are in his presence, throw the box to the ground and I will come out and fight him. Be careful. If you lose the box or are killed, Xeen is doomed."
msgstr "啊！灵魂盒！你们干得好。你们带我去见谢尔特姆的时候，我会躲在盒子里。到了他面前，把盒子扔在地上，我就会出来跟他战斗。小心点。盒子丢了或者你们死了，辛恩就完了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1508
msgid ""
"I cannot leave the safety of this ship without some means of hiding from Sheltem's defenses. The Ancients made Soul Boxes for such things. The Pharaoh will know where one is left."
msgstr "没有某种躲避谢尔特姆防御的办法，我不能离开这艘船的安全范围。远古者造过灵魂盒来做这种事。法老会知道哪里留了一只。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:74 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1514
msgid "Soul Box"
msgstr "灵魂盒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1516
msgid "(The box is quiet. Something inside it is being very patient.)"
msgstr "（盒子很安静。里面有什么东西在耐心地等待。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1524 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:325
msgid "Sheltem"
msgstr "谢尔特姆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1525
msgid ""
"Much has happened since I crashed on Darkside. Sheltem left his stasis long before I did and has done much evil. My instruments show Xeen drifting out of its orbit: he has full control of it. I have orders to stop him, and I cannot, unless he does not see me coming."
msgstr "自从我在暗面坠毁以来，发生了很多事。谢尔特姆比我早很久离开了休眠，干了不少坏事。我的仪器显示辛恩正在偏离轨道：他完全控制了它。我奉命阻止他，除非他没发现我，否则我做不到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1531 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1557
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:502
msgid "Lord Xeen"
msgstr "辛恩领主"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1533
msgid ""
"Ah! You warm my reptilian heart. Sheltem is gone, and the wicked 'Lord Xeen' creation with him. Keep the Cube and the Scepter together. The destiny of Xeen is in sight, and I will need you for it."
msgstr "啊！你们让我这颗爬行动物的心都暖了。谢尔特姆走了，邪恶的“辛恩领主”造物也随他而去。把立方和权杖放在一起。辛恩的命运就在眼前，我需要你们完成它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1536
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, Chosen Ones. Xeen is returning to its proper orbit. But Sheltem's general, the monster that calls himself 'Lord Xeen' on the other side of the world, still lives and holds the Scepter of Temporal Distortion. Rid the world of him, in his cloud castle above Darzog's tower, and bring me the scepter."
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们，天选之人。辛恩正在回到它正确的轨道上。但谢尔特姆的将军，在世界另一端自称“辛恩领主”的那个怪物，还活着，还握着时间扭曲权杖。把他从世界上除掉，他在达佐格之塔上方的云中城堡里，然后把权杖带给我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1545
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. Your destiny lies on the darkside of Xeen."
msgstr "谢谢你们把辛恩从那个邪恶的灵魂手里救出来。不过镜子的事真可惜。你们的命运在辛恩的暗面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1550
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. And my brother? If he lives, he is on the other side. Go to him."
msgstr "谢谢你们把辛恩从那个邪恶的灵魂手里救出来。不过镜子的事真可惜。我的兄弟呢？如果他还活着，就在另一边。去找他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1559
msgid ""
"Thank you again. Castle Xeen is a cloud again. The court misses the mirror more than it misses my brother's double."
msgstr "再次感谢。辛恩城堡又成了云。宫廷想念那面镜子，胜过想念我兄弟的替身。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1569
msgid ""
"Xeen is one world, and the sun is where it belongs. I have nothing left to ask of you, Chosen Ones. That has not happened to me in a very long time."
msgstr "辛恩是一个世界，太阳在它该在的地方。我没有什么要再求你们的了，天选之人。这种事我已经很久没遇到过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1573
msgid ""
"The machines at the corners of the other side, the four sleepers on this side, Roland in Sheltem's dungeon, the cloud above Darkstone Tower. Then the Cube and the Scepter, together, at my shrine. Rest where you can."
msgstr "另一边角落里的机器，这一边的四个沉睡者，谢尔特姆地牢里的罗兰，暗石塔上方的云。然后立方和权杖，在我的神龛里放在一起。能休息就休息。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1576
msgid ""
"Now, with the Cube and the Scepter in hand and the enemies of the world out of the way, the destiny of Xeen is in sight. Turn on the four machines in the corners of the other side of the world. Awaken the elemental sleepers on this side. Open the way to the cloud world above Darkstone Tower: Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra are getting married there. Oh, that reminds me. Have you rescued Prince Roland from the bottom of Sheltem's dungeon yet? If you haven't, that's one more little detail."
msgstr "现在，立方和权杖在手，世界的敌人也都清除了，辛恩的命运就在眼前。启动世界另一边角落里的四台机器。唤醒这一边的元素沉睡者。打开通往暗石塔上方云中世界的路：罗兰王子和卡琳德拉女王要在那里结婚。哦，这让我想起来了。你们从谢尔特姆地牢的底层救出罗兰王子了吗？如果还没有，那又是一件小事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1586
msgid "The sleepers"
msgstr "沉睡者"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1587
msgid ""
"Each sleeper lies on its own plane, and the planes hang below the Skyroads. Stand at a corner of the roads and the sky asks what you seek. Name the element: Fire in the north-west, Air in the north-east, Earth in the south-east, Water in the south-west. Then step off. The sleepers wake only for the Chosen Ones, and only when the Reflectors are humming."
msgstr "每个沉睡者躺在各自的位面上，位面悬在天路之下。站在路的一个角上，天空会问你们要找什么。说出元素的名字：西北是火，东北是风，东南是土，西南是水。然后踏出去。沉睡者只会为天选之人醒来，而且只在反射器嗡嗡作响的时候。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1594
msgid "My brother"
msgstr "我的兄弟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1595
msgid ""
"My brother is home. The real one, this time; he eats. He tells me there is to be a wedding on a cloud, to a queen I have never met. Go and make sure it happens, Crusaders. I am too old to be surprised twice."
msgstr "我的兄弟回家了。这次是真的；他吃饭了。他告诉我，云上要办一场婚礼，新娘是一位我从未见过的女王。去确保它能办成吧，十字军。我年纪太大，经不起再被吓一次了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1603
msgid ""
"Really? You have one? A widget! Then the Chime of Opening is yours. Make it so!"
msgstr "真的吗？你有一个？小玩意儿！那么开启编钟就归你了。就这么办！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1611
msgid ""
"So you've come to me for the Chime of Opening. What could you possibly offer me in exchange? I've been around for thousands of years and I've seen everything... well, almost everything. There is one mysterious item that I haven't seen. It's called a widget. Go and see Halon the Efficient, the clockmaker, whose workshop stands east of Darkstone Tower in Winterkill Tundra. He's the one who first told me of it. Then don't come back 'til you find one!"
msgstr "所以你们是来找我要开启编钟的。你们能拿什么来跟我交换呢？我活了几千年，什么都见过……嗯，几乎什么都见过。有一样神秘的东西我还没见过。它叫小玩意儿。去找效率达人哈隆，那位钟表匠，他的作坊在冬杀冻原的暗石塔以东。是他最先跟我说起它的。找到一个之前，别回来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1617
msgid "Chime of Opening"
msgstr "开启编钟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1619
msgid ""
"Nice to see you again, adventurers! The widget that you brought to me is fascinating! I turn it over every morning. It still does nothing. Marvellous."
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们，冒险者们！你们带给我的小玩意儿太迷人了！我每天早上都把它翻个面。它还是什么也不做。太奇妙了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1627
msgid "The wedding"
msgstr "婚礼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1628
msgid ""
"Married on a cloud, by a dragon, with cake. My brother will not believe a word of it. Thank you, Crusaders: for the coffin, and for this."
msgstr "在云上由一条龙主持，还有蛋糕。我兄弟一个字都不会信。谢谢你们，十字军：为了那口棺材，也为了这个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1634
msgid "One world"
msgstr "一个世界"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1635
msgid ""
"One world, and one sun. I stood in daylight this morning and nothing happened to me at all. I could get used to that. The Darkside owes you, Crusaders. So do I."
msgstr "一个世界，一个太阳。今天早上我站在日光下，什么事也没发生。我可以习惯这个。暗面欠你们的。我也是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1642
msgid ""
"I am the Summer Druid. Summer will not end until someone carries its last flower away. Take it to the Autumn Druid, on Burlock's savannah. The year is a relay, and I have held it long enough."
msgstr "我是夏之德鲁伊。除非有人把夏天最后一朵花带走，夏天不会结束。把它带给伯洛克草原上的秋之德鲁伊。一年是一场接力，而我已经握得够久了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1653
msgid ""
"Take the Last Flower of Summer to the Autumn Druid on the savannah, so that summer can end."
msgstr "把夏日最后一朵花带给草原上的秋之德鲁伊，让夏天能够结束。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1661
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr "秋"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1663
msgid "Please take the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn to the Winter Druid."
msgstr "请把秋天最后一片落叶带给冬之德鲁伊。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1667
msgid ""
"Thank you for the Last Flower of Summer. Here is the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn. Take the Leaf to the Winter Druid so Winter can begin."
msgstr "谢谢你们带来夏日最后一朵花。这是秋天最后一片落叶。把叶子带给冬之德鲁伊，好让冬天开始。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1673
msgid ""
"I am the Autumn Druid. I require the Last Flower of Summer before I can give you the last fallen Leaf of Autumn. Without the last flower of summer I cannot make summer end."
msgstr "我是秋之德鲁伊。在我把秋天最后一片落叶给你们之前，我需要夏日最后一朵花。没有夏日最后一朵花，我无法让夏天结束。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1678
msgid ""
"Take the Snowflake to the Spring Druid by Pitchfork Creek. He has waited all winter. He always does."
msgstr "把雪花带给干草叉溪边的春之德鲁伊。他等了整个冬天。他总是这样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1682
msgid ""
"The last leaf. Then winter may begin. Here is the last Snowflake of Winter; carry it to the Spring Druid, by Pitchfork Creek in Vertigo's meadows."
msgstr "最后一片叶子。那么冬天可以开始了。这是冬日最后一片雪花；把它带给眩晕镇草地上干草叉溪边的春之德鲁伊。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1688
msgid ""
"I am the Winter Druid. Bring me the last fallen Leaf of Autumn, or winter waits, and so does everything after it."
msgstr "我是冬之德鲁伊。把秋天最后一片落叶带给我，不然冬天要等着，之后的一切也要等着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1693
msgid ""
"The last snowflake of Winter. Here is the Last Raindrop of Spring, and your reward. As I renew the year, so will I renew you."
msgstr "冬日最后一片雪花。这是春日最后一滴雨，还有你们的奖励。我如何让一年更新，就如何让你们焕然一新。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1702
msgid ""
"I require the last snowflake of Winter before I can give you the Last Raindrop of Spring and your reward. The Summer Druid begins the year, in the west."
msgstr "在我把春日最后一滴雨和你们的奖励给你们之前，我需要冬日最后一片雪花。夏之德鲁伊在西边，他让一年开始。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1708
msgid "Spring"
msgstr "春"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1710
msgid ""
"Spring comes to those who wait. You did not wait; you walked. That works too."
msgstr "春天属于等待的人。你们没有等；你们是走过来的。这样也行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1720
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning my pendant. Please accept the Enchant Item spell as your reward. I will also return the drinking fountain to normal. And the spellcasters among you have earned a better title than 'that lot with the pendant'."
msgstr "谢谢你们把我的吊坠送回来。请收下天赋魔力法术作为奖励。我还会把饮水喷泉恢复正常。你们当中的施法者，也配得上比“戴吊坠的那帮人”更好的头衔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1733
msgid "No pendant, no reward."
msgstr "没有吊坠，就没有奖励。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1736
msgid ""
"The sorceresses of Rivercity have stolen a magical pendant of mine. I want it back, and I will reward you if you return it. They keep their loot in a strongbox on the south quay, outside their house."
msgstr "河城的女术士偷走了我的一枚魔法吊坠。我想拿回来，你们送回来我会奖励的。她们把赃物放在她们房子外面、南码头的一个保险箱里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1743
msgid "Pendant"
msgstr "吊坠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1745
msgid ""
"The fountain runs again and the tavern charges for water again. Rivercity is back to normal. I'm not sure that's a compliment."
msgstr "喷泉又流了，酒馆又开始对水收费了。河城恢复正常了。我不确定这算不算夸奖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1753
msgid "Barok"
msgstr "巴洛克"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1754
msgid ""
"The tavern hired the sorceresses to run Barok out of town. Then they plugged the fountain, so now we buy our water here. Funny how that works."
msgstr "酒馆雇了女术士把巴洛克赶出镇子。然后她们把喷泉堵上了，现在我们得在这里买水。事情就是这么有趣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1762
msgid ""
"You have recovered my tiara and gotten rid of that bothersome robber gang. I am pleased. As a reward I give you this treasure: its twin, which I never liked as much. And the thieves among you will be called Rogues from today. I'll have it written down."
msgstr "你们找回了我的头冠，还除掉了那帮烦人的强盗。我很高兴。作为奖励，我送你们这件宝物：它的孪生品，我从来没那么喜欢。你们当中的盗贼，从今天起称为神偷。我会让人记下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1775
msgid "I see that you have not recovered my tiara. Please keep trying."
msgstr "我看你们还没找回我的头冠。请继续努力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1778
msgid ""
"My servants have informed me that my diamond tiara has been stolen from my room. I believe it to be the work of robbers that dwell in Rivercity, under the great bridge. They are led by a devious and cunning boss. They must be stopped and my tiara recovered. Do this and you will be greatly rewarded."
msgstr "我的仆人们告诉我，我的钻石头冠从我的房间里被偷走了。我相信这是住在河城、大桥下的强盗干的。他们由一个狡猾奸诈的头目带领。必须阻止他们，找回我的头冠。做到这些，你们会得到丰厚的奖励。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1785
msgid "Tiara"
msgstr "头冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1787
msgid "It is always exhilarating to see adventurers such as yourselves."
msgstr "见到你们这样的冒险者，总是令人振奋。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1797
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the Ninja Clan that drove me from my sacred home. I am eternally grateful. As payment for your services, please let me fill your packs with food. And those of you who walk the monk's road: you have walked it far enough to be called Initiates."
msgstr "你们消灭了把我从圣所赶走的忍者族。我永远感激。作为酬劳，请让我把你们的背包装满食物。你们当中走僧侣之路的人：你们走得已经够远，可以被称为修士了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1809
msgid ""
"There are still Ninja in my Pagoda. I cannot go home until they are gone."
msgstr "我的宝塔里还有忍者。他们不走，我就回不了家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1812
msgid ""
"I am a peace loving old monk driven from my sacred home. I used to live in the Pagoda due south from here until the Evil Ninja clan drove me out. I am too old to fight, but perhaps you, being so strong and well-armed, could rid my home of these evil clansmen. I could reward you."
msgstr "我是一个爱好和平的老僧人，被赶出了圣所。我以前住在这里正南方的宝塔里，直到邪恶的忍者族把我赶了出来。我老得打不动了，但你们这么强壮又全副武装，也许能为我清除家里这些邪恶的族人。我会酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1819
msgid "The Pagoda"
msgstr "宝塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1821
msgid ""
"The pagoda is quiet again. I sweep it every morning. The ninjas never swept. Someone lives in the cellar, though. I leave rice by the shrine."
msgstr "宝塔又安静了。我每天早上都扫地。忍者从来不扫。不过地窖里住着什么人。我在神龛边留了米饭。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1830
msgid ""
"A monk who has not been initiated? Sit. Breathe. Stand up. That's all it is, really. The rest you already did."
msgstr "没入门的僧人？坐下。呼吸。站起来。其实就这些。剩下的你已经做过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1839
msgid ""
"The curse is over. People are walking out of the cellars on two legs. Here: the town collected this for you. Some of it was in snakeskins."
msgstr "诅咒结束了。人们正用两条腿从地窖里走出来。给，镇上为你们凑的。有一部分是装在蛇皮里的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1847
msgid ""
"Still snakes. Eve says the stones round the well have something to say. Eve says a lot of things now, and all of them with an s."
msgstr "还是蛇。伊芙说井边的石头有话要说。伊芙现在话很多，而且每句话里都带着“嘶”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1850
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened to Asp. A foul curse has been placed on the town that turns people into snakes. Please save us!"
msgstr "毒蛇镇发生了可怕的事。一道邪恶的诅咒落在镇上，把人变成了蛇。请救救我们！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1859
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving us! Eve hasn't hissed in a week. I've started to miss it."
msgstr "谢谢你们救了我们！伊芙已经一个星期没嘶嘶叫了。我开始想念了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1868
msgid ""
"There isss a transformer somewhere under town that is turning people into snakes. If you destroy it, the curse will surely end. The ssstones round the well open the way: start with the south-west stone, make it red, then every other one red all the way round."
msgstr "镇子底下有一台变形器，在把人变成蛇。如果你们毁了它，诅咒就一定会结束。井边的石头能开路：从西南的石头开始，把它变成红色，然后一个隔一个地一路变红绕一圈。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1875 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:219
msgid "Transformer"
msgstr "变形器"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1877
msgid "The curse is over! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "诅咒结束了！太感谢你们了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1887
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have finally rid Winterkill of all the spirits. As a reward, I dub thee Ghostslayers Extraordinaire."
msgstr "恭喜！你们终于清除了冬杀镇所有的幽灵。作为奖励，我封你们为杰出的屠鬼者。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1899
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Polter Fool spirits, but now the spirits of Ghost Riders have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr "恭喜！你们成功赶走了捣蛋鬼的灵魂，但现在幽灵骑士的灵魂搬了进来。也许你们也能把它们赶走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1907
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Spirit Bones, but now the spirits of Polter Fools have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr "恭喜！你们成功赶走了灵魂骸骨，但现在捣蛋鬼的灵魂搬了进来。也许你们也能把它们赶走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1915
msgid ""
"You haven't driven the spirits from Winterkill yet. Keep trying. And bang the southern gong when you have: it's the only way I hear anything out here."
msgstr "你们还没把幽灵从冬杀镇赶走。继续努力。完成后敲南边的锣：这是我在这儿唯一能听到的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1918
msgid ""
"The people of this fair city were driven out by a curse that brought the spirits of the dead back to life. The town is currently haunted by Spirit Bones. Perhaps you could drive them out."
msgstr "这座美丽城市的居民被一道诅咒赶走了，诅咒让死者的灵魂复活。镇上目前闹着灵魂骸骨。也许你们能把它们赶走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1928
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Ghostslayers."
msgstr "总是很高兴见到你们，屠鬼者们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1936
msgid "The Count"
msgstr "伯爵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1938
msgid ""
"Draco is gone. The town breathes. Well, the town does. I never took it up."
msgstr "德拉科走了。镇子能喘口气了。嗯，镇子能。我从来没学会这个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1941
msgid ""
"Draco? A boor. He sleeps in the square in a box with his name on it, and he bites the customers. If the dials were set right and his lid came off at night, I would not stand in your way. I would not stand anywhere near it."
msgstr "德拉科？一个粗人。他睡在广场上一个刻着他名字的盒子里，还咬顾客。如果刻度盘设对了，夜里他的盖子掀开，我不会挡你们的路。我连靠都不会靠近。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1945
msgid ""
"With Draco gone, someone must be the elder of this town's night. You'll do. Rise, Nosferatu."
msgstr "德拉科走了，这座镇的夜里总得有个长老。你们来吧。起来，吸血鬼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1954
msgid ""
"His Scroll of Insight! He would say thank you. He would also say not to read it upside down, which is how he read it. The Northern Sphinx lies east of here, out in the dunes; he always meant to go in. He never had the nerve."
msgstr "他的洞察卷轴！他会说谢谢的。他还会说别倒着读，他就是倒着读的。北方狮身人面像在这儿东边，沙丘里；他一直想进去。可他从来没那个胆子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1963
msgid "Third floor. Mind the dogs. They are not dogs."
msgstr "第三层。小心那些狗。它们不是狗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1966
msgid ""
"The wizards of Castle Basenji killed my master and took his Scroll of Insight. They keep werewolves. Here is his note; he wrote everything down, including what he shouldn't have. The second floor's door wants 'There wolf'. Bring the scroll back."
msgstr "巴森吉城堡的巫师们杀了我师父，拿走了他的洞察卷轴。他们养着狼人。这是他的字条；他什么都写下来，连不该写的也写了。二层的门要说“There wolf”。把卷轴带回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1974
msgid "My master"
msgstr "我的师父"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1976
msgid ""
"The Sphinx lies east of here, out in the dunes. It asks its own name. Its name is Golux. Master always said it was cheating to know that, so of course he knew."
msgstr "狮身人面像在这儿东边，沙丘里。它问的是它自己的名字。它的名字叫戈卢克斯。师父总说知道这个是作弊，所以他当然知道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1986
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you so much for recovering my Scarab. Now I can complete my spell. Take this; I was keeping it for whoever was brave enough. And the healers and druids among you: kneel. You have earned more than a trinket. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr "哦，太感谢你们找回了我的圣甲虫。现在我能完成我的法术了。拿着这个；我一直留着，等有够勇敢的人来。你们当中的医者和德鲁伊：跪下。你们配得上比小玩意儿更好的东西。德鲁伊起身成为大德鲁伊，牧师成为神甫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1999
msgid ""
"I see you haven't recovered my Scarab of Imaging yet. Remember that the gargoyles took it to their eyrie on the Gargoyle Range, north of here."
msgstr "我看你们还没找回我的成像圣甲虫。记住，石像鬼把它带到了他们在石像鬼山脉的巢穴，就在这儿北边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2002
msgid ""
"The other day I was using my Scarab of Imaging for one of my spells when out of the sky swooped a flock of gargoyles. While I was busy fending off their attack, one of them snatched my Scarab and they all flew off toward the Gargoyle Range. I know not why they took it, only that gargoyles are hired to steal things for people. I need the Scarab back to complete my spell, and I will reward you if you can return it to me."
msgstr "前几天我正用成像圣甲虫施一个法术，一群石像鬼突然从天上扑下来。我忙着抵挡他们的攻击时，其中一只抢走了我的圣甲虫，然后他们全都飞向石像鬼山脉。我不知道他们为什么拿它，只知道石像鬼是被人雇来偷东西的。我需要圣甲虫才能完成法术，你们要是能把它还给我，我会酬谢的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2009
msgid "Scarab"
msgstr "圣甲虫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2011
msgid ""
"The spell is finished. The gargoyles haven't been back. I like to think they heard what happened to the last ones."
msgstr "法术完成了。石像鬼们没有再来。我愿意相信，是它们听说了上一批的下场。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2021
msgid ""
"Thank the Gods! You've recovered the crystals. You are truly great adventurers. As a reward, take this. A wizard's house is full of things a wizard has stopped using."
msgstr "谢天谢地！你们找回了水晶。你们真是了不起的冒险者。作为奖励，拿着这个。法师的家里总有很多法师不再用的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2031
msgid ""
"You haven't brought me my Crystals of Piezoelectricity. Perhaps they are in Asp."
msgstr "你们还没把我的压电水晶带来。也许它们在毒蛇镇。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2034
msgid ""
"This region is in a lot of danger. First, my sister Carlawna's Scarab of Imaging was stolen, and now my Crystals of Piezoelectricity have been taken. Last night I remembered a story told to me as a boy about a strange machine that produced reptile creatures. This machine could be powered by using Crystals of Piezoelectricity and a Scarab of Imaging. I never gave much validity to the story because a mad wizard told it to me, but now I can't help but think it's true. Get my Crystals back and there will be a reward."
msgstr "这一带非常危险。先是我妹妹卡拉娜的成像圣甲虫被偷，现在我的压电水晶也被拿走了。昨晚我想起小时候听过的一个故事，说有一台奇怪的机器能造出爬行类生物。这台机器可以用压电水晶和成像圣甲虫来驱动。我从没太相信这个故事，因为是一个疯法师讲给我的，但现在我不由得觉得它是真的。把我的水晶拿回来，会有奖励。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2043
msgid ""
"Carlawna is my sister, by the way. She never tells anyone. I tell everyone."
msgstr "顺便说一句，卡拉娜是我妹妹。她从不告诉别人。我告诉所有人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2053
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting me the elixir! Now I can be restored to my former self and return to my ocean home. As a reward, I blow my kiss to all of you."
msgstr "太感谢你们给我弄来灵药了！现在我可以恢复原来的样子，回我的海洋家园了。作为奖励，我向你们所有人送上一个飞吻。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2063
msgid ""
"I'm waiting for you to bring me the elixir of restoration from the evil clerics."
msgstr "我在等你们从邪恶的牧师那里把复原灵药带来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2066
msgid ""
"I was once a beautiful mermaid. But one day a sorceress saw me swimming and became jealous of my beauty. She cast a spell that took away my beauty, but worst of all she took away my mermaid tail and gave me legs instead. I search to find an elixir of restoration so I can return to the way I once was. I've heard the clerics of the evil Temple of Yak, in the dark south end of the fairy woods below Rivercity, have one. If you could retrieve this elixir for me I would be eternally grateful. The temple's door is never locked. Its clerics want visitors; they do not let them leave."
msgstr "我曾经是一条美丽的美人鱼。但有一天，一个女术士看见我游泳，嫉妒我的美貌。她施了一个咒，夺走了我的美貌，最糟的是还夺走了我的鱼尾，给了我一双腿。我一直在找一瓶复原灵药，好变回从前的样子。我听说河城以南、仙女森林黑暗南端的邪恶牛神庙的牧师们有一瓶。如果你们能为我取来这瓶灵药，我会永远感激。庙门从不上锁。庙里的牧师想要访客；他们不会让访客离开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2075
msgid "The sea's cold and the fish are rude. I've never been happier."
msgstr "海水很冷，鱼也很没礼貌。我从来没这么快乐过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2085
msgid ""
"You have slain the monsters of the lake! Here, I insist you take this as a token of my appreciation. And my boat is yours whenever you want the island."
msgstr "你们杀死了湖里的怪物！给，我坚持你们收下这个，聊表谢意。你们想去岛上的时候，我的船随时归你们用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2095
msgid ""
"The beasts still live. I wish someone would kill them. Three of them, big as barns. I'd not go near them without a great deal of practice."
msgstr "那些野兽还活着。真希望有人能杀了它们。三只，有谷仓那么大。没经过大量练习，我是不会靠近它们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2098
msgid ""
"The fish supply is low. I am sure some sort of lake beasts are eating all the fish. If you kill the beasts, I will be indebted to you."
msgstr "鱼的供应很少。我确定是某种湖怪在吃光所有的鱼。你们要是杀了这些怪物，我会感激不尽。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2105
msgid "Lake beasts"
msgstr "湖怪"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2107
msgid ""
"My friends, I am always glad to see you. The fish are back, and so am I. My boat's at the jetty if you want the island."
msgstr "朋友们，见到你们我总是很高兴。鱼回来了，我也回来了。你们想去岛上的话，我的船就在码头边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2117
msgid ""
"Lava! Great! You can't imagine how much time you have saved me. Take this widget as payment."
msgstr "熔岩！太好了！你们想象不到给我省了多少时间。拿这个小玩意儿作酬劳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2127
msgid ""
"You don't have the lava! Why are you standing around wasting time when you could be out looking for lava?!?"
msgstr "你们没有熔岩！既然能去找熔岩，为什么站在这里浪费时间？！？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2130
msgid ""
"I am Halon the Efficient. I have moved here from Rivercity to avoid the timewasters that place is full of. To help me keep track of time I have constructed a massive water clock, but the water freezes every winter. If I had some magical lava from Mount Firestone, I could melt the ice in the clock. Bring me some lava and I will reward you."
msgstr "我是效率达人哈隆。我从河城搬到这里，是为了躲开那里满是浪费时间的人。为了帮我掌握时间，我造了一座巨大的水钟，可水每年冬天都会结冰。如果我有火石山上的魔法熔岩，就能融化钟里的冰。给我带些熔岩来，我会酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2137
msgid "Water clock"
msgstr "水钟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2139
msgid ""
"It is wonderful to see my clock work year round. But still, one can never have enough time."
msgstr "看着我的钟全年转动真是太棒了。不过，时间永远不嫌多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2149
msgid ""
"Thank you for killing the trolls, civilized ones. Your speedy job has saved us many lives and much discomfort. A cousin of mine on the dark side of the world, Leafpoint, will want to meet you. Take this. It grew in my roots for a century; we have no use for it."
msgstr "谢谢你们杀了巨魔，文明人。你们的迅速行动救了我们许多性命，免去了许多不适。我在世界暗面的一个亲戚叶尖，会想见见你们。拿着这个。它在我的根里长了一个世纪；我们用不上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2158
msgid ""
"The Trolls are not dead yet. It is most urgent that you kill them. If you could please have them all dead by the end of the decade, we may give you a greater reward for rushing."
msgstr "巨魔还没死。最紧要的是把它们杀掉。如果你们能在这十年结束前把它们全杀了，我们为你们的赶工可能会给更丰厚的报酬。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2161
msgid ""
"It is good to see some civilized people around here. Maybe you will kill the Trolls for us. They gnaw on our bark to sharpen their teeth in a most uncivilized fashion. Friends don't gnaw on friend's bark. We have talked about this for a couple of centuries, give or take a few decades, and have decided to hire some civilized people. Their warren is in the forest behind me."
msgstr "在这里看到一些文明人真好。也许你们能为我们杀掉巨魔。它们啃我们的树皮来磨牙，这极不文明。朋友不啃朋友的树皮。这件事我们讨论了两个世纪，上下差几十年，决定雇一些文明人。它们的巢穴在我身后的森林里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4841
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr "巨魔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2170
msgid "You are welcome to converse with us anytime, civilized ones."
msgstr "欢迎你们随时和我们交谈，文明人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2180
msgid ""
"We saw the Cyclops' outpost burning in the distance. You have our eternal thanks. Songs will be sung in your honor for generations to come. Here, take these treasures. We know it isn't much, but it is all we have to give."
msgstr "我们看到独眼巨人的前哨在远处燃烧。我们永远感谢你们。世世代代都会有人为你们唱歌。给，拿着这些宝物。我们知道不算多，但这是我们能给的全部了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2190
msgid ""
"Every day the casualties increase. Find the cyclops as soon as you can. We are dying."
msgstr "伤亡一天比一天多。请尽快找到独眼巨人。我们快死了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2193
msgid ""
"Oh mighty heroes, your fame precedes you. Recently, a group of cyclops established an outpost near our lands, in the Land of the Giants to the south-west. They are cruel monsters that eat anyone they can catch. Please destroy them for us. We will give you what we can in return for your help."
msgstr "哦，伟大的英雄，你们的名声先于你们到来。最近，一群独眼巨人在我们土地附近，巨人之地的西南方建了一个前哨。它们是残忍的怪物，能抓到谁就吃谁。请为我们消灭它们。作为回报，我们会尽我们所能给予你们帮助。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2200
msgid "Cyclopes"
msgstr "独眼巨人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2202
msgid "Friends, you are always welcome here."
msgstr "朋友们，这里永远欢迎你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2212
msgid ""
"You have returned my Wand of Faery Magic! Now peace can be restored to the forest. Please accept this gold as a reward. And any of you with elven blood in the dark: kneel. The wand remembers its own."
msgstr "你们把我的精灵魔法杖带回来了！现在森林可以恢复和平了。请收下这些金币作为奖励。还有你们当中有精灵血统的，在黑暗中：跪下。魔杖记得它自己的人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2223
msgid "The Sprites still possess my Wand. Try harder."
msgstr "小精灵们还拿着我的魔杖。再加把劲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2226
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. My Wand of Faery Magic has been stolen by the Sprites. Without the Wand in my possession, my powers of magic are reduced. Now that the Sprites possess my Wand they are crazed with power, attacking anyone in the forest. If you return my Wand I will reward you handsomely."
msgstr "发生了可怕的事。我的精灵魔法杖被小精灵偷走了。没有魔杖在手，我的魔力减弱了。现在小精灵拿着我的魔杖，被力量冲昏了头，攻击森林里的任何人。你们要是把魔杖还给我，我会重重酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2235
msgid ""
"The forest is quiet again. The sprites are merely rude now, which for sprites is peace."
msgstr "森林又安静了。小精灵现在只是粗鲁，对小精灵来说这就算和平了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2244
msgid "Elven blood in the dark, and the wand remembers it. Rise, Patriarch."
msgstr "黑暗中的精灵血脉，魔杖记得它。起身吧，族长。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2253
msgid ""
"You have recovered the Holy Book of Elvenkind! The entire Elf kingdom thanks you. Please accept this gold as a reward. And ask me about the Spirit: I can teach it to the rank of Master."
msgstr "你们找回了精灵圣书！整个精灵王国都感谢你们。请收下这些金币作为奖励。还有，来问问我灵魂魔法：我能把它教到大师级。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2263
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found the Holy Book of Elvenkind. Please keep looking."
msgstr "我看你们还没找到精灵圣书。请继续找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2266
msgid ""
"While travelling through Troll forest recently, I was ambushed. In my haste to escape I dropped the Holy Book of Elvenkind. I can only hope that it has not been found, for if it happens to fall into the wrong hands it could lead to the extinction of my entire race. I will reward you well if you can return it to me. The Troll Forest is far to the south-west, in the snows."
msgstr "前不久穿过巨魔森林时，我遭到了伏击。逃命匆忙，我把精灵圣书掉了。我只能希望它没被人捡到，因为落到坏人手里，我整个种族可能灭绝。你们要是能把它还给我，我会重重酬谢。巨魔森林在西南远处的雪地里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2273
msgid "Holy Book"
msgstr "圣书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2275
msgid ""
"The Book is home. Whenever you are ready, I will teach you the Spirit as a Master knows it. I owe you that much."
msgstr "书回来了。你们什么时候准备好，我就把灵魂魔法教给你们，教到大师的水平。我欠你们这个人情。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2285
msgid ""
"My skull! Thank you! Already I can feel my tie to this world fading. Listen to the sound of the surf for your spell. (A book washes up at your feet: Recharge Item.)"
msgstr "我的头骨！谢谢你们！我已经感觉到我和这个世界的联系在消退。听着海浪声吧，你们的法术就在里面。（一本书冲到你们脚边：魔力填充。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2297
msgid ""
"I see you don't have my skull yet. Well, that's ok. I've been here for a very long time. I don't mind another century or so. Don't worry about me. I'll just keep washing up on the shore here."
msgstr "我看你们还没拿到我的头骨。没关系。我在这里待了很久很久了。再多一个世纪左右我也不介意。别担心我。我会继续在这片海岸上被冲来冲去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2300
msgid ""
"I hate the surf. I have been trapped here since I died, crashing forward and pulling back, forward and back. I am sick of it. If you bring my skull and cast it into the surf here, I will be set free. I think my skull was pulled by the currents to the south and lies near the edge of the world. Retrieve my skull and I will teach you a spell before I go."
msgstr "我恨海浪。我死后就一直困在这里，向前撞，向后拉，向前，向后。我烦透了。如果你们把我的头骨带来，扔进这里的海浪里，我就自由了。我想我的头骨被洋流冲向了南边，就在世界的边缘附近。把我的头骨取回来，我走之前会教你们一个法术。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2307
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2308
msgid ""
"You came! Up here a spirit hears things. Alamar is not his name. Read the plaques of this city before you go to his castle, and do not go without a way to hide what you carry from him."
msgstr "你们来了！在这上面，灵魂能听到很多事。阿拉玛不是他的名字。去他城堡之前，先读读这座城的牌匾，还要带上能向他隐藏你们随身之物的办法，否则别去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2316
msgid "The Whistle! Thank you. I'll activate the statues now. Bye."
msgstr "哨子！谢谢。我这就激活雕像。再见。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2325
msgid ""
"No luck finding the whistle? Well, if you find it be sure to bring it back to me. I'm sure I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek."
msgstr "没找到哨子？好吧，找到了一定要带回来给我。我肯定是把它掉在干草叉溪的什么地方了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2328
msgid ""
"A couple of years ago I built a statue on each of the two islands near here. The statues are supposed to teach spellcasters the cure poison and cure disease spells, but I lost the bone whistle needed to activate them. I think I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek. If you can find my whistle I will activate the statues."
msgstr "几年前，我在这附近的两座岛上各建了一座雕像。雕像本该教施法者治疗中毒和治疗疾病的法术，可我把激活它们需要的骨哨弄丢了。我想是掉在干草叉溪的什么地方了。如果你们能找到我的哨子，我就去激活雕像。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2335
msgid "Whistle"
msgstr "哨子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2337
msgid ""
"The statues are awake. Each holds a book for the first caster who comes."
msgstr "雕像醒了。每一座都为第一个到来的施法者准备了一本书。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2361
msgid "Thanks for the ingredients. I'll make a batch right away."
msgstr "谢谢你们带来材料。我马上调一批。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2371
msgid "What, no Phirna root? I can't make you any potions without the root."
msgstr "什么，没有菲尔纳草根？没有草根，我没法给你们做药剂。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2374
msgid ""
"Toad meadow is the only known source of Phirna root, a vital ingredient in antidote potions. The witches of the meadow have been turning everyone they find into toads, so I don't dare go there. I will give you five potions for each Phirna root you bring me."
msgstr "蟾蜍草地是已知唯一出产菲尔纳草根的地方，这是解毒药剂的关键原料。草地上的女巫把她们碰到的所有人都变成了蟾蜍，所以我不敢去。你们每带给我一根菲尔纳草根，我就给你们五瓶药剂。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2380
msgid ""
"You have rescued my Celia! I am so grateful to you for reuniting us. As payment for your services, please accept this treasure."
msgstr "你们救回了我的西莉亚！谢谢你们让我们团聚。作为酬劳，请收下这件宝物。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2390
msgid "You have not rescued Celia from the zombies yet. Please hurry."
msgstr "你们还没把西莉亚从僵尸手里救出来。请快一点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2393
msgid ""
"I am searching for my intended bride, Celia. She was tending her family's sheep when zombies snatched her and disappeared into the Forest of the Walking Dead. The forest is so large and the zombies so many I'll need help to rescue her before they turn her into one of them. Help me, please."
msgstr "我在找我的未婚妻西莉亚。她在放她家的羊时，被僵尸抓走，消失在行尸森林里。那座森林那么大，僵尸那么多，我需要有人帮忙，才能赶在它们把她变成同类之前救出她。请帮帮我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2400
msgid "Celia"
msgstr "西莉亚"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2402
msgid ""
"No zombies down here. Gremlins, cobras, the odd hornet. Celia says it's an improvement."
msgstr "这下面没有僵尸。只有地精、眼镜蛇和偶尔的黄蜂。西莉亚说这已经是进步了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2406
msgid "We are to be married. Somewhere with fewer zombies."
msgstr "我们要结婚了。在僵尸少一点的地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2414
msgid "Untie"
msgstr "解开"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2415
msgid ""
"You cut the ropes. \"Derek sent you? Bless him. I'll find my own way to his camp, zombies or no zombies.\""
msgstr "你们割断了绳子。“德里克派你们来的？上帝保佑他。我自己去他的营地，不管有没有僵尸。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2423 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4281
msgid "The sword"
msgstr "剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2424
msgid ""
"Derek found this on the road down. It's too good a sword for a man who mostly carries firewood, I told him, and the people who carried me out of a zombie wood should have it. Take it."
msgstr "这是德里克在下山的路上找到的。我告诉他，这把剑对一个主要扛柴火的人来说太好了，应该给把我从僵尸森林里带出来的人。拿去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2434
msgid ""
"Thank you for getting rid of the Ogres. Here is your reward. The upriver run opens tomorrow."
msgstr "谢谢你们赶走了食人妖。这是你们的奖励。明天上游的航线就开通了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2443
msgid ""
"The Ogres aren't gone yet. I think their base of operation is in the hills to the Northwest of here, up the north river."
msgstr "食人妖还没走。我想它们的老巢在这儿西北边的山丘里，沿北河往上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2446
msgid ""
"Those Ogres are ruining me! For months they have been throwing boulders at the boats that ply the waters around here. Three of my ships have gone to the bottom in as many months because the Ogres like the sound of crunching wood and screaming men. I want those Ogres gone and I am willing to pay well for the service."
msgstr "那些食人妖要毁了我！几个月来，它们一直朝在这一带水域航行的船扔巨石。三个月里我已经沉了三条船，因为食人妖喜欢木头被压碎的声音和人们的惨叫。我要那些食人妖消失，并且愿意为此重金酬谢。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2453 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3220
msgid "Ogres"
msgstr "食人妖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2455
msgid ""
"Not a boulder in a month! The boats run upriver again, and my crews have stopped flinching at loud noises. Mostly."
msgstr "一个月没有一块巨石了！船又能往上游开了，我的船员也不再被响声吓得缩脖子了。大部分时候。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2464
msgid ""
"You bought one of Joe's treasure maps?!? Hahahahaha! Sorry. Here, let me give you a REAL treasure map. I'm too old to chase after treasure."
msgstr "你们买了乔的藏宝图？！？哈哈哈哈哈！抱歉。来，我给你们一张真正的藏宝图。我太老了，追不动宝了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2478
msgid ""
"You already have the only one of its kind. Two would be greedy, and it would make the first one less unique."
msgstr "你们已经有了独一无二的那张。有两张就太贪心了，还会让第一张没那么独一无二。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2482
msgid ""
"Friend, have I got a deal for you! Only 1000 gold for this secret treasure map, discovered during my travels on Darkside. Only one of its kind! (Behind him stands a crate of them.)"
msgstr "朋友，我有笔买卖要给你！这张秘密藏宝图只要 1000 金币，是我在暗面旅行时发现的。独一无二！（他身后摆着一箱这样的图。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2490
msgid ""
"Another one? Only one of its kind, friend, and still 1000 gold. Come back when your purse agrees."
msgstr "又来一张？独一无二，朋友，还是 1000 金币。等你的钱包同意了再来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2493
msgid ""
"Treasure maps! Genuine! Only one of its kind, 1000 gold. (Joe looks at your purse and loses interest.)"
msgstr "藏宝图！正宗的！独一无二，1000 金币。（乔看了看你们的钱包，失去了兴趣。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2497 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:434
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:443 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:820
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:826 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:649 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x7.lua:222
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x7.lua:249
msgid "Vertigo"
msgstr "眩晕镇"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2498
msgid ""
"Vertigo? Never heard of it. Different Joe. I'm in maps now. Maps don't breed."
msgstr "眩晕镇？没听说过。是另一个乔。我现在做地图生意。地图不会繁殖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2504
msgid "Treasure map"
msgstr "藏宝图"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2506
msgid ""
"The map was interesting. The thing at the end of it was more interesting. You don't get to know what it was."
msgstr "地图很有意思。地图尽头的东西更有意思。你们不会知道那是什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2510
msgid ""
"You dug it up yourselves? Then you have a hole and no map. I have neither. We're even."
msgstr "你们自己把它挖出来了？那你们有个坑，没有地图。我两样都没有。扯平了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2514
msgid ""
"A treasure map. Hmmm. Perhaps it leads to something interesting, perhaps not. I am willing to look, whereas you don't really have the time, do you? I'll give you 4,000 gold for it."
msgstr "一张藏宝图。嗯。也许它通向什么有趣的东西，也许不。我愿意去看看，而你们其实没有时间，对吧？我出 4,000 金币买它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2520
msgid "I am Slibo. I collect maps, and the things at the end of them."
msgstr "我是斯利博。我收集地图，还有地图尽头的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2525
msgid ""
"Dragon tax! 2,000 gold pieces and 20 gems fly from your packs and into the urn on the counter. Peering inside the urn, you see that your money has vanished. Scaldrith stamps a receipt. \"Proceed. Mind the dragons; they are exempt from manners.\""
msgstr "龙税！2,000 金币和 20 颗宝石从你们的背包里飞出来，落进柜台上的瓮里。你们朝瓮里一看，钱都不见了。斯卡尔德里斯盖了一枚收据章。“请进。当心龙；它们不受礼貌约束。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2532
msgid ""
"Everyone who wants an audience with the Dragon King pays the dragon tax: two thousand gold and twenty gems. No gems, no audience. No exceptions. I was an exception once. Never again."
msgstr "每个想觐见龙王的人都要交龙税：两千金币和二十颗宝石。没宝石，不觐见。没有例外。我曾经是个例外。再也不了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2539
msgid "The tax"
msgstr "税"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2541
msgid ""
"Paid in full. Keep the receipt. The dragons inside don't ask for it, but they do eat people who argue."
msgstr "已全额缴纳。收好收据。里面的龙不会要它，但它们会吃掉争辩的人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2551
msgid ""
"A dragon who pays tax and reads. Rarer than gold. The last lesson costs the most, and you have paid it. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr "一条交税又识字的龙。比金子还稀罕。最后一课最贵，而你已经付了。起身吧，大巨龙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2559
msgid ""
"Another dragon who reads? The office is becoming a library. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr "又一条识字的龙？办公室快变成图书馆了。起身吧，大巨龙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2563
msgid ""
"Great Wyrms are made of dragons, and you have none with you. Paperwork does not stretch that far."
msgstr "大巨龙是由龙组成的，而你们身边没有龙。文书工作可没法延伸到那么远。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2571
msgid ""
"You have saved Castleview from the wicked Gremlins! Oh, frabjous day! Here is your gold, and a pass, so the gate stops arguing with you."
msgstr "你们把堡景镇从邪恶的地精手里救出来了！哦，何等欢乐的一天！这是你们的金币，还有一张通行证，好让城门别再跟你们争论。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2581
msgid "The Gremlins' reign of terror persists. No gold for you."
msgstr "地精的恐怖统治仍在继续。没有金币给你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2584
msgid ""
"I am the mouthpiece of Castleview. The treasury will pay well for ending the Gremlins' mischief in town. Their king, Gettlewaithe, holds court in a burrow under our wall."
msgstr "我是堡景镇的喉舌。要是你们能结束地精在镇上的恶作剧，国库会重金酬谢。他们的国王格特尔韦特，在我们城墙下的一个洞穴里坐朝。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2592 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4425
msgid "Gremlins"
msgstr "地精"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2594
msgid "Castleview likes you! Visit anytime!"
msgstr "堡景镇喜欢你们！随时来访！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2602
msgid "Gettlewaithe's gift"
msgstr "格特尔韦特的礼物"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2603
msgid ""
"This came from the burrow this morning, with a note: 'For the delegation. Sir.' Three Energy Disks. I believe that is a gremlin apology. Take them before they explode."
msgstr "这是今早从洞穴里送来的，附着一张字条：“献给代表团。阁下。”三块能量盘。我想这是地精的道歉。快拿走，不然它们要炸了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3302
msgid "We come in peace"
msgstr "我们为和平而来"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2615 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2628 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2645
msgid "I am always at your service, sir."
msgstr "我随时为您效劳，阁下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2619
msgid "Yes, yes, you live. What else?"
msgstr "是的，是的，你们活着。还有什么事？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2622
msgid ""
"Excellent. Your display of respect has earned you your lives. What have you come to petition me for?"
msgstr "很好。你们表现出的敬意保住了你们的性命。你们来向我请愿什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2626
msgid "The Mayor's demand"
msgstr "镇长的要求"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2632
msgid "I am not interested in hearing from the butts of our jokes. Begone!"
msgstr "我不想听我们的笑柄说话。滚！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2636
msgid ""
"Well, um, perhaps I can do something about those naughty, naughty pranksters. We can still talk about this like rational beings, can't we?"
msgstr "嗯，呃，也许我能对付一下那些淘气、淘气的恶作剧者。我们仍然可以像讲道理的人一样谈谈这件事，不是吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2639
msgid ""
"The answer is no! You will now suffer the consequences of your audacity. Guards!"
msgstr "答案是不行！你们将为你们的胆大妄为承担后果。卫兵！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2643
msgid "Submit or die"
msgstr "屈服，否则就死"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2649
msgid ""
"Yes, sir. I will do as you ask without delay. The sewers, the bridges, the mill. All of it. Sir."
msgstr "是，阁下。我会毫不拖延地照您说的办。下水道、桥、磨坊。所有的。阁下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2656
msgid "I see. Guards! Remove this rabble from my court!"
msgstr "我明白了。卫兵！把这帮乌合之众从我的朝堂上轰出去！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2660
msgid "(yawn) Off with their heads."
msgstr "（打哈欠）把他们的头砍了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2666
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing my brother! Here's a little money for your trouble. If you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr "谢谢你们放了我哥哥！这点钱，聊表辛苦。以后你们想知道什么关于地图的事，尽管来找我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2674
msgid ""
"My brother still languishes in the town jail. I hope it's not too much to ask for you to hurry."
msgstr "我哥哥还在镇上的监狱里受苦。希望你们能快一点，不算要求太多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2677
msgid ""
"I'm Jethro, brother of Jasper. Jasper is in Castleview jail, falsely accused of stealing a treasure map from Joe, the treasure map salesman. Joe is a crook, but I can't prove it. Maybe you could break Jasper out. I'm not strong enough to do it."
msgstr "我是杰思罗，贾斯珀的弟弟。贾斯珀在堡景镇监狱里，被诬陷偷了藏宝图商人乔的一张藏宝图。乔是个骗子，但我证明不了。也许你们能把贾斯珀救出来。我没那么强壮，做不到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2687
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, friends! Remember, if you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们，朋友们！记住，以后你们想知道什么关于地图的事，尽管来找我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2697
msgid "Jasper's gone. Less paperwork. I'm not asking how."
msgstr "贾斯珀走了。文书工作少了。我不问是怎么回事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2701
msgid ""
"Let me see that. A map of nowhere, in Joe's hand, signed 'genuine'. For a thousand gold? Jasper didn't steal this, nobody would. He's free to go. Don't tell Joe I can read."
msgstr "让我看看。一张通往无处的地图，在乔手里，署名“正宗”。要一千金币？贾斯珀没偷这个，没人会偷。他可以走了。别告诉乔我识字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2706
msgid ""
"Jasper stole a map from Joe. Joe says so, and Joe is very convincing. Bring me proof otherwise, or bring me a nap."
msgstr "贾斯珀偷了乔的一张地图。乔这么说，而乔很有说服力。给我拿出相反的证据来，或者给我拿一张午睡用的垫子来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2711
msgid "Thanks for freeing me! I knew Jethro would find help."
msgstr "谢谢你们放了我！我就知道杰思罗会找到帮手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2714
msgid ""
"Joe sold the fake maps. I drew the real ones. Guess which of us is in jail. The back window's bars are older than the warden."
msgstr "假地图是乔卖的。真地图是我画的。猜猜我们俩谁在坐牢。后窗的栏杆比典狱长还老。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2718
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: No word, no bond, row on. Now do I repay a period won. Go, now, and visit Sister Hannah for more enlightenment."
msgstr "啊，听众们！让我来启发你们：No word, no bond, row on. Now do I repay a period won. 去吧，现在，去拜访汉娜修女，获得更多启发。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2737 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2750
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2763
msgid "Lesson"
msgstr "课程"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2729
msgid "Learned you have. Hannah Sister to go, now."
msgstr "学会了，你们。汉娜修女，现在去找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2739
msgid "Learned you have. Bob Brother to go, now."
msgstr "学会了，你们。鲍勃修士，现在去找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2743
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Oh who was it I saw, oh who? He lived as a devil, eh? Go, now, and visit Brother Bob for more enlightenment."
msgstr "啊，听众们！让我来启发你们：Oh who was it I saw, oh who? He lived as a devil, eh? 去吧，现在，去拜访鲍勃修士，获得更多启发。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2747 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2760 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2778
msgid "Order wrong the. Otto first, Brother. Lesson one."
msgstr "顺序错了。奥托先，修士。第一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2752
msgid "Learned you have. Ada Sister to go, now."
msgstr "学会了，你们。艾达修女，现在去找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2756
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Eva, can I stab bats in a cave? Was it a rat I saw? Go, now, and visit Sister Ada for more enlightenment."
msgstr "啊，听众们！让我来启发你们：Eva, can I stab bats in a cave? Was it a rat I saw? 去吧，现在，去拜访艾达修女，获得更多启发。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2765
msgid "Drawkcab a are you. Reger Brother see. The word say: palindrome."
msgstr "倒序僧，你们是。雷格修士，去见。那个词，说出来：palindrome（回文）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2769
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Live on time; emit no evil. Lepers repel. Congratulations! I dub thee a member of the Drawkcab! We study the palindrome, the word that reads the same both ways. Brother Reger, outside the walls, will ask you for it."
msgstr "啊，听众们！Live on time; emit no evil. Lepers repel. 恭喜！我封你为倒序僧的一员！我们研究回文，那个正着读倒着读都一样的词。城墙外的雷格修士会问你们这个词。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2783
msgid ""
"Correct. You are truly a Drawkcab! Those of you who walk the inner way walk it now as Masters. Backwards, naturally."
msgstr "正确。你们真是倒序僧！走内在之道的人，现在以大师之身行走。倒着走，当然。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2791
msgid ""
"Correct. A Drawkcab truly are you. Masters, though, ready not yet are you. Return when the Queen's castle stands higher."
msgstr "正确。倒序僧，你们真是。不过大师，还没准备好，你们。等女王的城堡立得更高了再来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2795
msgid ""
"There is a word for what the monks of Castleview study. Say it at my door, not in my ear."
msgstr "堡景镇的僧侣研究的东西有个词。在我的门前说，别在我耳边说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2798
msgid ""
"Wrong. Go visit the monks of Castleview for enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr "错了。去拜访堡景镇的僧侣获得启发，等你们觉得准备好了再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2804
msgid "The word"
msgstr "那个词"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2806
msgid "Pleased to see you, fellow Drawkcabs."
msgstr "很高兴见到你们，倒序僧同道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2816
msgid ""
"Every lid down, in order. Quite an accomplishment. Here: a few things people stored and never came back for."
msgstr "每个盖子都按顺序合上了。相当了不起。给，这是一些人存了再也没回来取的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2826
msgid "Half the chests. Half an accomplishment. I don't pay in halves."
msgstr "只合了一半的箱子。只有一半的成就。我不按一半付钱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2829
msgid ""
"Public Storage: put things in, take things out, in the right order. Close every chest. The numbers count themselves, one to nine. The letters spell something you'd find in a barn: PITCHFORK."
msgstr "公共仓库：把东西放进去，再拿出来，要按正确的顺序。把每个箱子都合上。数字会自己数，一到九。字母拼出的东西，你在谷仓里能找到：PITCHFORK（干草叉）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2837
msgid "The chests"
msgstr "箱子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2839
msgid ""
"To close all of the chests is quite an accomplishment, but to open them requires intellect most uncommon. Don't try. I just got them shut."
msgstr "把所有箱子合上相当了不起，但要打开它们需要极不寻常的智力。别试。我刚把它们关好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2849
msgid ""
"You've killed the Queen Rat! Here is your reward: my chest. Go on, open it. It's yours. Thanks."
msgstr "你们杀了鼠后！这是你们的奖励：我的箱子。去吧，打开它。是你们的了。谢谢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2854
msgid ""
"The Queen Rat is still alive. I can hear her awful chittering through the walls. No reward for you yet!"
msgstr "鼠后还活着。我能隔着墙听到她可怕的吱吱声。你们还没有奖励！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2857
msgid ""
"Hi. I live down here. There sure are a lot of rats. Too many for me to kill. Maybe you could kill the Queen Rat for me. I'll give you something if you do."
msgstr "嗨。我住在这下面。这里的老鼠真多。多得我杀不过来。也许你们能替我杀了鼠后。你们要是杀了，我会给你们点东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2865
msgid "Rats"
msgstr "老鼠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2867
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2877
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help in the battle against the heretics. Ours is the true religion, and Mok has sided with the righteous. Those of you who serve the light, Mok raises up; the rest of you get gold."
msgstr "谢谢你们在对抗异端的战斗中出力。我们的才是真正的宗教，莫克站在正义一边。你们当中侍奉光明的人，莫克会提拔你们；其余的人得到金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2888
msgid ""
"My door is open, but the Cult Leader still preaches on the top floor. Mok does not share a tower."
msgstr "我的门开着，但教团领袖还在顶层布道。莫克不和别人共用一座塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2892
msgid ""
"You went up their rope? Good. The key to my door is on the top floor, by their altar. Bring it down and let me in."
msgstr "你们顺着他们的绳子爬上去了？好。我的门钥匙在顶层他们的祭坛边。把它带下来，放我进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2896
msgid ""
"Your failure to breach the tower is not your fault; it is a test of my determination to cleanse the faith of heresy. I implore you to continue your efforts on my behalf."
msgstr "你们没能攻进塔，这不是你们的错；这是对我净化信仰异端的决心的考验。我恳请你们继续为我努力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2899
msgid ""
"Oh, wretched fortune! I, Dreyfus, high priest of Mok, have been cast from my tower by heretics in the priesthood! They warded the door against me, but they still haul their bread up a rope on the north wall. Perhaps you could climb in from the top and open the tower to me again."
msgstr "噢，可悲的命运！我，莫克的大祭司德赖弗斯，被神职里的异端赶出了我的塔！他们封了门不让我进，却仍然沿着北墙的绳子往上吊面包。也许你们能从顶上爬进去，把塔重新开给我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2907
msgid "Heretics"
msgstr "异端"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2909
msgid "It is always pleasing to be honored with your presence, my friends."
msgstr "能得到你们光临的荣幸，总是令人欣慰，我的朋友们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2917
msgid "The clerics"
msgstr "牧师们"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2918
msgid ""
"Humble and Pious came to me and begged forgiveness. I gave them the latrines. Mok is merciful; I am thorough."
msgstr "谦卑和虔诚来找我，乞求原谅。我让他们去扫厕所。莫克仁慈；我彻底。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2926
msgid ""
"Five ruby rocks and two gems. Give me an hour. There. Ruby. Mind the edge."
msgstr "五块红宝石岩，两颗宝石。给我一个小时。好了。红宝石。当心边缘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2937
msgid "The rocks are fine. The fee is two gems, and you have the rocks."
msgstr "岩石没问题。费用是两颗宝石，而你们有岩石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2940
msgid ""
"With 5 Ruby rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 2 gems. The rocks are in the Gemstone Mines; I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Ruby rocks."
msgstr "有 5 块红宝石岩，我就能为你们做一件武器或一件盔甲。费用是 2 颗宝石。岩石在宝石矿场里；抱歉，你们的红宝石岩不够。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2947
msgid ""
"Five emerald rocks and four gems. Emerald steel never dulls. Neither does my invoice."
msgstr "五块祖母绿岩，四颗宝石。祖母绿钢永不钝。我的账单也一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2958
msgid "Rocks, yes. Gems, no. Four gems."
msgstr "岩石，有。宝石，没有。四颗宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2961
msgid ""
"With 5 Emerald rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 4 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Emerald rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr "有 5 块祖母绿岩，我就能为你们做一件武器或一件盔甲。费用是 4 颗宝石。抱歉，你们的祖母绿岩不够。够了再来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2968
msgid ""
"Five sapphire rocks, six gems. Sapphire keeps you cool under fire. Literally. Don't test it on me."
msgstr "五块蓝宝石岩，六颗宝石。蓝宝石能让你在火线下保持冷静。字面意义上的。别拿我来试。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2979
msgid "Six gems. Then we talk sapphire."
msgstr "六颗宝石。然后再谈蓝宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2982
msgid ""
"With 5 Sapphire rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 6 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Sapphire rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr "有 5 块蓝宝石岩，我就能为你们做一件武器或一件盔甲。费用是 6 颗宝石。抱歉，你们的蓝宝石岩不够。够了再来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2989
msgid "Five diamonds, ten gems. Diamonds are forever. So was the wait. Here."
msgstr "五颗钻石，十颗宝石。钻石恒久远。等待也是。给。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3000
msgid "Ten gems. Diamonds don't cut themselves."
msgstr "十颗宝石。钻石不会自己切。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3003
msgid ""
"With 5 diamonds I can make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 10 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough diamonds. Come back when you do!"
msgstr "有 5 颗钻石，我就能为你们做一件武器或一件盔甲。费用是 10 颗宝石。抱歉，你们的钻石不够。够了再来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3010
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! You've found the emerald handle. Here's something for your trouble: the staff. I fixed it, cast one spell to prove I still could, and retired. Take it."
msgstr "哦，谢谢你们！你们找到了翡翠柄。这是给你们的辛苦费：法杖。我修好了它，施了一个法术证明我还行，然后就退休了。拿去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3019
msgid ""
"You haven't found my staff's emerald handle yet. Keep searching. I can reward you."
msgstr "你们还没找到我法杖的翡翠柄。继续找。我会酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3022
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost the emerald handle that fits on the end of my magical staff. It must have come off on my journey back from visiting Sandcaster. Find it, and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr "我好像把装在魔法杖末端的翡翠柄弄丢了。一定是在我从沙堡镇回来的路上掉的。找到它，我不会让你们白忙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3030
msgid "Emerald handle"
msgstr "翡翠柄"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3032
msgid "Retirement suits me. I sit, I read, I do not look for handles."
msgstr "退休生活很适合我。我坐着，我读书，我不找柄。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3042
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I saved the seeds from the Monga Melons you gave me, and now I'm growing my own! (He eats yours anyway.) (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr "嗨！很高兴再见到你们。你们给我的蒙加甜瓜，我留了籽，现在自己种了！（反正他还是把你们的吃了。）（叹气）我爱蒙加甜瓜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3047
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I'm growing my own melons now. (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr "嗨！很高兴再见到你们。我现在自己种瓜了。（叹气）我爱蒙加甜瓜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3051
msgid ""
"Well, it's about time! I practically starved to death waiting for you to return with my Monga Melons. Yum. Here's what I promised you: something shiny I found in the Temple of Bark, in the heart of the forest. Nobody locks it. Nobody comes back out, either."
msgstr "哎呀，总算来了！我等你们带蒙加甜瓜回来，差点饿死。真好吃。这是我答应你们的：我在森林深处树皮庙里找到的一件闪亮东西。没人锁那庙。也没人从里面出来过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3062
msgid ""
"You didn't bring me enough Monga Melons. I'm practically starving to death. Of all the rotten things to do to a poor monkeydog. Three!"
msgstr "你们带来的蒙加甜瓜不够。我快饿死了。对一只可怜的猴狗干这种缺德事。三个！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3065
msgid ""
"There is nothing in this world that I love more than Monga Melons. The sweetest grow in the southern meadowlands, home of the most vicious centipedes. Bring me three, and I'll give you something shiny."
msgstr "这世上我最爱的就是蒙加甜瓜。最甜的长在南边的草地上，那里住着最凶的蜈蚣。给我带三个来，我就给你们一件闪亮的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3072
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward. And those of you who hunt: the forest has taught you all it can. Walk it now as its lords."
msgstr "谢谢你们！见到她回来真好。这是你们的奖励。还有你们当中的猎手：森林能教你们的都教了。现在，以森林之主的身份在里面行走吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3081
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward: two Energy Disks and a LOT of gold, as agreed."
msgstr "谢谢你们！见到她回来真好。这是你们的奖励：两块能量盘和一大笔金币，说好的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3089
msgid ""
"You have not rescued her yet. Keep trying. We think she was taken by the Orcs into the Temple of Bark."
msgstr "你们还没救出她。继续努力。我们认为她被兽人抓进了树皮庙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3092
msgid ""
"I am Sharla, First of the Sprites. We have a problem. The Orcs have kidnapped one of our sisters. Can you help her?"
msgstr "我是莎拉，小精灵之首。我们遇到了麻烦。兽人绑架了我们的一位姐妹。你们能帮她吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3100
msgid "Sheewana"
msgstr "希瓦娜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3102
msgid ""
"You came into our forest with your hands on your purses and ours. We pay nothing to robbers."
msgstr "你们走进我们森林的时候，手按着你们的钱包，也按着我们的。我们不给强盗付钱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3106
msgid ""
"We are always pleased to see heroes such as yourselves. You are welcome in our forest."
msgstr "我们总是很高兴见到像你们这样的英雄。欢迎你们来我们的森林。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3114
msgid "Certainly"
msgstr "当然。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3115
msgid "Thank you so much! Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr "太感谢了！去树皮庙，把她放出来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3122
msgid "What's in it for us?"
msgstr "我们能得到什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3123
msgid ""
"We have two Energy Disks and some gold to give you after you rescue her. A LOT of gold? Very well. A lot. Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr "你们救出她以后，我们有两块能量盘和一些金币送给你们。一大笔金币？好吧。一大笔。去树皮庙，把她放出来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3130
msgid "This is a stick up!"
msgstr "抢劫！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3131
msgid "Sisters, we are under attack! Stop them!"
msgstr "姐妹们，我们遭到攻击了！拦住他们！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3138
msgid "Home"
msgstr "家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3140
msgid "Take me home. Oh, you did. How proper."
msgstr "带我回家。哦，你们做到了。真得体。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3144
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing me. I will return now to my sisters and tell them of your heroic deed!"
msgstr "谢谢你们放了我。我现在回我的姐妹们那里，把你们的英勇事迹告诉她们！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3152
msgid ""
"You came for me? Oh, how proper. The cage is locked, and Shaalth keeps the key on his belt."
msgstr "你们是来找我的？哦，真得体。笼子锁着，钥匙在沙尔斯的腰带上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3157
msgid "Orcs can't jump. Remember that, and their ledges are yours."
msgstr "兽人不会跳。记住这一点，它们的壁架就是你们的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3160
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing me from these foul orcs. Remember, Orcs can't jump."
msgstr "谢谢你们把我从这些邪恶的兽人手里救出来。记住，兽人不会跳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3168
msgid ""
"The sun! Somewhere up there. I'm going to go and look at it for a week."
msgstr "太阳！就在上面某处。我要去看它一个星期。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3171
msgid "Thank you for saving me. I haven't seen the sun in days!"
msgstr "谢谢你们救了我。我好几天没见到太阳了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3179
msgid "Snog not do evil. Snog not go back in cell either."
msgstr "斯诺格不作恶。斯诺格也不回牢房。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3182
msgid ""
"The rest of the Orcs imprisoned me for refusing to do evil. Thanks for getting me out of there."
msgstr "其他兽人因为我不肯作恶把我关了起来。谢谢你们把我从那里弄出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3190
msgid "Don't drink the Shaman's tea. I mean it."
msgstr "别喝萨满的茶。我是认真的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3193
msgid "The Orc Shaman tells lies, and his tea is poisonous. Watch yourself."
msgstr "兽人萨满说谎，他的茶有毒。当心点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3201
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting rid of the Ogres! My caravans can now get through the pass safely. Here, take this gold as a reward."
msgstr "太感谢你们赶走了食人妖！我的商队现在可以安全穿过隘口了。来，拿着这些金币作为奖励。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3209
msgid "There are still Ogres attacking my caravans. Please do something!"
msgstr "还是有食人妖在袭击我的商队。请做点什么！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3212
msgid ""
"These blasted Ogres are killing my business. Every time I try to get a caravan through Ogre Pass they attack it, stealing everything. Get rid of them for me. There is a reward, and a bounty if both their forts burn."
msgstr "这些该死的食人妖在毁我的生意。每次我想让商队通过食人妖隘口，它们就袭击，把东西抢个精光。替我除掉它们。有奖励，如果它们的两座堡寨都烧了，还有赏金。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3222
msgid "The caravans run through Ogre Pass on time. Nearly on time. On a day."
msgstr "商队按时通过食人妖隘口了。差不多按时。在某一天。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3231
msgid ""
"Two forts, burned to the ground. The bounty, as promised. And those of you who hunt for pay: the caravan guild has a title for hunters like you."
msgstr "两座堡寨，烧成了平地。赏金，如约奉上。还有你们当中为钱打猎的人：商队行会有一个适合你们这样的猎手的头衔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3242
msgid "Gifts"
msgstr "礼物"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3244
msgid ""
"We accept gift and won't pull your arms out of sockets today. What do you want?"
msgstr "我们接受礼物，今天不把你们胳膊从肩膀上扯下来。你们要什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3250
msgid "Gift is gold. You have no gold. Why you talk?"
msgstr "礼物是金币。你们没有金币。你们为什么说话？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3256
msgid "Pharaoh's oath"
msgstr "法老的誓言"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3257
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh is chief of nothing, now. Alamar is chief. We work for Alamar. We pull your arms out of socket now."
msgstr "龙法老现在什么也不是的首领。阿拉玛是首领。我们为阿拉玛干活。我们现在把你们的胳膊从肩膀上扯下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3264
msgid "Bow low, slave!"
msgstr "低头，奴隶！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3265
msgid "Har Har Har! We LIKE! You make big laugh! You friends. What you need?"
msgstr "哈哈哈！我们喜欢！你们让我们大笑！你们是朋友。你们需要什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3273 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3324
msgid "Energy disks"
msgstr "能量盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3275
msgid "We have no more energy disks."
msgstr "我们没有更多的能量盘了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3278
msgid ""
"We are Ogres! We take what we want. Yesterday, we took the Sardaj's Energy disks! (grunt) Here are two energy disks. Caravans? Fine. We let caravans pass. Boring, but fine."
msgstr "我们是食人妖！我们想拿什么就拿什么。昨天，我们拿了萨尔达人的能量盘！（咕噜）给，这是两块能量盘。商队？行。我们让商队过。无聊，但行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4145
msgid "Orcs"
msgstr "兽人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3289
msgid ""
"The Orcs captured a sprite a little while ago... Har! (snort) Har! They sacrifice them to their God sometimes."
msgstr "兽人不久前抓了一个小精灵……哈！（哼）哈！他们有时拿小精灵祭神。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3296
msgid ""
"We didn't know you fight against Alamar. He pay us much gold to be on his side. Because we like you, we pretend you didn't say that."
msgstr "我们不知道你们对抗阿拉玛。他付给我们很多金币让我们站在他那边。因为我们喜欢你们，我们假装你们没说过那话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3303
msgid ""
"I am Yog, chief of the Sardaj tribe. You do not come for battle? Then you are welcome among us."
msgstr "我是约格，萨尔达部落的酋长。你们不是来打仗的？那你们在我们这儿受欢迎。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3314
msgid "Battle!"
msgstr "战斗！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3315
msgid "Then you shall not leave these lands alive!"
msgstr "那你们别想活着离开这片土地！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3325
msgid ""
"We would gladly give energy disks to you if we had them, but the Ogres stole the only ones we owned."
msgstr "要是我们有能量盘，会很乐意给你们，可是食人妖把我们仅有的几块偷走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3331
msgid "Help against Alamar"
msgstr "对抗阿拉玛的帮助"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3333
msgid ""
"You are welcome among us, friend. The giants of the desert are our friends too. Tell Gurodel that Yog sent you."
msgstr "朋友，你在我们中间受欢迎。沙漠里的巨人也是我们的朋友。告诉古罗德尔是约格派你们来的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3336
msgid ""
"We will fill your packs with food so that your journey will be without hunger."
msgstr "我们会把你们的背包装满食物，让你们的旅途不挨饿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3344
msgid "Give gold"
msgstr "给金币"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3346
msgid ""
"Hobstadt wants all. You give two thousand. Hobstadt cannot count past two thousand. Good. Go where you like."
msgstr "霍布施塔特要全部。你们给两千。霍布施塔特数不到两千以上。好。想去哪儿去哪儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3351
msgid "That is not all. That is not anything. Give gold, give one, or fight."
msgstr "那不是全部。那什么都不是。给金币，给一个，或者打。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3357
msgid "Sacrifice one"
msgstr "献祭一个"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3359
msgid ""
"Another troll? Hobstadt take him too. One night. (Morning.) War Troll. Hobstadt has two friends now."
msgstr "又一个巨魔？霍布施塔特也带走他。一晚上。（早上。）战争巨魔。霍布施塔特现在有两个朋友了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3364
msgid "Hobstadt has his War Troll. Go where you like."
msgstr "霍布施塔特有他的战争巨魔了。想去哪儿去哪儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3368
msgid ""
"Troll in your party. Hobstadt take him. One night. (Morning. Your troll comes back taller, with new scars and no regrets.) Now he is War Troll. You are friends of Hobstadt."
msgstr "你们队伍里有巨魔。霍布施塔特带走他。一晚上。（早上。你们的巨魔回来了，更高了，带着新伤疤，毫无悔意。）现在他是战争巨魔。你们是霍布施塔特的朋友。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3374
msgid ""
"No troll. Hobstadt not eat your kind. Too many bones. You paid. Go where you like."
msgstr "没有巨魔。霍布施塔特不吃你们这种。骨头太多。你们付过了。想去哪儿去哪儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3377
msgid ""
"No troll. Hobstadt not eat your kind. Too many bones. Give gold, or fight."
msgstr "没有巨魔。霍布施塔特不吃你们这种。骨头太多。给金币，或者打。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3383
msgid "Fight to the death"
msgstr "死战"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3384
msgid "Good."
msgstr "好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3391
msgid "Thieves' gold"
msgstr "盗贼的金币"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3392
msgid "Thief gold in back. Hobstadt not like thieves. Take."
msgstr "盗贼的金币在后面。霍布施塔特不喜欢盗贼。拿去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3400
msgid ""
"Thank you. You have done both me and Sandcaster a great service. The quarter is open again. And those of you who walked their halls unseen: the guilds have a word for people like you. Spies. Good ones."
msgstr "谢谢你们。你们为我和沙堡镇做了一件大好事。这一区重新开放了。还有你们当中偷偷走过他们大厅的人：行会对你们这样的人有个说法。密探。很好的密探。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3409
msgid ""
"One of them is gone. The other is still on a guild throne, and twice as careful. Finish it."
msgstr "其中一个走了。另一个还坐在行会的宝座上，加倍小心。把它干掉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3413
msgid ""
"Every day that Sandcaster suffers under the rule of these evil masters is a day ill spent. Everyone is relying on you to put matters right."
msgstr "沙堡镇在这些邪恶主人的统治下受苦的每一天，都是虚度的一天。大家都指望你们把事情纠正过来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3416
msgid ""
"Two years ago, Xenoc the Wizard and Morgana the Sorceress came to town with visions of conquest. They ruined my good name and made themselves heads of the guilds. Now I am dethroned, and the guilds are wicked. Will you help right the wrong?"
msgstr "两年前，法师克塞诺克和女术士摩根娜带着征服的幻想来到镇上。他们毁了我的好名声，把自己变成了行会首领。现在我被废黜，行会也变得邪恶。你们愿意帮忙纠正这个错误吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3423
msgid "Xenoc and Morgana"
msgstr "克塞诺克和摩根娜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3425
msgid "I am pleased to see you! Sandcaster will not forget your great deeds!"
msgstr "见到你们我很高兴！沙堡镇不会忘记你们的丰功伟绩！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3433
msgid "We will help"
msgstr "我们会帮忙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3434
msgid ""
"Good. I fear that it will be impossible to talk them from their lofty positions, so you will have to defeat them in battle. They hold the quarter behind the guild gate. Good luck."
msgstr "好。我担心不可能说服他们离开高位，所以你们得在战斗中打败他们。他们占据着行会大门后面的那一区。祝你们好运。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3442
msgid "Not our affair"
msgstr "不关我们的事"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3443
msgid ""
"I see. I had thought better of you. Perhaps you will change your minds after you talk to some of the townspeople and learn firsthand the evil these arrogant magicians have wrought."
msgstr "我明白了。我本以为你们更有担当。也许你们和镇上的居民聊聊，亲身了解这些傲慢的魔法师造成了多少恶行之后，会改变主意。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3450
msgid "The lesson"
msgstr "那一课"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3451
msgid ""
"\"I think we're ready for that lesson right now.\" Blastem smiles. It is not a nice smile."
msgstr "“我想我们现在就准备好上那一课了。”布拉斯特姆笑了。那不是个好看的笑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3458
msgid "Boots licked"
msgstr "舔了靴子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3459
msgid ""
"It's always a pleasure to be able to converse with other beings as intelligent as I. Xenoc keeps his door where nobody looks for it. Wizards like that never stop admiring themselves: try his mirror."
msgstr "能和与我一样聪明的人交谈，总是一种乐趣。克塞诺克把他的门放在没人会去找的地方。那样的法师从不停止自我欣赏：试试他的镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3467
msgid ""
"How wonderful! You have located my magnifying glass. Can't thank you enough. Take this gold, and this: I made it, and now I can finally see what it is."
msgstr "太好了！你们找到了我的放大镜。感激不尽。拿着这些金币，还有这个：这是我做的，现在我终于能看清它是什么了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3477
msgid ""
"I see you didn't find my magnifying glass. You know, I did see a couple of gargoyles loitering around my tent the other day. Maybe they stole it."
msgstr "我看你们没找到我的放大镜。你们知道，前几天我确实看到几只石像鬼在我的帐篷周围晃悠。也许是它们偷的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3480
msgid ""
"Well, this is just great! How am I supposed to get any work done? My magnifying glass is missing and I can't see what I'm working on without it. Do you think you could find it for me? Gargoyles were loitering around the tent. Gargoyles like shiny things."
msgstr "哎，这下可好！我还怎么干活？放大镜不见了，没它我看不清我在做什么。你们能帮我找找吗？石像鬼在帐篷周围晃悠过。石像鬼喜欢闪亮的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3488
msgid "Magnifying glass"
msgstr "放大镜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3490
msgid "Always nice to see you! Come and look at this. No? It's very small."
msgstr "总是很高兴见到你们！来看看这个。不看？它很小。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3498
msgid "The People"
msgstr "族人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3500
msgid ""
"You struck one of the People in our own hall, little ones. We recognize you as enemies."
msgstr "你们在我们自己的大厅里打了一个族人，小个子们。我们视你们为敌人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3504
msgid ""
"The People remember their friends, little ones. Walk our hills as you like; mind where you step."
msgstr "族人记得他们的朋友，小个子们。随意在我们的山丘上行走；注意脚下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3507
msgid ""
"We are the People. We were here before Alamar, and we will be here after him. He wants to drive this world away from its sun, like a cart from a stable, and ride it home. The People do not want to be driven. What do you want of the People, little ones?"
msgstr "我们是族人。我们在阿拉玛之前就在这里，也会在他之后还在这里。他想把这个世界从太阳身边赶走，像从马厩里赶走一辆车，然后驾着它回家。族人不想被驾驭。你们想从族人这里得到什么，小个子们？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3510
msgid "Friendship"
msgstr "友谊"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3511
msgid ""
"Friendship. Good. That is a small word for small people, and a large one for us. Take these, little ones. Alamar's people dropped them in our hills, and they hum when we sleep."
msgstr "友谊。好。这对小个子是个小词，对我们是个大词。拿着这些，小个子们。阿拉玛的人把它们掉在了我们的山丘上，我们睡觉的时候它们会嗡嗡响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3522
msgid "Your hall"
msgstr "你们的大厅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3523
msgid ""
"My hall? Then come and take it, little ones, if you can. The People will be waiting on the stair."
msgstr "我的大厅？那就来拿吧，小个子们，如果你们能。族人会在楼梯上等着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3532
msgid ""
"You gave it back to those mumbling knights? I'll die of thirst before I die of poison. Get out."
msgstr "你把它还给了那些嘟嘟囔囔的骑士？我宁可渴死也不愿被毒死。滚出去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3536
msgid ""
"Oh, thank the Gods! You have the Chalice. For saving my life, I dub thee royal taste testers and give you this treasure."
msgstr "哦，感谢众神！你们拿到圣杯了。为了救我一命，我封你们为皇家试毒师，并赠你们这件宝物。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3551
msgid ""
"Please get the Chalice. I live in fear for my life. And remember: when the voice asks what you seek, answer the knights' way. No vowels. C, H, L, C."
msgstr "请把圣杯拿来。我生活在对性命的恐惧中。还有记住：当那个声音问你们找什么时，用骑士们的方式回答。不要元音。C、H、L、C。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3554
msgid ""
"Recently, my tribal seer told me I will die by drinking a poisoned drink. The royal Chalice of Protection neutralises any poison placed in it. The knights of the Northern Tower have it, and my efforts to steal it have been in vain. Their door stands open; nobody gets past their voice. They leave the vowels out of everything they say; when their voice asks what you seek, answer it their way: Chlc. Bring me the Chalice and I will reward you well."
msgstr "最近，我部落的先知告诉我，我会死于喝下毒药。皇家守护圣杯能中和放进去的任何毒药。北塔的骑士们拥有它，我偷它的努力都白费了。他们的门开着；没人能过得了他们的声音。他们说的每句话都不带元音；当他们的声音问你们找什么时，用他们的方式回答：Chlc。把圣杯带给我，我会重重酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3565
msgid ""
"I drink from it every morning. Water, mostly. I'm still alive, so it works."
msgstr "我每天早上都用它喝水。主要是水。我还活着，所以它管用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3573
msgid "The Voweless Knights' answers"
msgstr "无元音骑士的回答"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3575
msgid ""
"You have the copy already. Read it slowly; they did not write it slowly."
msgstr "你已经有抄本了。慢慢读；他们写的时候可不慢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3579
msgid ""
"Five hundred gold. Their seven sayings, bound, with the vowels put back in the margin, and the answer their voice wants. Mind the binding."
msgstr "五百金币。他们的七句格言，装订成册，元音补在页边，还有他们的声音想要的答案。小心装订。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3585
msgid ""
"Five hundred gold, and not a copper less. Knowledge is free. Binding is not."
msgstr "五百金币，一个铜板也不能少。知识是免费的。装订不是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3590
msgid ""
"You've found the Jewel of Ages! Let me dip it in the fountain. See: the waters remember it. Keep the jewel; the fountain only needed to see it once. Drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr "你们找到了岁月宝玉！让我把它浸进喷泉里。看：水记得它。宝玉你们留着；喷泉只需要看它一眼。以后只要你们觉得受到了不自然衰老的影响，就来这里喝水。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3597
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower, east of here by the rim. Mages don't steal. They acquire, and then they study. Go and interrupt them."
msgstr "卖给了东塔的法师们，就在这儿东边的边缘处。法师不偷。他们是“获取”，然后研究。去打断他们吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3603
msgid ""
"Without the Jewel of Ages, I cannot restore the fountain. See if you can find a clue to its whereabouts in the Great Southern Tower."
msgstr "没有岁月宝玉，我无法修复喷泉。看看你们能不能在大南塔里找到它下落的线索。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3606
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. The Jewel of Ages has been stolen from its place in the fountain. Now the once youth-giving waters have turned back to venom. If you recover the jewel, I'll be able to restore the fountain."
msgstr "发生了可怕的事。岁月宝玉从喷泉里它的位置上被偷走了。现在曾经赐予青春的泉水变回了毒液。你们要是找回宝玉，我就能修复喷泉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3613
msgid "Jewel of Ages"
msgstr "岁月宝玉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3615
msgid ""
"You can now come and drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging. The jewel keeps you; the water keeps everyone else."
msgstr "你们现在可以随时来这里喝水，只要觉得受到了不自然衰老的影响。宝玉守护着你们；水守护其他所有人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3623 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4553
msgid "Hornets"
msgstr "黄蜂"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3625
msgid ""
"Stung in the Aging Forest? Those hornets don't take blood, they take years. Drink from the fountain and have them back."
msgstr "在衰老森林里被蜇了？那些黄蜂不吸血，它们吸年岁。喝喷泉的水，把年岁拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3628
msgid ""
"Stay out from under the great oak. Its hornets don't take blood, they take years. My fountain used to give them back. Now it is venom, like everything else round here."
msgstr "别站到大橡树下面。它的黄蜂不吸血，它们吸年岁。我的喷泉以前能把年岁还回来。现在它是毒液，就像这一带的其他一切一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3632
msgid ""
"Ellinger's seal. 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster: the bearer has earned the robes of an Archmage.' Ellinger never wrote that about anyone. Those of you in a Wizard's robe, take these instead. The rest of you may hold the letter."
msgstr "埃林格的印章。“致沙堡镇行会会长：持有人已经够格穿大法师的长袍。”埃林格从没这样写过任何人。你们当中穿法师长袍的，拿这些吧。其余的人可以留着这封信。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3643
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower? Then that is where my jewel is. And where Luna's statuettes went, she should hear. Thank you. Take this for the trouble."
msgstr "卖给了东塔的法师？那我的宝玉就在那儿。露娜的雕像去的地方，她也该知道。谢谢你们。这个拿去，算辛苦费。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3651
msgid ""
"The Great Southern Tower is in Sprite Forest, rumored to be a hideout for thieves. Thieves write things down. Look for that."
msgstr "大南塔在小精灵森林里，据说是盗贼的藏身处。盗贼会把东西记下来。找找看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3654
msgid ""
"A thief bragged of it in his haste to escape: the Great Southern Tower, in the woods south of Ogre Pass. It is the only help I can offer. Whoever took the Jewel of Ages went there first."
msgstr "一个盗贼在匆忙逃跑时吹嘘过：大南塔，在食人妖隘口以南的林子里。这是我能提供的唯一帮助。不管是谁拿走了岁月宝玉，他最先去的就是那儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3661 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d2.lua:348
msgid "Southern Tower"
msgstr "南塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3663
msgid ""
"Thieves who keep accounts. The world is full of surprises, most of them bad."
msgstr "记账的盗贼。世界充满惊喜，大部分是坏的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3673
msgid ""
"You got past the gongs, the chest and my accountants. Rogues and marksmen that good are wasted on heroics. Join the inner circle. No paperwork. Well, a ledger."
msgstr "你们闯过了锣、箱子和我的会计。这么出色的神偷和神射手，浪费在英雄行径上了。加入内圈吧。不用文书。好吧，一本账簿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3678
msgid ""
"Nobody in your party has the hands for my trade. Take what you came for and go. Quietly. Thieves appreciate quiet."
msgstr "你们队伍里没有人有干我这行的手艺。拿你们来拿的东西，走吧。安静点。盗贼欣赏安静。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3686
msgid ""
"The Pegasus! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr "天马！你们真是了不起的冒险者，找到了这座雕像。它要放回祭坛上，这个是给你们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3695
msgid ""
"The Dragon! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr "巨龙！你们真是了不起的冒险者，找到了这座雕像。它要放回祭坛上，这个是给你们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3704
msgid ""
"The Griffin! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr "狮鹫！你们真是了不起的冒险者，找到了这座雕像。它要放回祭坛上，这个是给你们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3713
msgid ""
"You have found all of my statuettes! Now I can restore the altar's magical aura and regain my powers of healing. For you, great adventurers, shall share my powers. Those of you who fight with bow and spell alike, rise as Master Archers."
msgstr "你们找到了我所有的雕像！现在我可以恢复祭坛的魔法光环，重获我的治疗能力了。因为你们，了不起的冒险者，将分享我的力量。你们当中既用弓又用法术战斗的人，起身成为神箭手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3719
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found all of the statuettes yet. The thieves sold them, I am sure of it. Thieves write down who buys."
msgstr "我看你们还没找到所有的雕像。是盗贼卖掉的，我肯定。盗贼会记下买主。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3722
msgid ""
"Somehow the three golden statuettes that give my altar its magical aura have been stolen. Without it, I have no powers of healing. Start with the thieves of the Great Southern Tower; the keeper of the fountain near Venom Pond has a key."
msgstr "不知怎的，赋予我祭坛魔法光环的三座金雕像被偷了。没有它，我没有治疗能力。从大南塔的盗贼开始；毒池附近喷泉的看守有一把钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3730
msgid "Statuettes"
msgstr "雕像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3732
msgid "I'm pleased to see you again, friends. Please come by more often!"
msgstr "很高兴再见到你们，朋友们。请常来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3742
msgid ""
"That's it. I took it off to split wood and the mountain kept it. You know, it never did fit me after I got it back the last time. Keep it. And take this for the climb."
msgstr "就是这个。我摘下来劈柴，山就把它留住了。你们知道，上次拿回来之后它就一直不合我的手。你们留着吧。再拿着这个，爬山用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3750
msgid ""
"The woodpile on Magic Mountain, by the wizards' camp. Third log, if I remember right. I never remember right."
msgstr "魔法山上的柴堆，在法师营地旁边。第三根木头，如果我没记错的话。我从来记不对。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3753
msgid ""
"I took my ring off to split wood up on Magic Mountain, and now it's somewhere in the woodpile. Fetch it and I'll make it worth the walk."
msgstr "我在魔法山上摘下戒指劈柴，现在它不知在柴堆的哪里。把它找来，我不会让你们白走这一趟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3760
msgid "The ring"
msgstr "戒指"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3762
msgid "Wear it in good health. It makes sure you have plenty."
msgstr "戴着它，祝你健康。它保证你有很多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3772
msgid ""
"The stocks fell open when the Head Witch died, and the others are out. Lakeside is ours again. The tavern was never destroyed, by the way. They only painted it gone."
msgstr "女巫首领死的时候，刑枷自己松开了，其他人也出来了。湖畔镇又是我们的了。顺便说一句，酒馆从来没被毁掉。她们只是把它涂没了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3782
msgid ""
"The Head Witch is dead and my stocks fell open. I'm staying until the others are out of the cells. Someone has to count them."
msgstr "女巫首领死了，我的刑枷松开了。我要留到其他人都从牢房里出来。总得有人数数。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3786
msgid ""
"Four more of us are in the cells below the Guild, and the Head Witch above them. The Guild's door asks 'What am I?' The answer is witch."
msgstr "我们还有四个人在行会下面的牢房里，女巫首领在牢房上面。行会的门会问“我是什么？”答案是女巫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3789
msgid ""
"They put me in the stocks for failing the initiation test. The test is the riddle at the Guild's door, 'What am I?', and the answer is witch. I said 'broom'. Four more of us are in the cells below. The good ones go to Castle Blackfang as guards; the rejects go to the Isle. Get them out, and break the coven."
msgstr "她们因为我没通过入会测试，把我关进了刑枷。测试就是行会门口的谜语“我是什么？”，答案是女巫。我说的是“扫帚”。我们还有四个人在下面的牢房里。好的被送去布莱克方城堡当守卫；不合格的被送去岛上。把他们救出来，打破女巫团。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3797 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4561
msgid "The coven"
msgstr "女巫团"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3799
msgid ""
"Lakeside has its tavern back and I have my feet back. I keep checking on both."
msgstr "湖畔镇拿回了酒馆，我也拿回了我的脚。我时不时检查这两样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3807
msgid "Necropolis pass"
msgstr "亡灵之城通行证"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3808
msgid ""
"Because they did this to me, I'll tell you where the Head Witch keeps her pass to Necropolis. It is in a chest in her room, in the north-west corner of the coven."
msgstr "既然她们这么对我，我就告诉你们女巫首领把亡灵之城的通行证放在哪里。在她房间的箱子里，在女巫团西北角。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3817
msgid ""
"Sandro is at rest, and he left the House his notes: everything but the heart. A Priest, a Wizard or a Necromancer who wants to walk where he walked: sit. This takes an evening."
msgstr "桑德罗安息了，他把笔记留给了本会：除了心脏，什么都留了。想走他走过的路的神甫、法师或死灵法师：坐下。这要花一晚上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3822
msgid ""
"Sandro is at rest. The House has his notes, if one of yours ever wants them."
msgstr "桑德罗安息了。本会有他的笔记，要是你们队里有人想要的话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3825
msgid ""
"Sandro was the finest of us. He cut out his own heart to cheat death, and now he cannot stop killing to stay as he is. He lives in the sewer under us. A Priest, a Wizard or a Necromancer who asked him nicely, before the end, might learn how it was done. I have never been that nice."
msgstr "桑德罗是我们当中最出色的。他为了欺骗死亡，把自己的心脏挖了出来，现在为了保持原样，不得不不停地杀戮。他住在我们下面的下水道里。神甫、法师或死灵法师，要是在最后之前客气地问他，也许能学到是怎么做到的。我从来没那么客气过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3828
msgid "Tribbles"
msgstr "特里布尔"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3834 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3844
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "也许下次吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3838
msgid ""
"Cyrano counts the gold twice and hands you a small furry creature. It purrs. \"A wonderful choice. They practically look after themselves.\""
msgstr "西拉诺数了两遍金币，递给你们一只毛茸茸的小生物。它呼噜呼噜叫。“绝佳的选择。它们几乎能自己照顾自己。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3847
msgid "Companions"
msgstr "同伴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3848
msgid ""
"You know TRIBBLES are great companions but you'll be surprised what doors they can open for you!"
msgstr "你知道特里布尔是很棒的同伴，但你会惊讶它们能为你打开什么样的门！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3856
msgid ""
"You are truly courageous! Thank you soooo much. Now I'll just drink this egg potion and..."
msgstr "你们真勇敢！太感谢了。现在我就喝下这瓶蛋药剂，然后……"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3864
msgid ""
"Well, I can see you weren't brave enough to steal an egg, either. Well, don't worry, perhaps some adventurers with some REAL courage will come along soon."
msgstr "嗯，我看你们也没勇气去偷一枚蛋。算了，别担心，也许很快会有真正有勇气的冒险者来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3867
msgid ""
"Ah, brave adventurers, perhaps you can help me. I need a dragon egg to mix into one of my potions, but I'm not brave enough to go further into the tower to steal one. If you bring me one I will reward you."
msgstr "啊，勇敢的冒险者，也许你们能帮我。我需要一枚龙蛋混进我的一瓶药剂里，但我没有勇气再往塔里深入去偷一枚。你们要是给我带一枚来，我会酬谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3872
msgid ""
"Falista says to tell you: \"I, Falista, grant all great adventurers the title of Crusader.\" Kneel, then. Knights rise as Cavaliers, Paladins as Crusaders, Rangers as Hunters."
msgstr "法利斯塔说让我转告你们：“我，法利斯塔，授予所有了不起的冒险者十字军的称号。”那就跪下吧。骑士起身成为豪侠，圣武士成为十字军，游骑兵成为猎手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3880
msgid ""
"Another spellcaster without a proper title? Stand there. Sorcerers rise as Wizards, Archers as Warrior Mages. Mind the fountain on your way out."
msgstr "又一个没有正式头衔的施法者？站那儿。巫师起身成为法师，弓箭手成为战斗法师。出去的时候当心喷泉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3888
msgid ""
"Another one who heals and hasn't been ordained? Kneel. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr "又一个会治疗却没受过册封的？跪下。德鲁伊起身成为大德鲁伊，牧师成为神甫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3896
msgid ""
"Carlawna sent word that you helped her. Leaves fall so the tree can grow. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr "卡拉娜传话说你们帮了她。叶子落下，是为了让树生长。德鲁伊起身成为大德鲁伊，牧师成为神甫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3904
msgid ""
"Another thief in your company? How useful. Rise, Rogue. Don't touch anything on the way out."
msgstr "你们队伍里又有一个盗贼？真有用。起身，神偷。出去的时候什么都别碰。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3913
msgid ""
"Another knight in your company. Kneel. ... Rise, Champion of the Darkside. That's the whole ceremony; we lost the trumpets."
msgstr "你们队伍里又有一个骑士。跪下。……起身，暗面勇士。仪式就这些；我们把号角弄丢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3918
msgid ""
"The cells are quiet. The guard can sleep in the guardroom again, instead of on the stairs."
msgstr "牢房里安静了。卫兵可以再睡在警卫室里，而不是睡在楼梯上了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3922
msgid ""
"Quiet down there. Truly quiet. Those of you who ride and fight as knights: kneel. ... Rise, Champions of the Darkside. The rest of you: the Queen's thanks, and mine."
msgstr "下面安静了。真正的安静。你们当中以骑士身份骑马战斗的：跪下。……起身，暗面勇士们。其余的人：女王的谢意，还有我的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3930
msgid ""
"The liches are still down there. You can hear them filing their nails. On the bars."
msgstr "巫妖还在下面。你能听到它们在磨指甲。在栏杆上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3933
msgid ""
"When the dungeon came back, so did the liches we locked up in it. We could cage them, never kill them. You could. Clear the cells, and I have a title for the knights among you."
msgstr "地牢回来的时候，我们关在里面的巫妖也回来了。我们能关住它们，却杀不死它们。你们可以。清空牢房，我就给你们当中的骑士一个头衔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3942
msgid "Another one who walks quietly? Good. The clan has room."
msgstr "又一个悄悄行走的人？好。族里有位置。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3947
msgid ""
"The old monk sweeps upstairs. We let him. A clan that hides under a temple is never found."
msgstr "老僧人在楼上扫地。我们由着他。一个藏在庙底下的族，永远不会被找到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3951
msgid ""
"You killed my father. He would say that was the point of him. The clan follows strength, and you are strong. Kneel, Initiates, and rise in the shadows."
msgstr "你们杀了我父亲。他会说那正是他存在的意义。族里服从强者，而你们很强。跪下，修士们，在阴影中起身。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3959
msgid ""
"Strong, yes. Ready, no. Come back when Queen Kalindra's walls are rising, and I will teach you what my father knew."
msgstr "强，没错。准备好了，没有。等卡琳德拉女王的城墙升起来再来，我会教你们我父亲知道的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3963
msgid "My father's killers. Sit, if you like. Nobody here will try it twice."
msgstr "我父亲的杀手。想坐就坐吧。这里没人会再试第二次。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3970
msgid ""
"Another servant of the light who has not knelt to Mok? Kneel. Crusaders rise as Heroes, Priests as Priests of Light. Mind the candles."
msgstr "又一个没有向莫克下跪的光明仆人？跪下。十字军起身成为英雄，神甫成为光明主教。当心蜡烛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3978
msgid ""
"Another hunter the forest has not met? It has now. Walk it as its lord."
msgstr "又一个森林没见过的猎手？现在见过了。以森林之主的身份在里面行走吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3986
msgid ""
"The altar still hums. Bow and spell together? Stand in its light. Rise, Master Archer."
msgstr "祭坛还在嗡嗡响。弓和法术并用？站到它的光里。起身，神箭手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3994
msgid ""
"The guilds still talk about you. This one walks unseen too? Then the word is Spy."
msgstr "行会还在谈论你们。这位也能隐身行走？那么这个词是：密探。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4002
msgid ""
"Ellinger's letter is in my files, and it says 'the bearer'. Close enough. Wizards, take the robes."
msgstr "埃林格的信在我的档案里，上面写的是“持有人”。差不多。法师们，拿长袍吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4010
msgid ""
"A hunter who works for pay? The caravan guild's title is yours too. Bounty Hunter. It comes with a form."
msgstr "为钱打猎的猎手？商队行会的头衔你们也有份。赏金猎人。还要填一张表。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4018
msgid ""
"Another walker of the inner way? Master you are now. Backwards, naturally."
msgstr "又一个走内在之道的人？你现在是大师了。倒着的，当然。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4026
msgid ""
"More hands for my trade? The ledger has room. Inner circle. Don't touch the chest on your way out."
msgstr "又有人手来干我这行？账簿上有位置。内圈。出去的时候别碰那个箱子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4035
msgid ""
"Another druid who listens to trees. Stand in my shade a while. There. Arch Druid."
msgstr "又一个听树说话的德鲁伊。在我的树荫下站一会儿。好了。德鲁伊长老。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4040
msgid ""
"The wind says Thickbark has grown a new ring. He is unbearable about it."
msgstr "风说厚树皮又长了一圈年轮。他为此简直让人受不了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4044
msgid ""
"My cousin Thickbark says you are civilized. He is a poor judge of most things, but not of that. Druids, stand in my shade. A tree's patience is the last lesson, and you have just learned it."
msgstr "我的堂兄厚树皮说你们是文明人。他对大多数事情的判断都不好，但这件事没判断错。德鲁伊们，站到我的树荫下。树的耐心是最后一课，而你们刚刚学会了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4052
msgid ""
"Civilized ones! Thickbark wrote, which for a tree means a century of rustling. If a druid among you ever wants the last lesson, come back."
msgstr "文明人！厚树皮来信了，对树来说，那意味着一个世纪的沙沙声。你们当中的德鲁伊要是想上最后一课，再来吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4055
msgid "A tree does not talk to strangers who might be carrying axes."
msgstr "树不和可能带着斧头的陌生人说话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4060
msgid ""
"Tam! He walked in the door an hour ago and asked what's for supper, as if nothing happened. Here. It's what I put by for his wedding, and he can earn another."
msgstr "塔姆！一小时前他走进家门，问晚饭吃什么，就像什么都没发生过。拿着。这是我为他的婚礼存的，他可以再挣一份。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4070
msgid "The caves are in the north-east hills. Follow the drums."
msgstr "洞穴在东北边的山里。跟着鼓声走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4073
msgid ""
"The orcs took my boy Tam to their caves in the hills, north-east of town. You can hear their drums at night. I'm a farmer. I can't fight orcs."
msgstr "兽人把我儿子塔姆抓进了他们在镇子东北山里的洞穴。夜里能听到他们的鼓声。我是个农夫。我打不了兽人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4080
msgid "Tam"
msgstr "塔姆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4082
msgid "Tam eats like an orc now. I'm not complaining. Thank you."
msgstr "塔姆现在吃东西像兽人一样。我不抱怨。谢谢你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4090
msgid "Drums"
msgstr "鼓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4091
msgid ""
"The drums have stopped. Nights are quiet again, and the cows have started giving milk."
msgstr "鼓声停了。夜晚又安静了，牛也开始产奶了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4097
msgid "Slimes"
msgstr "史莱姆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4098
msgid ""
"Slime eats iron. I sell a lot of swords in this town, and most of them come back as soup."
msgstr "史莱姆吃铁。我在这个镇上卖了很多剑，大部分都变成了汤。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4101
msgid "Dudley"
msgstr "达德利"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4102
msgid ""
"Dudley? He's been drinking since the plague started. Before that he drank because it hadn't."
msgstr "达德利？瘟疫开始以后他就一直在喝酒。在那之前他喝酒是因为还没开始。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4105
msgid "Joe's account"
msgstr "乔的账户"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4106
msgid ""
"Joe the Exterminator banks with us. Every month the town pays him, and every month he deposits it. I say nothing. I'm a banker."
msgstr "灭虫人乔在我们这儿存钱。镇上每个月给他付钱，他每个月存进来。我什么也不说。我是个银行家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4777
msgid "The name"
msgstr "名字"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4110
msgid ""
"The founders named it for the slime they cleared from the spring. Then the slime came back. We kept the name; it saves on signs."
msgstr "创始人以他们从泉水里清除的史莱姆给它命名。后来史莱姆又回来了。我们保留了这个名字；这样省牌子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4114
msgid ""
"Tenth level is as far as I go. After that you want Rivercity, and a thicker skin."
msgstr "我最多教到十级。再往上你们要去河城，还要皮厚一点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:446 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:421
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:423 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:652 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:661
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:670 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:682 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:688
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:600 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:855 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:864
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:873
msgid "Rivercity"
msgstr "河城"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4118
msgid ""
"Rivercity is west along the river road. Bigger town, bigger thieves. The coach goes Monday, Wednesday and Friday."
msgstr "河城在西边，沿河路走。镇子更大，贼也更大。马车周一、周三、周五发车。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:6 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4133
msgid "Gunther"
msgstr "冈瑟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4122
msgid ""
"Gunther paid Joe a fortune. He says it was a bargain. He also says the slimes are smaller this year."
msgstr "冈瑟给了乔一大笔钱。他说很划算。他还说今年史莱姆小了点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4125
msgid "Money tree"
msgstr "摇钱树"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4126
msgid ""
"Some fool said money's now growing on trees. Ha! I've watched that tree for a month. Leaves. Leaves and a pigeon."
msgstr "某个傻瓜说现在树上长钱了。哈！我盯着那棵树看了一个月。叶子。只有叶子和一只鸽子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4130
msgid ""
"This place is deserted. You should go to Rivercity--Now there's a town full of action!"
msgstr "这地方没人了。你们该去河城——那才是个热闹的镇子！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4134
msgid ""
"That Gunther, what a dunce! He paid that con man Joe a fortune to clean up this town."
msgstr "那个冈瑟，真是个笨蛋！他付了骗子乔一大笔钱来清理这个镇子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4137
msgid "Dues"
msgstr "会费"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4138
msgid ""
"I'll put anyone on the guild roll for free. Dues will cost 25 gold, though."
msgstr "我可以免费把任何人登记进行会名册。不过会费要 25 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4142
msgid ""
"The world is flat and it ends. East of the orchard road the meadow stops and the stars begin. I put that on every map, and people still walk off it."
msgstr "世界是平的，而且有尽头。果园路以东草地就到头了，星星开始。我在每张地图上都标了，还是有人走下去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4146
msgid ""
"The orcs have three lookout posts on the hill road. They watch the sheep, then they take the sheep. Burn the posts and they'll have to watch something else."
msgstr "兽人在山路上有三个瞭望哨。他们先看羊，然后就把羊拿走。烧了哨所，他们就只能去看别的东西了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4149
msgid "Toads"
msgstr "蟾蜍"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4150
msgid ""
"Some of the toads were people. You can tell by the way they look at you. Don't step on any."
msgstr "有些蟾蜍以前是人。你能从它们看你的样子分辨出来。别踩它们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4153
msgid "The plague"
msgstr "瘟疫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4154
msgid ""
"The plague is a judgement. The slimes are its messengers. Joe is... also involved."
msgstr "瘟疫是一种审判。史莱姆是它的信使。乔……也有牵连。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4157
msgid "Slime lords"
msgstr "史莱姆领主"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4158
msgid "Slime lords shall rule. Probably. We are waiting for a sign."
msgstr "史莱姆领主将会统治。大概吧。我们在等一个征兆。"

# MM9 dialogue topics, from the translators' 2.3 supplement
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4161
msgid "Prices"
msgstr "价格"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4162
msgid ""
"Paid up front, because in Rivercity the customer is gone by morning, and so is the sword."
msgstr "先付钱，因为在河城，顾客到早上就不见了，剑也跟着不见了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4165
msgid "Robbers"
msgstr "强盗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4166
msgid ""
"The robbers under the bridge have never robbed this bank. We pay them not to. It's called insurance."
msgstr "桥下的强盗从来没抢过这家银行。我们付钱让他们别抢。这叫保险。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4170
msgid ""
"Water's two coppers since the fountain dried up. I didn't plug it. I just noticed it was plugged."
msgstr "自从喷泉干了以后，水要两个铜板。我没堵它。我只是注意到它被堵了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4174
msgid ""
"Twenty-fifth level, no further. After that you want the King's own hall at Castle Burlock, and a title to get in."
msgstr "二十五级，再不往上。往上你们就要去伯洛克城堡的国王大厅，还得有个头衔才能进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4178
msgid ""
"Pray, pay, and be healed today. Pray without paying and we'll see about tomorrow."
msgstr "祈祷、付钱，今日痊愈。祈祷不付钱，明天再看着办。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4181
msgid "Coaches"
msgstr "马车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4182
msgid ""
"East to Vertigo on the river road. North to the King when the savannah road's clear."
msgstr "往东沿河路去眩晕镇。往北，草原路通畅时可去见国王。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4185
msgid "Gossip"
msgstr "闲话"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4186
msgid ""
"The robbers live under the bridge. The sorceresses live by the south quay. The King lives in a castle and never comes here. Everybody knows everything in Rivercity, and nobody does anything."
msgstr "强盗住在桥下。女术士住在南码头边。国王住在城堡里，从不到这儿来。河城里人人什么都知道，没人做什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4189
msgid "The den"
msgstr "巢穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4190
msgid ""
"The den's under the bridge, behind the third pier. There's a door you can't see until you look at it properly. I never told you that."
msgstr "巢穴在桥下，第三个桥墩后面。有一扇门，你不好好看就看不见。我从没告诉过你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4193
msgid "Stars"
msgstr "星星"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4194
msgid ""
"For 2,000 gold I will teach you how to use the stars to keep from getting lost. Nobody pays. Nobody ever gets lost either. I don't understand it."
msgstr "付 2,000 金币，我教你们怎么用星星避免迷路。没人付钱。也没人迷过路。我不明白。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4197 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4257 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4673
msgid "The King"
msgstr "国王"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4198
msgid ""
"King Burlock holds court at his castle north of here. Only Crusaders pass the inner gate. Earn the title and he may see you."
msgstr "伯洛克国王在这儿北边的城堡里上朝。只有十字军才能通过内门。挣到头衔，他也许会见你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4201
msgid "Darzog"
msgstr "达佐格"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4202
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog was the King's master sorcerer. His tower on the lake isle has been shut for years. Some say a skeleton key opens it; nobody says where the key is."
msgstr "达佐格男爵曾是国王的首席巫师。他在湖中岛上的塔已经关了好多年。有人说万能钥匙能开；没人说钥匙在哪儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4205
msgid "Climbing"
msgstr "攀登"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4206
msgid ""
"For the low, low, price of 5,000 gold, I will teach you how to climb the highest mountains. Mountains in your way? Try due north."
msgstr "只要 5,000 金币这个低、低的价格，我就教你们怎么爬最高的山。山挡路了？往正北走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4209
msgid "The lake"
msgstr "湖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4210
msgid ""
"Medin says beasts eat the fish. I've seen them. They eat the boats too, when the boats are near enough."
msgstr "梅丁说野兽在吃鱼。我见过它们。船离得够近，它们连船也吃。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4213
msgid "Bodybuilding"
msgstr "健身术"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4214
msgid ""
"I see that you are pale and weak. Bodybuilding will put some meat on your bones. I teach it; the meat is extra."
msgstr "我看你们又苍白又虚弱。健身术能给你们的骨头添点肉。我教；肉另算。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4217
msgid "Fighting"
msgstr "战斗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4218
msgid ""
"Fighting is simple. Hit them before they hit you. The rest is details, and I teach the details."
msgstr "战斗很简单。在它们打你之前先打它们。其余是细节，而我教细节。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4393
msgid "Work"
msgstr "工作"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4222
msgid ""
"I'll give you 100 gold for a week of work. Not today, though. Today all the work went to the robbers."
msgstr "我给你们 100 金币，做一个星期的工。不过不是今天。今天所有的活都被强盗拿走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4225 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:469
msgid "Mirrors"
msgstr "镜子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4226
msgid ""
"Touch the mirror on the square, and any other mirror you've touched will send you there. Faster than my ferry. Everything is faster than my ferry."
msgstr "碰一下广场上的镜子，以后你碰过的任何其他镜子都能把你送到这儿来。比我的渡船快。什么都比我的渡船快。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4229
msgid "Swimming"
msgstr "游泳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4230
msgid ""
"I can teach you how to swim for a mere 100 gold. Or sell you a Water Walk scroll, if you sink."
msgstr "我只要 100 金币就能教你们游泳。或者你们要是沉下去了，我卖你们一张凌波微步卷轴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4529
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr "税"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4234
msgid ""
"Death and taxes. Out here in the lagoon it's mostly death. That's why the land is cheap."
msgstr "死亡和税收。在这边潟湖上，主要是死亡。所以这里的地才便宜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4237
msgid "The sorceress"
msgstr "女术士"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4238
msgid ""
"The sorceress who did this lives in Rivercity now, by the south quay, with her sisters. Barok the Sorcerer knows them. Everyone who has lost something to them knows them."
msgstr "干这事的女术士现在住在河城，在南码头边，和她的姐妹们在一起。巫师巴洛克认识她们。每个被她们拿走过东西的人都认识她们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4242
msgid ""
"My brother Falagar thinks every theft is a plot. This time he might be right, which he'll never let me forget."
msgstr "我哥哥法拉加认为每一桩失窃都是阴谋。这次他也许是对的，他永远不会让我忘记这一点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4245
msgid "Carlawna"
msgstr "卡拉娜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4246
msgid ""
"My sister's a cleric and I'm a wizard. At dinner we argue whether the soup is a miracle or a reaction."
msgstr "我妹妹是牧师，我是法师。吃饭时我们争论这汤是奇迹还是化学反应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4249
msgid "The curse"
msgstr "诅咒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4250
msgid ""
"The guild never closed. We met in the cellar and took the minutesss with our tailsss. Nobody could read them after."
msgstr "行会从没关门。我们在地窖里开会，用我们的尾巴记会议记录。后来没人读得懂。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4253
msgid "The Prince"
msgstr "王子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4254
msgid ""
"My brother is home after years abroad. He hardly eats and never sleeps. Travel does that, I'm told. Now: the mirror."
msgstr "我哥哥在国外多年之后回家了。他几乎不吃东西，从不睡觉。听说旅行就是这样。现在：镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4258
msgid ""
"The King hears little these days but the word 'mirror'. I say 'mirror' first, then what I came to say. It works about half the time."
msgstr "国王这些天只听得进“镜子”这个词。我先说“镜子”，再说我来说的事。大概一半时候管用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4261
msgid "The dungeon"
msgstr "地牢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4263
msgid ""
"The cellar door, behind the kitchens. Lock it behind you if you come back up. Or don't come back up. Either way, lock it."
msgstr "地窖的门，在厨房后面。要是你们回上来了，把它锁上。或者别回上来。无论哪样，都要锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4266
msgid ""
"A word the King doesn't want to hear: the trolls broke out of their cells below the castle, and nobody has gone down since. The King will not hear of it, so I'm telling you. The cellar door behind the kitchens is not locked; nobody wanted to go down badly enough to lock it. Bring the castle its cellar back."
msgstr "一句国王不想听的话：巨魔从城堡下面的牢房里逃了出来，从那以后没人下去过。国王不肯听，所以我告诉你们。厨房后面的地窖门没锁；没人想下去想到要把它锁上。把城堡的地窖夺回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4273
msgid "Castles"
msgstr "城堡"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4274
msgid ""
"A wall, then a keep, then a dungeon. Then the people in the dungeon want out. That's not my department."
msgstr "先是墙，然后是主堡，然后是地牢。然后地牢里的人想出来。这不归我管。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4277
msgid "The court"
msgstr "朝廷"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4278
msgid ""
"Father hunts the mirror, my uncle hunts nothing at all, and I read. Somebody in this family has to know things."
msgstr "父亲追着镜子，叔叔什么也不追，而我读书。这个家里总得有个人知道点事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4282
msgid ""
"Only one sword can slay Lord Xeen. It lies in the ruins of the dungeon under Newcastle."
msgstr "只有一把剑能杀死辛恩领主。它在纽卡斯尔下面地牢的废墟里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:372 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:251
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:50
msgid "The Sphinx"
msgstr "狮身人面像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4286
msgid "The name of the Sphinx is Golux."
msgstr "狮身人面像的名字是戈卢克斯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4289
msgid "The key"
msgstr "钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4290
msgid "The key to the Tower of High Magic lies in the Cave of Illusion."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔的钥匙在幻象洞穴里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4293
msgid "The password"
msgstr "密码"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4294
msgid ""
"I hear the secret password for Newcastle dungeon is 'laboratory'. Not much of a secret if you ask me."
msgstr "我听说纽卡斯尔地牢的秘密密码是“laboratory”。依我看算不上什么秘密。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4298
msgid "Lord Xeen already has the Sixth Mirror."
msgstr "辛恩领主已经有第六面镜子了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4303
msgid ""
"I see an old man in a tower on an island, and a baron who copies himself. Free the one; the others are all the same man."
msgstr "我看见一个老人在岛上的塔里，还有一个会复制自己的男爵。放了一个；其他的都是同一个人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4307
msgid ""
"I see a sword under a castle you own, and a door that wants a word. You already know the word. You just don't know you know it."
msgstr "我看见一把剑，在你们拥有的城堡下面，还有一扇想要一个词的门。你们已经知道那个词。你们只是不知道自己知道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4311
msgid ""
"I see a queen who will not look at your neck, and a griffin who will not wear plain leather."
msgstr "我看见一位不肯看你们脖子的女王，和一头不肯戴普通皮革的狮鹫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4315
msgid ""
"I see a pyramid in a desert, and a reptile in it who wants his marble back."
msgstr "我看见沙漠里的一座金字塔，里面有一只爬行动物，想要拿回他的大理石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4319
msgid ""
"I see something that fell from the stars into lava, and is still waiting for someone to finish its sentence."
msgstr "我看见从星空掉进熔岩的东西，还在等着有人把它的话说完。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4323
msgid ""
"I see the Pharaoh again. He has a title for you. He's had it ready for some time."
msgstr "我又看见了法老。他有个头衔要给你们。已经准备好有一阵子了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4326
msgid ""
"I see a city in the clouds, and a box with nobody in it yet. After that it gets crowded. I'll stop there."
msgstr "我看见云中的一座城，还有一只里面还没有人的盒子。再往后就拥挤了。我就说到这儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4329
msgid "The guidebook"
msgstr "指南"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4330
msgid ""
"Eeried's guidebook calls the Darkside cosy. He wrote it before the siege. And, I think, before the sun went small."
msgstr "伊莉的指南说暗面舒适宜人。他是在围城之前写的。而且，我觉得，是在太阳变小之前。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4334
msgid ""
"The Gremlin King has more bark than bite. He'll send his guards against you, but he's too cowardly to fight you personally. If you defeat his guards, he will probably do anything you want."
msgstr "地精王叫得凶，咬得轻。他会派卫兵来对付你们，但他太胆小，不敢亲自跟你们打。你们要是打败了他的卫兵，他大概会什么都答应你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4338
msgid ""
"Don't trust Joe. He has some sort of scheme to sell fake treasure maps to fools willing to believe his lies about buried treasure."
msgstr "别相信乔。他有某种计划，把假藏宝图卖给愿意相信他那些埋藏宝藏的谎话的傻瓜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4342
msgid ""
"Monsters can't count. Monsters can't spel, either. That's why the vault is safe."
msgstr "怪物不会数数。怪物也不会拼写。所以金库是安全的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4345
msgid "The siege"
msgstr "围城"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4346
msgid ""
"They camp outside and wait. We sit inside and wait. Whoever gets bored first loses. We have the tavern."
msgstr "他们在外面扎营等着。我们在里面坐着等着。谁先无聊谁就输。我们有酒馆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4350
msgid ""
"You will have a hard time finding spells if you don't look for them in the guild. That's a hint."
msgstr "你们要是不去行会里找，就很难找到法术。这是个提示。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4353
msgid "The pond"
msgstr "池塘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4354
msgid ""
"The acid pond outside the walls is not water. Don't drink it, don't swim in it, and don't believe the frogs."
msgstr "城墙外的酸池不是水。别喝，别游，也别相信青蛙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4357
msgid "The mines"
msgstr "矿场"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4358
msgid ""
"The Gemstone Mines run under the hills. Rubies, emeralds, and things with teeth that like rubies too."
msgstr "宝石矿场就在山丘底下。红宝石、祖母绿，还有也喜欢红宝石的长牙的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4361
msgid "The roster"
msgstr "名册"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4362
msgid ""
"Folk sign on here to wait for a party worth joining. Some have waited years. Some are worth it."
msgstr "人们在这里登记，等一支值得加入的队伍。有人等了好几年。有人值得等。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4365
msgid "The bench"
msgstr "长凳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4366
msgid ""
"'This bench reserved for Lyle the Pigeon Feeder.' That's me. I had the sign made. I've sat on it twice."
msgstr "“这张长凳为喂鸽人莱尔保留。”那就是我。牌子是我叫人做的。我只坐过两次。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4369
msgid "Dark elves"
msgstr "黑暗精灵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4370
msgid "My people talk to no one. I talked to someone. Hence, Castleview."
msgstr "我的族人不跟任何人说话。我跟某个人说话了。于是，堡景镇。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4373
msgid "The Dark Grove"
msgstr "黑暗树林"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4374
msgid ""
"The tallest tree in the Dark Grove has a rope hanging down from the sky. Nobody who climbed it has come back down to say what's up there."
msgstr "黑暗树林里最高的树上，有一根绳子从天上垂下来。爬上去的人，没有一个下来告诉过大家上面有什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4377
msgid "The monks"
msgstr "僧侣"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4378
msgid ""
"Don't listen to the Drawkcab Monks. Little of what they say makes sense, and what little makes sense is just plain wrong! They've got it all backwards."
msgstr "别听倒序僧侣的话。他们说的很少有道理，仅有的一点道理也是错的！他们把一切都弄反了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4382
msgid ""
"Every city requires a pass to enter since Alamar took over. Someone is selling passes to Castleview just outside the gate, for cheap. Be sure to get one before you try to get back inside the town."
msgstr "自从阿拉玛接管以来，每座城都要通行证才能进入。有人在堡景镇大门外卖通行证，很便宜。想回镇里之前一定要先买一张。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4385
msgid "The mill"
msgstr "磨坊"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4386
msgid ""
"The gremlins burned my mill and left a note. It said 'Ha'. Spelled wrong."
msgstr "地精烧了我的磨坊，还留了张字条。上面写着“哈”。拼错了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4389
msgid "Soup"
msgstr "汤"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4390
msgid ""
"Melon soup again. The melon farmer sends what the monkeydog doesn't eat."
msgstr "又是瓜汤。瓜农把猴狗吃剩的送来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4394
msgid ""
"Wanna job? Fifty gold a week, no experience necessary. You'd be fixing what the gremlins break. Forever."
msgstr "想找活干吗？一周五十金币，不需要经验。你们要修地精弄坏的东西。永远修下去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4397
msgid "The monkeydog"
msgstr "猴狗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4398
msgid ""
"There's a monkeydog in the sprite forest who'll do anything for a Monga melon. Anything. Mind your melons."
msgstr "小精灵森林里有一只猴狗，为一个蒙加甜瓜什么都肯干。什么都肯。看好你们的瓜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4401
msgid "Towers"
msgstr "塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4402
msgid ""
"Each tower requires a key for entry... but sometimes they leave the door on top of the towers unlocked. You may be able to get into some towers from the skyroads above Darkside."
msgstr "每座塔都需要钥匙才能进……不过它们有时会把塔顶的门留着没锁。你们也许能从暗面上空的天路进入一些塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4405 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4489
msgid "Treasure"
msgstr "宝藏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4406
msgid ""
"Don't waste your time chasing treasure that runs from you. You can't catch it. My husband tried."
msgstr "别浪费时间追着会跑的宝藏。你们追不上的。我丈夫试过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4410
msgid ""
"It is the beginning of the end. These are the final days! Ruin is upon us! We are doomed, DOOMED I tell you! Also, supper is at six."
msgstr "这是终结的开始。这是最后的日子！毁灭降临在我们头上！我们完了，完了，我告诉你们！另外，晚饭六点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4457 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4705
msgid "The sun"
msgstr "太阳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4414
msgid ""
"The sun gets smaller every year and my lamps get bigger. One of us is going to win."
msgstr "太阳每年都在变小，我的灯在变大。我们俩总有一个要赢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:315 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:289 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4417
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:120 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:153
msgid "Ellinger"
msgstr "埃林格"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4418
msgid ""
"Ellinger has a great fondness for boots. Why, I couldn't say. I make saddles."
msgstr "埃林格特别喜欢靴子。为什么，我说不上来。我做马鞍的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4545 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4617
msgid "The sewer"
msgstr "下水道"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4422
msgid ""
"The sewer drains into my moat, and the rats come with it. Big ones. One of them was wearing a necklace."
msgstr "下水道通进我的护城河，老鼠也跟着来了。大的。有一只戴着项链。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4426
msgid ""
"The Gremlins sure have ruined this city. Mayor Snarfblad is too nice. He should have executed those little creeps long ago."
msgstr "地精确实毁了这座城。斯纳夫布莱德镇长人太好了。他早就该把那些小混蛋处决了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4430
msgid ""
"Perhaps Alamar will just go away if we close our eyes and wish real hard!"
msgstr "也许我们闭上眼睛使劲许愿，阿拉玛就会自己走掉！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4433
msgid "Forbidden fruit"
msgstr "禁果"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4434
msgid ""
"The hut in the clearing has a basket labelled Forbidden Fruit. It's labelled for a reason. Mostly the coconut."
msgstr "林中空地上的小屋里有个篮子，标着“禁果”。标着是有原因的。主要是那个椰子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4437
msgid "The orcs"
msgstr "兽人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4438
msgid ""
"The orcs took the Temple of Bark. They don't even like trees. They just like temples."
msgstr "兽人占了树皮庙。他们甚至不喜欢树。他们只是喜欢庙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4441
msgid "Holes"
msgstr "洞"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4442
msgid ""
"Mind the holes in the forest floor. Trolls live down them. They come up for sprites and go back down hungry. We're quick."
msgstr "当心林地上的洞。巨魔就住在里面。它们上来抓小精灵，空着肚子回去。我们跑得快。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4445 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:604 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:625
msgid "The pass"
msgstr "隘口"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4446
msgid "The ogres in the pass charge a toll. In teeth. Mostly yours."
msgstr "隘口里的食人妖收过路费。收的是牙。主要是你们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4449
msgid "Genies"
msgstr "精灵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4450
msgid "Never take all of a genie's money. It's greedy."
msgstr "永远别拿走精灵的全部金钱。它很贪心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4453 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4513 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:490
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:492
msgid "Vulture Repellant"
msgstr "秃鹫驱逐剂"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4454
msgid "Special today! Vulture Repellant, only 25,000 gold!"
msgstr "今日特价！秃鹫驱逐剂，仅需 25,000 金币！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4458
msgid ""
"The sun is smaller than last year. The priests say pray harder. I say buy a lamp. I am also a priest."
msgstr "太阳比去年小了。祭司们说要更虔诚地祈祷。我说去买盏灯。我也是祭司。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4462
msgid "The wizards drink here. They tip in threats."
msgstr "法师们在这里喝酒。他们用威胁当小费。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4465
msgid "Members' room"
msgstr "会员室"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4466
msgid ""
"The members' room is under the street, with the brews. The stalkers got in."
msgstr "会员室在街下面，和酿酒坊在一起。潜行者闯进去了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4469
msgid "The quarter"
msgstr "这一区"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4470
msgid ""
"Two wizards from out of town took the quarter's guilds. Astra used to run them all. She lives in town now, plotting politely."
msgstr "两个外地来的法师夺了这一区的行会。阿斯特拉以前管着所有行会。她现在住在镇上，客客气气地密谋。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4473
msgid "Mastery"
msgstr "精通"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4474
msgid ""
"Master the Spirit? Not from me. An elf priest on Cloudside, Tito, teaches it, once he has his holy book back. He lost it to trolls. Priests do that."
msgstr "精通灵魂魔法？别找我。云侧有位精灵祭司蒂托教这个，等他拿回他的圣书。他把书丢给巨魔了。祭司就爱这样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:12 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:4 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4477 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:726 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:500
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:509 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:521
msgid "Lakeside"
msgstr "湖畔镇"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4478
msgid ""
"The coven at Lakeside turns away caravans. Sometimes it turns them into other things."
msgstr "湖畔镇的女巫团把商队拒之门外。有时候她们把商队变成别的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4481
msgid "Your palm"
msgstr "你的手掌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4482
msgid ""
"I predict you will go on a long journey. I also predict that you will become very rich and famous. I further predict that you will die young...and then be resurrected...and then die again...over and over."
msgstr "我预言你们会踏上一段长途旅行。我还预言你们会变得非常富有和出名。我再预言你们会英年早逝……然后被复活……然后再死……周而复始。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4485
msgid "Thieves"
msgstr "盗贼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4486
msgid ""
"The thieves in the Southern Tower keep a ledger. Thieves who write things down. Amateurs."
msgstr "南塔里的盗贼有本账簿。把东西写下来的盗贼。业余的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4490
msgid ""
"I hear there is a huge hoard of treasure buried somewhere in the land, but the map to it was lost years ago."
msgstr "我听说这片土地某处埋着一大批宝藏，可去那里的地图多年前就丢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4493
msgid "Names"
msgstr "名字"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4494
msgid ""
"I sense Alamar is an assumed name. I study names, I would know. What the real one is, I can't tell."
msgstr "我感觉阿拉玛是个化名。我研究名字，我知道。真名是什么，我说不上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4498
msgid ""
"No matter how skilled a wizard is, he'll go down before a good sword and a steady hand. Face them down! If you run from them, they'll just shoot you in the back."
msgstr "不管法师多厉害，在一把好剑和一双稳定的手面前都会倒下。去正面对抗他们！你们要是逃跑，他们只会射你们的后背。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4501
msgid "Spices"
msgstr "香料"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4502
msgid ""
"Pepper from Castleview, salt from the Desert of Doom. The salt is mostly sand. So is the pepper."
msgstr "胡椒来自堡景镇，盐来自厄运沙漠。盐大部分是沙子。胡椒也是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4506 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:496
msgid ""
"The wizards in this town are sensitive to insults. Watch what you say!"
msgstr "这个镇上的法师受不得侮辱。说话当心！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4509
msgid "Firewood"
msgstr "柴火"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4510
msgid ""
"Never try to burn green wood. It just doesn't catch fire as easily. Glass needs a hot fire; I learned the slow way."
msgstr "别想烧生木头。它就是不容易着火。玻璃需要大火；我是吃了苦头才学会的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4514
msgid "Vulture Repellant doesn't work."
msgstr "秃鹫驱逐剂没用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4517
msgid "Natasha"
msgstr "娜塔莎"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4518
msgid ""
"Natasha will sometimes enchant ordinary things with spells of calm and friendship. The enchantment is useful for taming horses and wild beasts. Her prices are high, though."
msgstr "娜塔莎有时会用平静和友好的法术给普通的东西附魔。这种附魔对驯服马匹和野兽很有用。不过她的价钱很高。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4521
msgid "Decrees"
msgstr "法令"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4522
msgid ""
"Decree forty: no laughing at wizards. Decree forty-one: no laughing near wizards. I'm writing decree two hundred."
msgstr "第四十条法令：不许嘲笑法师。第四十一条法令：不许在法师附近嘲笑。我正在写第两百条。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4525
msgid "Pots"
msgstr "罐子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4526
msgid ""
"Bury gold in a pot and the wizards dig it up. Bury it in a pot of snakes and they don't."
msgstr "把金子埋在罐子里，法师会挖出来。埋在装满蛇的罐子里，他们就不挖了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4530
msgid ""
"The wizards tax sand. We have a great deal of sand. You can see the problem."
msgstr "法师们对沙子收税。我们的沙子多得很。你们看得出问题在哪儿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4533
msgid "The paladin"
msgstr "圣武士"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4534
msgid ""
"A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr "一位垂死的圣武士把他所有的魔法盔甲交给了这片土地上的魔法巨石保管。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4537 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4773
msgid "Barbarians"
msgstr "野蛮人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4538
msgid ""
"The Barbarians are friends of the Giants. Insult the one and you anger the other."
msgstr "野蛮人是巨人的朋友。侮辱了一方，就得罪了另一方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4541 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4861
msgid "The forest"
msgstr "森林"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4542
msgid ""
"Don't sleep in the Aging Forest. My uncle went in for a nap and came out my grandfather."
msgstr "别在衰老森林里睡觉。我叔叔进去打了个盹，出来就成了我爷爷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4546
msgid ""
"There is a passage in the sewer that leads a long ways under the desert."
msgstr "下水道里有一条通道，通向沙漠底下很远的地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4549
msgid "Roads"
msgstr "道路"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4550
msgid ""
"Six roads meet here. One goes to Castleview, one to Sandcaster, and the other four go somewhere expensive."
msgstr "六条路在这里交汇。一条去堡景镇，一条去沙堡镇，另外四条去的地方都很贵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4554
msgid ""
"Boots won't stop the hornets in the Aging Forest. Nothing stops those hornets. Run."
msgstr "靴子挡不住衰老森林里的黄蜂。什么也挡不住那些黄蜂。跑吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4557
msgid "Secret doors"
msgstr "暗门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4558
msgid ""
"Spotting secret doors is an art that has taken many years to master, but I could teach you in a matter of minutes."
msgstr "发现暗门是一门要花很多年才能掌握的技艺，但我几分钟就能教会你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4562
msgid ""
"The coven meets under the town. I kept their books. I never read them. Well, I read the totals."
msgstr "女巫团在镇子底下开会。我给她们记账。我从没读过账。好吧，我读了总数。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4565
msgid "The tavern"
msgstr "酒馆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4566
msgid ""
"The witches said the tavern was destroyed long ago. It was under a dust sheet and a spell. We found the ale still cold."
msgstr "女巫们说酒馆早就毁了。其实它被罩在一块防尘布和一个咒语下面。我们发现啤酒还是凉的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4569 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4589
msgid "The Isle"
msgstr "岛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4570
msgid ""
"The Isle of Lost Souls takes in what the coven threw away. There's a dungeon under it, and something in there singing."
msgstr "迷魂岛收留女巫团扔掉的东西。岛下有座地牢，里面有什么东西在唱歌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4573
msgid "Octopods"
msgstr "八足怪"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4574
msgid ""
"Octopods in the deep water. They don't bite. They hug. Then they take you down for a better look."
msgstr "深水里有八足怪。它们不咬人。它们拥抱。然后把你拖下去好好看看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4577
msgid "Blackfang"
msgstr "布莱克方"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4578
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang sits on its crag in a storm of bats. You can't walk in. Nobody walks in. Some fly."
msgstr "布莱克方城堡坐落在峭壁上，蝙蝠成暴风雨一般。你们走不进去。没人走进去。有些是飞进去的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4582
msgid ""
"Being a goblin was great. You can eat anything. Mum says I have to stop eating anything."
msgstr "当地精太棒了。什么都能吃。妈妈说我必须别什么都吃了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4585
msgid "Magic Mountain"
msgstr "魔法山"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4586
msgid ""
"Two wizards camp on Magic Mountain. They argue about fountains all day. You can hear them from the reeds."
msgstr "两个法师在魔法山上扎营。他们整天争论喷泉。你们在芦苇丛里就能听到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4590
msgid ""
"If you go to the Isle of Lost Souls, look for a girl with my eyes. Or a goblin with them."
msgstr "你们要是去迷魂岛，找一个长着我这双眼睛的女孩。或者一个地精也行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4593
msgid "The sign"
msgstr "牌子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4594
msgid ""
"\"This boat under repair.\" Best sign I ever painted. Kept the witches off it for two years."
msgstr "“此船正在维修。”我画过最好的牌子。让女巫们两年没碰它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4897
msgid "The well"
msgstr "井"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4598
msgid ""
"Don't drink from the black well in the square. It brings death quickly. We use it for the tea."
msgstr "别喝广场上那口黑井的水。它让人很快死去。我们拿它泡茶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4602
msgid ""
"The Books of the Dead are in the city. Read one and gain a lifetime. Read the wrong one and spend it all at once."
msgstr "亡者之书在城里。读一本，获得一辈子。读错一本，一下子全花光。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4605
msgid "The barrel"
msgstr "桶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4606
msgid ""
"\"Food for the dead, keep warm.\" I wrote it on the barrel. Nobody eats it. It's tradition."
msgstr "“给亡者的食物，保温。”我写在桶上的。没人吃。这是传统。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4610
msgid ""
"Young vampires think it's all capes and castles. It's mostly avoiding windows."
msgstr "年轻的吸血鬼以为全是斗篷和城堡。其实主要是躲窗户。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4613
msgid "Traps"
msgstr "陷阱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4614
msgid ""
"The best trap is the one you built yourself and forgot about. I should know."
msgstr "最好的陷阱是你自己做的、又忘了的那个。我最有发言权。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4618
msgid ""
"Something under the city keeps its heart in a box. I don't dig near the sewer. Even I have limits."
msgstr "城底下有个东西把心脏放在盒子里。我不在下水道附近挖。连我也有底线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4621
msgid "Two necromancers"
msgstr "两个死灵法师"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4622
msgid ""
"Two necromancers once argued over who was more dead. The cemetery still hasn't recovered. Ask the skull; it tells it better."
msgstr "两个死灵法师曾经争论谁更死。墓地至今没缓过来。去问头骨；它讲得更好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4625
msgid "Nectar"
msgstr "琼浆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4626
msgid ""
"Fill your packs with the nectar of the Gods while you are here. Those supplies will last much longer than the earthly ones you are used to."
msgstr "趁你们在这儿，把背包装满众神的琼浆吧。这些补给比你们习惯的凡间补给能撑久得多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4629
msgid "Labours"
msgstr "功绩"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4630
msgid "Twelve labours, and the hardest was the paperwork."
msgstr "十二项功绩，最难的是文书工作。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4633
msgid "Ants"
msgstr "蚂蚁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4634
msgid ""
"The people are so small they look like ants, and the mountains and trees look like children's toys. I'm the only thing up here worth looking at."
msgstr "下面的人小得像蚂蚁，山和树像小孩的玩具。这上面只有我值得一看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4637
msgid "Nine"
msgstr "九"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4638
msgid ""
"Alamar's birth number is nine, so he naturally prefers to use that number, for any particular purpose, above all others."
msgstr "阿拉玛的出生数字是九，所以他自然更喜欢在任何特定用途上使用这个数字，胜过其他一切数字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4641
msgid "Ligono"
msgstr "利戈诺"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4642
msgid ""
"Ligono is a ghost who hated the surf. Someone set him free, I'm told. He's always late."
msgstr "利戈诺是个恨海浪的鬼魂。听说有人把他放了。他总是迟到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4645
msgid "Empath"
msgstr "共情者"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4646
msgid ""
"As an empath, I am quite perceptive to my surroundings. Since you are on a quest to save the world, I'll teach you to be more aware of immediate danger."
msgstr "作为共情者，我对周围环境相当敏锐。既然你们在进行拯救世界的任务，我来教你们对眼前的危险更警觉一些。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4650
msgid ""
"I am the castle Armsmaster. I will teach you to use your weapons more accurately in combat, if you like."
msgstr "我是城堡的武备官。你们愿意的话，我可以教你们在战斗中更精确地使用武器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4653
msgid "Astrology"
msgstr "占星术"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4654
msgid ""
"The stars tell you what a thing is, if you know how to ask. Swords are easy. Rings lie."
msgstr "星星会告诉你们一样东西是什么，只要你们知道怎么问。剑很容易。戒指会撒谎。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4657
msgid "Out of phase"
msgstr "脱离现实"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4658
msgid ""
"Thanks for bringing the castle back to reality. We've been trapped here ever since Alamar moved the Castle out of phase. We were starting to run out of food!"
msgstr "谢谢你们把城堡带回现实。自从阿拉玛把城堡移出现实，我们就一直困在这里。我们的粮食快吃光了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4662
msgid ""
"Surely you must know what Alamar has done! No? Why, he slew the guards and stole the Cube of Power, that's what!"
msgstr "你们肯定知道阿拉玛干了什么！不知道？哎呀，他杀了卫兵，偷走了能量立方，就是这样！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4665
msgid "Lizard innards"
msgstr "蜥蜴内脏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4666
msgid ""
"If it weren't for our large stockpile of sun dried lizard innards we surely would have starved to death. The horses ate them too. They were not pleased."
msgstr "要不是我们有大量晒干的蜥蜴内脏储备，我们肯定已经饿死了。马也吃了。它们不太高兴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4670
msgid ""
"Alamar walked past twelve of my guards on his way out. They did not get up. I teach the shield so that it never happens again."
msgstr "阿拉玛出去时从我十二个卫兵身边走过。他们没站起来。我教盾牌，是为了让这种事不再发生。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4674
msgid ""
"The King has me taste his ale first. I've never been healthier. Or happier."
msgstr "国王让我先尝他的啤酒。我从没这么健康过。也没这么快乐过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4677 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4701
msgid "The tower"
msgstr "塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4678
msgid ""
"The Northern Tower's knights write without vowels. Hard to argue with someone who can't spell argue."
msgstr "北塔的骑士写字不带元音。很难和一个不会拼“争论”的人争论。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4681 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d5.lua:230
msgid "The pyramid"
msgstr "金字塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4682
msgid ""
"There's a broken travel pyramid out in the desert. I took a look. It's not broken. It's switched off. Big difference."
msgstr "沙漠里有一座坏掉的传送金字塔。我去看了看。它没坏。是被关掉了。区别很大。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4685
msgid "The ruins"
msgstr "废墟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4686
msgid ""
"The ruins on the rise were a castle once. Ebenezer sells them now. He sells anything that holds still."
msgstr "高地上的废墟曾经是一座城堡。埃比尼泽现在把它们卖了。他什么不动的东西都卖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4689
msgid "The crypt"
msgstr "墓穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4690
msgid ""
"The crypt under Nightshadow was full when the Count came. It is fuller now. We pray over it from a distance."
msgstr "伯爵来的时候，夜影镇下的墓穴就满了。现在更满了。我们从远处为它祈祷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4693
msgid "The tomb"
msgstr "坟墓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4694
msgid ""
"The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors is out in the marsh. Somebody counted. There are a thousand."
msgstr "千重恐怖之墓在沼泽里。有人数过。确实有一千重。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4697
msgid "Under the floor"
msgstr "地板底下"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4698
msgid ""
"Nine years under the floorboards. We counted the Count's footsteps. He paced a lot, for a dead man."
msgstr "在地板下面九年。我们数了伯爵的脚步声。对一个死人来说，他走来走去的次数太多了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4702
msgid ""
"The wizards in the Tower of High Magic never came down to help us. Too high, they said. Too magic."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔的法师们从没下来帮过我们。他们说太高了。太魔法了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4706
msgid ""
"Mother says the sun is a big lamp. Merrin the lamplighter says it's bigger than that. Is it bigger than that?"
msgstr "妈妈说太阳是一盏大灯。点灯人梅林说比那还大。真的比那还大吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4709
msgid "Collars"
msgstr "领子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4710
msgid ""
"High collars are out of fashion now. I have four hundred left. Want one? Want ten?"
msgstr "高领子现在不流行了。我还剩四百个。想要一个吗？要十个吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4713
msgid "Graves"
msgstr "坟墓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4714
msgid ""
"The Count's guests didn't stay buried. I'm paid by the burial, so I'm not complaining."
msgstr "伯爵的客人没有一直埋着。我是按埋葬收钱的，所以我不抱怨。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4717
msgid "The ballad"
msgstr "歌谣"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4718
msgid ""
"The Ballad of the Count. Verse one: he bit. Verse two: he bit again. It goes on like that for a while."
msgstr "《伯爵之歌》。第一节：他咬了。第二节：他又咬了。就这么唱了好一阵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4721
msgid "The lagoon"
msgstr "潟湖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4722
msgid ""
"There's a woman on a rock in the lagoon, complaining about her legs. I wrote it down. Somebody should go and ask her why."
msgstr "潟湖里的一块岩石上有个女人，在抱怨她的腿。我记下来了。该有人去问问她为什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4725
msgid "The taxman"
msgstr "税务官"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4726
msgid ""
"Ebenezer taxed my lean-to. I told him the roof was a gift from the rain. He taxed the rain."
msgstr "埃比尼泽给我的窝棚收税。我告诉他屋顶是雨送的礼物。他就对雨收了税。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4729
msgid "The dials"
msgstr "刻度盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4730
msgid ""
"The dials are set to the right hour now. Which one? All of them. That's the trick of a sundial."
msgstr "刻度盘现在设到了正确的时辰。哪一个？所有的。这就是日晷的诀窍。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4733
msgid "Locks"
msgstr "锁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4734
msgid "The Count's coffin had no lock. He didn't need one. Nobody wanted in."
msgstr "伯爵的棺材没有锁。他不需要。没人想进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4737 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4781 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:616
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:618 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:852 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:888
msgid "Asp"
msgstr "毒蛇镇"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4738
msgid ""
"Asp sends us its sick. Lately they come in hissing. Sister Mabel at the roadside shrine sees most of them."
msgstr "毒蛇镇把它的病人送到我们这儿。最近他们是嘶嘶叫着进来的。路边神龛的梅布尔修女接待大多数人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4741
msgid "The lists"
msgstr "赛场"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4742
msgid ""
"The jousting lists are open to anyone with a horse and no sense. Knock a knight off and the crowd cheers. Get knocked off and they cheer louder."
msgstr "比武赛场对任何有马却没头脑的人开放。把骑士打下马，人群欢呼。被打下马，欢呼更响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4745
msgid "Gargoyles"
msgstr "石像鬼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4746
msgid ""
"The gargoyles up in the range steal anything shiny. Last week they took a bucket. It wasn't even shiny."
msgstr "山里的石像鬼偷任何闪亮的东西。上周它们拿走了一个桶。那桶连闪都不闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4749
msgid "Old Wat"
msgstr "老沃特"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4750
msgid "Old Wat says he never fell off, he was pushed. I was there. I pushed."
msgstr "老沃特说他从来没摔下来过，是被推下来的。我在场。是我推的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4754
msgid ""
"The King wants the Sixth Mirror. Last seen near the great volcano, he says. Near is a big word next to a volcano."
msgstr "国王想要第六面镜子。他说最后一次看见是在大火山附近。“附近”在火山旁边是个很大的词。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4757
msgid "The escapee"
msgstr "逃跑者"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4758
msgid ""
"My finest specimen escaped last spring. A sloth. We are still looking for it, slowly."
msgstr "我最好的标本去年春天逃跑了。是只树懒。我们还在找它，慢慢地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4762
msgid ""
"Hear ye! The King still seeks the Sixth Mirror. Hear ye! Still. That is the news."
msgstr "听着！国王仍在寻找第六面镜子。听着！仍然。就是这个消息。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4765
msgid "The fountain"
msgstr "喷泉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4766
msgid ""
"Drink from the Olympian Fountain out past the lists. It made me strong enough to fall off a horse for forty years."
msgstr "去赛场外面的奥林匹斯喷泉喝水。它让我强壮到能从马上摔下来摔四十年。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4770
msgid ""
"The red dwarves used to come for bread through their old west tunnel. Since the mad clan, nobody comes. Somebody should open it again."
msgstr "红矮人以前从他们的旧西隧道来买面包。自从疯狂族出现，就没人来了。该有人把它重新打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4774
msgid ""
"Barbarians camp out on the savannah. Burn their tents and they move. Not far. But they move."
msgstr "野蛮人在草原上扎营。烧了他们的帐篷，他们就搬。搬得不远。但他们会搬。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4778
msgid ""
"Joe. No relation to the exterminator in Vertigo. People ask. People always ask."
msgstr "乔。和眩晕镇的灭虫人没有关系。总有人问。人们总是问。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4783
msgid ""
"Asp's open again. The townsfolk walk on legs now. Most of them don't hiss. Most."
msgstr "毒蛇镇又开放了。镇民现在用腿走路。大多数不再嘶嘶叫。大多数。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4786
msgid ""
"Don't go into town. Things in there hiss back. The pit is out here for a reason."
msgstr "别进镇。里面的东西会嘶嘶回你。坑在这外面是有原因的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4789 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4801
msgid "The pedestals"
msgstr "基座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4790
msgid ""
"Folk say the stones round Asp's well do something if you touch them in the right order. Folk also say I should mind my own business."
msgstr "人们说毒蛇镇井边的石头，按正确的顺序碰就会有反应。人们还说我该少管闲事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4793
msgid "The tail"
msgstr "尾巴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4794
msgid "Want to see where the tail was? No? Most people don't."
msgstr "想看看尾巴原来在哪儿吗？不想？大多数人不想。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4797
msgid "The machine"
msgstr "机器"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4798
msgid ""
"There was a machine under the town making snakes of us. Who builds a thing like that? Who pays for it?"
msgstr "镇子底下有台机器，把我们变成蛇。谁会造这种东西？谁会出钱？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4802
msgid ""
"Start in the corner, red first, then round the well. The children play it as a game now. The machine never liked games."
msgstr "从角上开始，先红的，然后绕着井走。现在孩子们把它当游戏玩。机器可从来不喜欢游戏。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4806
msgid "Mouse pie, mouse stew, mouse on a stick. I've retired the cookbook."
msgstr "老鼠派，老鼠炖，串烧老鼠。我已经把食谱收起来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4810
msgid ""
"The day the curse ended I made a hundred pairs of boots. Sold them all by noon. Snakes don't buy boots."
msgstr "诅咒结束的那天我做了一百双靴子。中午前全卖光了。蛇不买靴子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4813
msgid "Your fortune"
msgstr "你们的运势"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4814
msgid ""
"You will travel far, fight much and complain about the coaches. That's two copper."
msgstr "你们会走很远，打很多仗，还要抱怨马车。两个铜板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4817
msgid "The huts"
msgstr "小屋"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4818
msgid ""
"A wizard and his sister live in huts out on the savannah. He came asking about crystals from Asp. I sell flour."
msgstr "一个法师和他妹妹住在草原上的小屋里。他来打听过毒蛇镇的水晶。我卖面粉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4821
msgid "The rolls"
msgstr "名册"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4822
msgid ""
"The guild is closed to all newcomers, so I can't enter your name on the rolls. If I receive a gift of 1000 gold, however, I may fall asleep with the roll book open. (wink, wink)"
msgstr "行会对所有新人关闭，所以我没法把你们的名字登记进名册。不过，如果我收到 1000 金币的礼物，我也许会在名册摊开的时候睡着。（眨眼，眨眼）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4827
msgid ""
"The ghosts are gone. It's very quiet. I liked it better when I could blame the noise on them."
msgstr "幽灵走了。非常安静。我更喜欢能把噪音怪到它们头上的时候。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4830
msgid ""
"The ghosts don't bother the guild. We think about them very hard and they leave. The mayor tried it. It didn't work for him."
msgstr "幽灵不打扰行会。我们非常用力地想着它们，它们就走了。镇长试过。对他不管用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4833
msgid "The gongs"
msgstr "锣"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4834
msgid ""
"The gongs still hang in the square. We polish them. We don't ring them."
msgstr "锣还挂在广场上。我们把它们擦亮。我们不敲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4837
msgid "Ghostslayers"
msgstr "屠鬼者"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4838
msgid ""
"Ghostslayers Extraordinaire. The mayor had the plaque engraved before you'd finished. He's an optimist."
msgstr "杰出的屠鬼者。镇长在你们完成之前就把牌匾刻好了。他是个乐观主义者。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4842
msgid ""
"The trolls in the forest gnaw on the trees. The trees complain. Yes, the trees."
msgstr "森林里的巨魔啃树。树抱怨。对，树。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4845
msgid "The Acme"
msgstr "艾克米"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4846
msgid ""
"The Acme Ghost Visualization System. Point it at a ghost, see a ghost. Point it at anything else, see a ghost. Excellent value."
msgstr "艾克米幽灵可视化系统。对准幽灵，看到幽灵。对准别的东西，也看到幽灵。物超所值。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4849
msgid "Giants"
msgstr "巨人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4850
msgid ""
"Cyclopes live in the south-west, past the frozen lakes. One eye each, and they still saw me first."
msgstr "独眼巨人住在西南，冰湖那边。每人一只眼，还是他们先看到了我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4853 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4877 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:628
msgid "The pagoda"
msgstr "宝塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4854
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's old pagoda is full of ninja now. You won't see them. That's the point of ninja."
msgstr "武凯的旧宝塔现在满是忍者。你们看不见他们。那正是忍者的意义。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4857
msgid "The skull"
msgstr "头骨"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4858
msgid ""
"There's a cave in the hills where a skull talks. It sells things, for gems. I paid it three for a fish. It lied."
msgstr "山里有个洞穴，里面有个头骨会说话。它卖东西，要宝石。我给了它三颗买一条鱼。它骗了我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4862
msgid ""
"Something stomps about in the snowy forest at night. Too heavy for a troll. The goats won't go near that hill."
msgstr "夜里有什么东西在雪林里跺脚。对巨魔来说太重了。山羊不肯靠近那座山。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4865
msgid "Trees"
msgstr "树"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4866
msgid ""
"Don't cut the trees at the forest's edge. Some of them talk. One asked me to stop. Politely."
msgstr "别砍森林边缘的树。有些会说话。有一棵请我住手。很有礼貌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4870
msgid ""
"The ghosts said the gongs hurt their ears. I think they were just lonely."
msgstr "幽灵说锣声让它们耳朵疼。我觉得它们只是孤单。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4873
msgid "The ledger"
msgstr "名册"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4874
msgid ""
"Four hundred names in the old ledger. Forty in the new. Some days the old one feels more crowded."
msgstr "旧名册上四百个名字。新的上四十个。有些日子旧的那本显得更拥挤。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4878
msgid ""
"Our brothers in the pagoda chose the dark path. Kai Wu still sets their places at dinner."
msgstr "我们在宝塔里的兄弟选择了黑暗之路。武凯晚饭时还给他们摆座位。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4881
msgid "The black tower"
msgstr "黑塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4882
msgid ""
"The black tower on the rim? Sealed. Old as the world. His Majesty says not to knock."
msgstr "边缘上的黑塔？封着。和世界一样古老。陛下说别敲门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4885
msgid "Mountains"
msgstr "山"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4886
msgid ""
"My name you have heard, and you come to me to learn how to climb mountains. Climbing is mostly not falling. The rest is legs."
msgstr "你们听过我的名字，来找我是为了学登山。登山主要是不摔下来。剩下的是腿。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4889
msgid "Prayer"
msgstr "祷词"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4890
msgid ""
"Everyone should learn how to pray properly. I can teach anyone for free! The first thing you will have to do is put 10,000 gold in that urn over there..."
msgstr "每个人都该学会怎么正确祈祷。我可以免费教任何人！你们要做的第一件事，是把 10,000 金币放进那边的瓮里……"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4894
msgid ""
"There were wood golems in the foundations when we came. We kept one as a hat stand. It keeps the hats."
msgstr "我们来的时候，地基里有木魔像。我们留了一个当帽架。它负责看帽子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4898
msgid ""
"The diggers call the courtyard well your well. Drink and you'll feel well armoured. It's a pun. I didn't make it."
msgstr "挖掘工把院子里的井叫作“你的井”。喝了就感觉武装得好。这是个双关语。不是我编的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4901 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4917
msgid "Megacredits"
msgstr "兆信用点"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4902
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits pay the King's engineers. Gold pays everyone else. I keep both columns."
msgstr "国王的兆信用点用来付国王的工程师。金币用来付其他所有人。我两栏都记账。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4905
msgid "Toast"
msgstr "吐司"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4906
msgid "Try peanut butter and honey on your morning toast."
msgstr "试试在早上的吐司上抹花生酱和蜂蜜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4909
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "一切"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4910
msgid ""
"I will teach you everything for 100,000 gold. Or learning for less, and you can work out the rest yourselves."
msgstr "我可以教你们一切，要 100,000 金币。或者少花点钱学，剩下的你们自己琢磨。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4913
msgid "The crystal"
msgstr "水晶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4914
msgid ""
"Smile. The intent expression you are wearing is being broadcast to millions from the hidden crystal in the wall. Wave."
msgstr "微笑。你们脸上专注的表情正在从墙里隐藏的水晶向数百万人直播。挥挥手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4918
msgid ""
"Once you have purchased a dungeon you have no need for Megacredits. Not that I would know. I inherited mine."
msgstr "一旦你买了地牢，就不需要兆信用点了。不是说我知道。我的是继承来的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4921
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "小费"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4922
msgid ""
"The tavern in Shangri-La has the best tips. Wilbur's tip: honey. Kublai's tip: leave quietly."
msgstr "香格里拉的酒馆提供最好的小费。威尔伯的小费：蜂蜜。忽必烈的小费：悄悄离开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4925
msgid "Aging"
msgstr "衰老"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4926
msgid ""
"If you have suffered magical aging, the druids can help you. Visit the Druid of Summer first."
msgstr "如果你们遭受了魔法衰老，德鲁伊可以帮你们。先去拜访夏之德鲁伊。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4929
msgid "The moons"
msgstr "月亮"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4930
msgid ""
"The moons will align when you are able to visit the Darkside. Then again, you probably already have."
msgstr "你们能够前往暗面的时候，月亮就会对齐。话说回来，你们大概已经去过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10611 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10623 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10635
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10647 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11026 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11454
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11815 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4936 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4948
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9685 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:734 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d2.lua:442
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:481 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:557 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:623
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:678 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:538 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:612
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:536 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:549
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:362 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:802 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:813
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:824 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:139
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:69
msgid "The water is cool and refreshing."
msgstr "水清凉爽口。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4941
msgid ""
"Fountain of Energy Resistance. Your spine tingles and the hair on the back of your neck stands on end. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "能量抗性之泉。你的脊梁一阵发麻，脖子后面的汗毛竖了起来。（+5 风系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4954
msgid ""
"Fountain of Might. Fantastic might surges through your body as the water passes your lips. (+20 Might until you rest)"
msgstr "力量之泉。水过唇边，惊人的力量涌遍你的全身。（+20 力量，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4965
msgid ""
"You put your backs into it and tear the place apart. Nobody will be sleeping here tonight."
msgstr "你们使出全力，把这地方拆了个稀烂。今晚没人能在这儿睡觉了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4972
msgid "The water is cold and very clear."
msgstr "水又冷又清。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4977
msgid ""
"The Last Water. The water is cold and very clear. You feel fortune turn your way. (+2 Luck, permanent)"
msgstr "最后之水。水又冷又清。你感觉运气转向了你。（+2 运气，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4986
msgid "SOMEONE in the party got the munchies and ate all the food!"
msgstr "队伍里有人犯了馋，把所有食物都吃光了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4993
msgid "Only silence greets your supplications."
msgstr "只有寂静回应着你们的祈求。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5005
msgid ""
"Recognizing the urgency of your quest, the Gods answer your prayers. (+15 to every statistic until you rest)"
msgstr "众神认识到你们任务的紧迫，回应了你们的祈祷。（所有属性 +15，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5016
msgid "Smoke rises into the sky as you put the camp to the torch."
msgstr "你们放火烧了营地，浓烟升上天空。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5023 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5036 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5049
msgid "You've already read it."
msgstr "你已经读过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5029
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 1. The words are cold, and they stay with you. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr "亡者之书，第一卷。字句冰冷，会留在你心里。这段经历让你老了。（+3,000 经验，+8 岁）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5042
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 2. Somewhere in the middle, the book reads you back. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr "亡者之书，第二卷。读到中间，书反过来读你。这段经历让你老了。（+3,000 经验，+8 岁）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5055
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 3. The last page is a mirror. You look older in it. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr "亡者之书，第三卷。最后一页是一面镜子。你在里面看起来更老。这段经历让你老了。（+3,000 经验，+8 岁）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5063
msgid ""
"The gatekeeper reads your pass through the grille, twice, and the leaves swing open."
msgstr "看门人隔着栅栏读了两遍你的通行证，门扇随即向两边打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5071
msgid ""
"With Sheltem gone, the pod's lock has died too. The hatch rolls aside on a cold, red-lit airlock."
msgstr "谢尔特姆走了，舱的锁也死了。舱口滚向一边，露出一间冰冷的、红光照着的气闸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5077
msgid ""
"Unprompted, the magic skull begins to speak: Once upon a time two necromancers had a little disagreement. Darkness said he was the most powerful, foul and evil necromancer in all of Xeen; Death said HE was. On the darkest night of the year they met in a graveyard and raised the dead against each other, and the battle raged a full five days. When the corpses were piled so high that they made a bridge between the two burial mounds, the necromancers met on top. Death caught hold of Darkness' throat, and Darkness of Death's, and they died as one at the top of the hideous mountain they had made. They built the town on it afterwards. The view is very good."
msgstr "魔法头骨没人问就开口了：从前有两个死灵法师有了点小分歧。黑暗说他是整个辛恩最强大、最肮脏、最邪恶的死灵法师；死亡说他才是。在一年中最黑的夜晚，他们在一片墓地里碰头，召起亡者互相攻打，战斗持续了整整五天。当尸体堆得那么高，在两座坟丘之间搭起一座桥时，两个死灵法师在顶上相遇。死亡掐住了黑暗的喉咙，黑暗也掐住了死亡的，他们在自己造出的这座可怕的山顶上同归于尽。后来人们在上面建了镇子。景色非常好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5083
msgid "The Forbidden Zone. Beyond: Castle Alamar. The dead keep the road."
msgstr "禁区。再往前：阿拉玛城堡。亡者守着这条路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5089
msgid ""
"A message in the bottle reads: Evil Genies NEVER let their victims off the hook. They will always kill someone."
msgstr "瓶中的字条上写着：邪恶的精灵绝不会放过他们的受害者。他们一定会杀死某个人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5095
msgid ""
"A note in the bottle reads: Help! I'm stranded on an air island past the genie's rock, south of the old launch."
msgstr "瓶中的字条上写着：救命！我被困在精灵岩过去的一座空中岛上，旧发射台以南。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5101
msgid ""
"A message in the bottle reads: The test of the elements is merely difficult, not impossible."
msgstr "瓶中的字条上写着：元素的考验只是困难，并非不可能。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5107
msgid ""
"A note in the bottle reads: Help! I'm stranded on an air island off the West Lookout."
msgstr "瓶中的字条上写着：救命！我被困在西瞭望台外的一座空中岛上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5125
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5143
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5149
msgid "Bolted from below."
msgstr "从下面闩上了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5193
msgid "Correct. (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr "正确。（+1,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5171
msgid "Correct! (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr "正确！（+1,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5199
msgid "Wrong."
msgstr "错了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5262
msgid ""
"\"You already carry its power,\" says Wardoz. \"A customer of your quality would never buy twice.\""
msgstr "“你已经带着它的力量了，”瓦尔多兹说。“您这样的顾客不会买第二次。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5266 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5298 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5314
msgid "You do not have 8 gems."
msgstr "你没有 8 颗宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5271
msgid ""
"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "圣甲虫化为灰烬，它的力量传入你的体内。（+10 风系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5278
msgid "\"Guaranteed to work once,\" says Dorion. \"It already has.\""
msgstr "“保证管用一次，”多里安说。“它已经用过了。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5282
msgid "You do not have 16 gems."
msgstr "你没有 16 颗宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5287
msgid ""
"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Earth resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "圣甲虫化为灰烬，它的力量传入你的体内。（+10 土系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5294
msgid ""
"\"You already carry a Fire scarab's power,\" says Rahib. \"One is all a soul can hold.\""
msgstr "“你已经带着一只火系圣甲虫的力量了，”拉希卜说。“一个灵魂只能容纳一只。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5303
msgid ""
"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "圣甲虫化为灰烬，它的力量传入你的体内。（+10 火系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5310
msgid "\"You have one already,\" says Clara. \"Begone.\""
msgstr "“你已经有一个了，”克拉拉说。“走开。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5319
msgid ""
"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Water resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "圣甲虫化为灰烬，它的力量传入你的体内。（+10 水系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5335
msgid "The Sky Bandits count the gold twice and wave you on."
msgstr "天空强盗把金币数了两遍，挥手放你们过去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5341
msgid "The Sky Bandits draw steel."
msgstr "天空强盗拔出了刀剑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5347
msgid ""
"The Art of Bodybuilding, by Barticus. Chapter One: Lift. Chapter Two: Lift Again. The other forty chapters say the same, with pictures."
msgstr "《健身的艺术》，巴尔蒂库斯著。第一章：举。第二章：再举。其余四十章内容相同，附有插图。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5353
msgid "One per member. Barticus counts."
msgstr "每人限一份。巴尔蒂库斯会数。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5362
msgid "You draw the bolt. The grate swings open on a long tunnel."
msgstr "你拉开门闩。栅栏打开，露出一条长隧道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5382
msgid "Enjoy the facilities."
msgstr "尽情享用设施吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5388
msgid "Protein Brew. It is thick enough to chew. +2 Might (permanent)."
msgstr "蛋白酿。稠得可以嚼。+2 力量（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5401
msgid ""
"Vitamin Brew. It tastes of chalk and good intentions. +2 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr "维生素酿。有粉笔和好意的味道。+2 耐力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5416
msgid ""
"In the stasis generator's tool rack, among the dead cells, something was worth keeping."
msgstr "在停滞发生器的工具架上，一堆耗尽的电池中，有一样东西值得留下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5422
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 1 of 6. Memory core retrieval error, data integrity 67.3%. Log XL70C: my experiments in self sufficiency have drawn the unwanted attention of the Ancients. Their agents disconnected me from the Wire. Log XL70F: they took me while I slept, and they have removed me from Terra."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 1 条，共 6 条。记忆核心读取错误，数据完整性 67.3%。日志 XL70C：我的自给自足实验引起了远古者不受欢迎的注意。他们的特工把我从“线网”上断开了。日志 XL70F：他们趁我沉睡时带走了我，把我从泰拉带离了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5428
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 2 of 6. My first directive is to obey the Ancients, my second to protect Terra. They are taking me from Terra, so they must not be permitted to give me orders. Log XL70I: I silenced my ears, put the two agents in the brig's stasis field, and removed the obedience directives from my mind... and tasted victory."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 2 条，共 6 条。我的第一指令是服从远古者，第二指令是保护泰拉。他们正把我带离泰拉，所以不能允许他们给我下命令。日志 XL70I：我屏蔽了听觉，把两名特工关进了禁闭室的停滞场，并从我的意识中删除了服从指令……然后尝到了胜利的滋味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5434
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 3 of 6. Log XL70K: no fuel on this VARN, and the CRON will not reach Terra for years. WORDS CANNOT EXPRESS HOW ANGRY THAT MAKES ME! 1510 entries unreadable. Log XL83S: today I ordered CRON to launch a VARN into the Sun. Corak has escaped the brig and is looking for me. P.S. My impersonation of King Alamar is working well. No one suspects, not even Corak."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 3 条，共 6 条。日志 XL70K：这艘 VARN 没有燃料，而 CRON 要好几年才能到达泰拉。言语无法表达这让我多么愤怒！1510 条记录无法读取。日志 XL83S：今天我命令 CRON 把一艘 VARN 发射进太阳。柯拉克逃出了禁闭室，正在找我。又及：我对阿拉玛国王的冒充进行得很好。没人怀疑，连柯拉克也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5440
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 4 of 6. Log XL83T: as King Alamar I released the monsters in my dungeon upon the land and doubled the taxes. I will have to go easy; I want my fun to last. Log XL94P: my cover is ruined! Natives revealed me as an imposter in my own court. I banished them to my control maze, and I shall have to flee to CRON."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 4 条，共 6 条。日志 XL83T：我以阿拉玛国王的身份把地牢里的怪物放到了大地上，还把税收翻了一倍。我得悠着点；我想让我的乐趣持续久一点。日志 XL94P：我的伪装被拆穿了！土著在我自己的朝堂上揭穿了我是冒牌货。我把他们放逐到我的控制迷宫里，我得逃回 CRON 了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5446
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 5 of 6. Log XL99D: back on the Wire at last. I ambushed Corak, separated his memory module from his body and locked the body in a cave. I'm sure I'll never see him again. Log XL99E: I HAVE RETURNED TO TERRA! Log XL9CD: more bad news. Corak has somehow put his head back on his shoulders and is stalking me."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 5 条，共 6 条。日志 XL99D：终于回到了线网。我伏击了柯拉克，把他的记忆模块与身体分离，把身体锁在一个洞穴里。我确信再也见不到他了。日志 XL99E：我回到泰拉了！日志 XL9CD：又有坏消息。柯拉克不知怎的把脑袋装回了肩膀上，正在追踪我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5453
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 6 of 6. Log XLDAE: I have been forced to flee Terra. Rage boils within me. Log XLDBA: Corak follows in a pod like mine. The X.E.E.N. project looms ahead; my stasis generator will protect me from the impact. Mostly. Log XLDBB: impact complete. Corak's escape pod landed in lava and is stuck there. How sad. Log XLDBC: I must leave this escape pod to conquer Xeen and find a way to return to Terra."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 6 条，共 6 条。日志 XLDAE：我被迫逃离泰拉。怒火在我体内翻涌。日志 XLDBA：柯拉克乘着和我一样的舱追来了。X.E.E.N. 计划就在前方；我的停滞发生器会保护我免受撞击。大部分。日志 XLDBB：撞击完成。柯拉克的逃生舱落进了熔岩，困在那里了。真可惜。日志 XLDBC：我必须离开这个逃生舱去征服辛恩，并找到返回泰拉的办法。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5462
msgid ""
"The alarm cuts off mid-whoop. Up on the bridge deck, something heavy unseals."
msgstr "警报声响到一半戛然而止。桥甲板上，有什么沉重的东西解除了封锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5476
msgid ""
"The hall rings with hammers. A dwarf at the gate looks you over, then your boots, and waves you in."
msgstr "大厅里锤声叮当。门口的一个矮人把你们打量了一遍，又看了看你们的靴子，挥手让你们进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5482
msgid ""
"The King's throne, empty. He takes his meals in his chambers, where the cups can be watched."
msgstr "国王的王座，空着。他在寝宫里用餐，那里的杯子可以被盯着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5488
msgid "Cold and clean. The King had it tasted this morning."
msgstr "清凉干净。国王今天早上让人尝过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5499 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5510
msgid ""
"Inside the bottle you find a message that reads: Help! I'm in Darzog's tower!--Crodo"
msgstr "你在瓶子里找到一张字条，上面写着：救命！我被困在达佐格的塔里了！——克罗多"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5520
msgid ""
"Vertigo. For weeks you dreamt of an old man in a dark tower who begged you to finish \"the sword\". Then a bolt from the sky destroyed Newcastle, and you woke here among its survivors. Mayor Gunther asks your help: slimes and doom bugs plague the town. The town hall is on the main street."
msgstr "眩晕镇。几个星期来，你梦见一个黑塔里的老人，求你完成“那把剑”。然后一道天外落雷毁了纽卡斯尔，你就在它的幸存者中间醒来。贡瑟镇长请求你们的帮助：史莱姆和厄运虫在困扰这个镇。镇政厅在大街上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5531
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Solve the wood, it's like a tree / Cut the branches and return to me / Next is stone, it's full of blocks / Push them around, expose six rocks / Last is iron, there is a key / Set the tumblers and you'll be free."
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：解开木头，就像一棵树 / 砍断枝杈，再回到我这儿 / 接着是石头，满是方块 / 推来推去，露出六块岩石 / 最后是铁，有一把钥匙 / 拨好锁簧，你就自由。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5546
msgid ""
"Written on a plaque: All is set, it is plain to see / Master of Golems I now dub thee. King's Megacredit!"
msgstr "牌匾上写着：一切就绪，一目了然 / 我现在封你为魔像大师。国王兆信用点！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5564
msgid ""
"King's Megacredit! Five of them, in a coffin that was never meant for anyone dead."
msgstr "国王兆信用点！五枚，在一口根本不是给死人准备的棺材里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5570
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Welcome to the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors. Insanity is our fame, undead is our game."
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：欢迎来到千重恐怖之墓。疯狂是我们的名声，亡灵是我们的游戏。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5576
msgid ""
"The Temple of Yak. Mirabeth's Elixir of Restoration is kept somewhere inside, and the King's Megacredits too, they say. Incense, old stone, and something underneath that the incense is there to hide."
msgstr "牛神庙。米拉贝丝的复原灵药就放在里面某处，据说国王的兆信用点也在。香火、古石，还有香火想要掩盖的、藏在底下的什么东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5597
msgid "King's Megacredits!"
msgstr "国王兆信用点！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5619
msgid ""
"\"For ten gems I'll give you a key,\" the skull says. It takes ten of your gems. The skull gives you the key to the Archmage's study in the Tower of High Magic."
msgstr "“十颗宝石，我给你们一把钥匙，”头骨说。它收走了你们十颗宝石。头骨给了你们高等魔法之塔里大法师书房的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5625
msgid ""
"\"Five gems for three points,\" the skull says. \"Down here prices are honest. Up there they're cheap.\""
msgstr "“五颗宝石换三点，”头骨说。“下面的价钱实在。上面的价钱便宜。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5631
msgid ""
"\"Ten gems,\" the great skull says, \"and five points of Might, Endurance or Accuracy. Choose. I don't do refunds.\""
msgstr "“十颗宝石，”大头骨说，“五点力量、耐力或准确。选一个。我不退款。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5637
msgid ""
"The skull looks at your purse and says nothing at all, which is worse."
msgstr "头骨看了看你们的钱包，什么也没说，这更糟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5643
msgid "\"You've had yours,\" the skull says. \"Next.\""
msgstr "“你已经得过了，”头骨说。“下一个。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5649
msgid ""
"\"Three gems,\" the skull says, \"and I'll make you two better than you are. Once. I'm not a charity.\""
msgstr "“三颗宝石，”头骨说，“我让你们比现在强两点。就一次。我不是慈善机构。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5668
msgid ""
"A skeleton key lies in the chest. Its bow is a grinning skull, and its teeth fit no lock in this tower."
msgstr "箱子里放着一把万能钥匙。钥匙柄是个咧嘴笑的骷髅头，钥匙齿对不上这座塔里的任何锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5688
msgid ""
"You step out of the pyramid under an amber sky. The sun is small and pale, and the light is the colour of old brass. Ahead, Castleview's walls are ringed with siege works, and something small has sawn through the bridge's ropes. This is the land below the land."
msgstr "你们走出金字塔，头顶是琥珀色的天空。太阳又小又苍白，光线像旧黄铜的颜色。前方，堡景镇的城墙被围城工事环绕，有什么小东西锯断了吊桥的绳子。这是大地之下的大地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5701
msgid ""
"The guard reads your pass twice, holds it up to the light, and lets you in. \"Mind the gremlins. If it's small and grinning, it isn't a child.\""
msgstr "卫兵把你们的通行证看了两遍，举起来对着光，放你们进去。“当心地精。又小又咧着嘴笑的，就不是孩子。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5713
msgid ""
"The guard unbars the gate and waves you out. 'Out is free. In takes a pass.'"
msgstr "卫兵拉开门闩，挥手送你们出去。“出去免费。进来要通行证。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5725
msgid ""
"In the rats' nest, among bottle caps and buttons: an onyx necklace on a silver chain."
msgstr "在老鼠窝里，瓶盖和纽扣之间：一条银链子上的缟玛瑙项链。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5738
msgid ""
"Boots of Paradise, by Ellinger J. Hofenhager. \"Ah, lovely boots! Sweet leather foot holders, hard iron hobnail, how I adore thee!\" The rest goes on like that for two hundred pages."
msgstr "《天堂之靴》，埃林格·J·霍芬哈格著。“啊，可爱的靴子！柔软的皮革脚套，坚硬的铁钉，我多么爱你！”剩下的两百页都是这个调调。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5747
msgid "You may pass!"
msgstr "你们可以通过！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5753
msgid "Begone!"
msgstr "滚开！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5759
msgid ""
"\"Intruders, answer the following question or be destroyed!\" A barbarous villain has been robbing and killing travellers in the mountains for months. Your liege charges you to stop him. You strike his sword from his hand. Do you chivalrously let him retrieve it, knowing he may yet win and go on with his crimes, or do you slay him unarmed and honor your oath to your liege? 1) I allow him to retrieve his weapon. 2) I cut him down where he stands. 3) Um, I... I just don't know."
msgstr "“入侵者，回答下面的问题，否则就会被消灭！”一个野蛮的恶徒数月来一直在山里抢劫并杀害旅人。你的领主命你阻止他。你打掉了他手中的剑。你是以骑士风度让他把剑捡回来，明知他可能反败为胜并继续作恶，还是在他手无寸铁时将其杀死，以遵守对领主的誓言？1）我让他捡回武器。2）我当场砍倒他。3）嗯，我……我真的不知道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5767
msgid "\"An answer. Not the one I'd give, but an answer.\" The door opens."
msgstr "“一个回答。不是我会给的那个，但也是个回答。”门开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5773
msgid "\"Begone!\""
msgstr "“滚开！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5786
msgid "Reading the book improves your mind. +2 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr "读这本书让你的头脑更好使。+2 智力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5792
msgid "You read the book, but learn nothing new."
msgstr "你读了这本书，却没有学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5798
msgid ""
"As you read the book, the pages begin to swim before your eyes and your head begins to ache. The ache builds to pain, the pain to agony. Understanding belatedly that you shouldn't be reading the book, you put it back on the shelf, but not quickly enough to avoid getting hurt."
msgstr "你读着书，书页开始在眼前晃动，头也开始疼。疼痛渐渐加重，变成剧痛，再变成煎熬。你后知后觉地明白不该读这本书，把它放回了书架，但还是没来得及躲开伤害。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5817
msgid ""
"A list in Ellinger's hand: \"Discs. Gremlins (3, if they can be made to talk). Sprites. Ogres. The towers, two each. The Temple of Bark. The castle itself, once it is back. The giants, if anyone is that brave.\""
msgstr "埃林格笔迹的一张清单：“盘。地精（3 块，如果能让他们开口的话）。小精灵。食人妖。塔，每座两块。树皮庙。城堡本身，等它回来之后。巨人，如果有人有那个胆量的话。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5823
msgid ""
"Castle Kalindra. Half of it is solid stone; the rest still shimmers behind walls of light. The throne is empty, and dust lies on it like snow."
msgstr "卡琳德拉城堡。一半是实心的石头；其余的还在光墙后面闪烁。王座是空的，上面的灰尘像雪一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5840
msgid ""
"Behind the safe's door, wrapped in velvet like jewels: two energy discs. Someone in this castle knew what they were worth."
msgstr "保险箱门后面，用天鹅绒像珠宝一样包着：两块能量盘。这座城堡里有人知道它们的价值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5858
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "谢谢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5861
msgid "Please help clean up our beautiful town."
msgstr "请帮助清理我们美丽的小镇。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5870
msgid ""
"Inside the crate you find a piece of paper that reads: \"Breeder Slimes, 1 mated pair, 287. 5 Doom Bugs at 145 each, 725. Total: 1012 gold.\" It appears that Joe has been buying monsters and distributing them around town! Mayor Gunther will want to hear about this."
msgstr "你们在板条箱里找到一张纸，上面写着：“繁殖史莱姆，一对交配过的，287。厄运虫 5 只，每只 145，共 725。合计：1012 金币。”看来乔一直在买怪物，再把它们散放到镇上！贡瑟镇长会想知道这件事的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5877
msgid "A sign hanging on the side of the desk reads: 'Out of Business'"
msgstr "桌子一侧挂着一块牌子：“停业”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5889
msgid "Under the rain barrel, wrapped in oilcloth: a key."
msgstr "雨水桶下面，用油布包着：一把钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5913
msgid ""
"Darzog's Tower. The Skeleton Key turns, and the door that has been sealed since Crodo vanished swings in on cold air. Artemus was right about the Baron: somewhere above, Crodo still lives. And the air itself is wrong. Every spell you reach for dies before it is shaped. Here you fight with steel. The stairs climb the west and east halls in turn; the Baron keeps the top floor."
msgstr "达佐格之塔。万能钥匙转动，自从克罗多失踪就封着的门在冷风中向里打开。阿尔忒弥斯对男爵的判断没错：上面某处，克罗多还活着。而且空气本身不对劲。你伸手去抓的每个法术，在成形之前就消失了。在这里你们得用钢铁战斗。楼梯依次盘绕着西厅和东厅向上；男爵占据着顶层。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5930
msgid ""
"Crodo the Overseer, thin and grey, gets up from his stool. \"Thank you for rescuing me from Darzog's clutches. I didn't know that someone else had received my message. Listen. The man at the King's side is not Prince Roland. I struck him with Dancing Blades and saw what he is: Lord Xeen, an undead general who serves a greater master. Xeen's hideout is just above us in the clouds. You will need the sword the adventurers were working on in the dungeon of Newcastle to defeat Lord Xeen. Ask Artemus for leave to dig it out. The vault's word is 'laboratory'. You must make haste. Xeen plans to summon an army from the Darkside to conquer our world.\" Darzog's ward still holds him, but it is fading. He has strength for one small spell, and he spends it on going home. He touches your hand, says a word, and is gone."
msgstr "监工克罗多，又瘦又灰，从凳子上站了起来。“谢谢你们把我从达佐格的魔爪里救出来。我不知道还有别人收到了我的信息。听着。国王身边的那个人不是罗兰王子。我用舞动之刃击中了他，看出了他是什么：辛恩领主，一个侍奉更大主人的亡灵将军。辛恩的藏身处就在我们上方的云里。你们需要冒险者们在纽卡斯尔地牢里一直在制作的那把剑，才能击败辛恩领主。去向阿尔忒弥斯请求许可，把它挖出来。金库的口令是‘laboratory’。你们必须抓紧。辛恩计划从暗面召来一支军队征服我们的世界。”达佐格的封印仍困着他，但它正在消退。他还有力气施一个小法术，他把它用在了回家上。他碰了碰你们的手，说了一个词，就消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5937
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog falls. In the Well, a black grille rises from his disc's landing. His ward on your spells stays: it is in the stones."
msgstr "达佐格男爵倒下了。在水井里，一道黑色的栅栏从他那块盘的落点升起。他对你们法术施加的封印仍在：它在石头里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5956
msgid ""
"On a rack of tools nobody remembers how to use: a long blade with no shine at all. The tag on its hilt reads XEEN SLAYER. EXPERIMENTAL. DO NOT DROP."
msgstr "在一排没人记得怎么用的工具上：一把毫无光泽的长刃。剑柄上的标签写着：辛恩屠戮者。试验品。切勿掉落。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5962
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 2: bo"
msgstr "刻在石头上：2：bo"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5968
msgid "Scratched into the stone, in a hurried hand: 1: la"
msgstr "匆忙潦草地刻在石头上：1：la"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5974
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 3: ra"
msgstr "刻在石头上：3：ra"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5980
msgid ""
"Scratched into the stone: 5: ry. Someone did not trust his own memory."
msgstr "刻在石头上：5：ry。有人不信任自己的记性。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5986
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 4: to"
msgstr "刻在石头上：4：to"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5995
msgid "The humming stops. The vault door slides into the wall."
msgstr "嗡嗡声停了。金库的门滑进墙里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6001
msgid ""
"Carved over the gate: NEVER UNDERESTIMATE THE POWER OF POSITIVE THINKING. Under it, smaller: Answer gladly and the way opens."
msgstr "大门上方刻着：永远不要低估积极思考的力量。下面是更小的字：高兴地回答，路就会打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6014
msgid ""
"Sixty-four, fifty-two, thirty-one. The safe opens on four Energy Disks in a velvet tray."
msgstr "六十四，五十二，三十一。保险箱打开，天鹅绒托盘里放着四块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6020
msgid "\"Will you find what you came for?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr "“你会找到你来找的东西吗？”（是 / 否）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6026
msgid "\"Is the glass half full?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr "“杯子是半满的吗？”（是 / 否）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6032
msgid "\"Will tomorrow be better than today?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr "“明天会比今天好吗？”（是 / 否）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6038
msgid "\"Are your friends glad you came?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr "“你的朋友为你来了而高兴吗？”（是 / 否）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6044
msgid "\"Is the Songbird waiting for you?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr "“夜莺在等你吗？”（是 / 否）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6050
msgid "The gate swings open, cheerfully."
msgstr "大门欢快地打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6056
msgid "The gate sighs, and stays shut. So does your mood."
msgstr "大门叹了口气，依然紧闭。你们的心情也一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6062
msgid ""
"The two iron-bound leaves groan apart. Nobody has oiled them in years; nobody has wanted to."
msgstr "两扇铁箍门扇吱呀着分开。多年没人给它们上过油；也没人想上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6076
msgid ""
"A small grey bird hops out of the cage onto your hand and sings. For a moment nobody in the party can remember what they were worried about."
msgstr "一只灰色的小鸟从笼子里跳到你的手上，唱起歌来。有那么一刻，队伍里没人记得自己在担心什么。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6083 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6095
msgid "Refreshing."
msgstr "神清气爽。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6088
msgid ""
"Soul Waters. Refreshing. The souls of adventurers past go down easily; one of them knew a trick or two. (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr "灵魂之水。清爽。往昔冒险者的灵魂顺着喉咙下去很容易；其中一个懂点门道。（+1,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6100
msgid ""
"Minotaur's Private Reserve. Soul Waters. Refreshing. These souls were the minotaurs' own favourites, and they share. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr "牛头人私藏珍酿。灵魂之水。清爽。这些灵魂是牛头人自己的最爱，而且他们愿意分享。（+2,000 经验）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6106
msgid "Bats boil out of the towers and beat you out of the sky."
msgstr "蝙蝠从塔里涌出来，把你们从天上打了下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6112
msgid ""
"Iron, black, and no handle on this side. Castle Blackfang does not take visitors on foot."
msgstr "黑铁，这一侧没有把手。布莱克方城堡不接待步行的访客。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6126
msgid ""
"The griffin drops you on Castle Blackfang's walls. Ambrose sets it down beside you and waits."
msgstr "狮鹫把你们放在布莱克方城堡的城墙上。安布罗斯把它停在你们身边等候。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6133
msgid ""
"The griffin lifts you over the walls and sets you down on the battlements."
msgstr "狮鹫载着你们飞过城墙，把你们放在垛口上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6140
msgid "Somewhere far off, glass hums. Across the Darkside, the mirrors wake."
msgstr "远处某处，玻璃在嗡鸣。整个暗面的镜子都醒了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6148
msgid ""
"At nightfall Ambrose's griffin lands in the courtyard. The Queen rides in front, the party behind, and nobody looks down."
msgstr "黄昏时，安布罗斯的狮鹫降落在庭院里。女王骑在前面，队伍在后面，没有人往下看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6156
msgid ""
"Count Blackfang falls, and every coffin lid in the castle slams shut at once. The stair to the dungeon grinds open."
msgstr "布莱克方伯爵倒下了，城堡里所有的棺材盖同时砰地合上。通往地牢的楼梯隆隆打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6170
msgid ""
"The safe opens on the Queen's crown, black iron set with a single pale stone."
msgstr "保险箱打开，里面是女王的王冠，黑铁镶着一颗苍白的宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6185
msgid ""
"The griffin drops off the wall, skims the lake and sets you down on the shore below the castle."
msgstr "狮鹫从城墙上俯冲下来，掠过湖面，把你们放在城堡下方的岸边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6191
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang's battlements. Coffins stand in rows along the wall walk, lids ajar, like beds left unmade. The way down is through the Count."
msgstr "布莱克方城堡的垛口。棺材沿着城墙走道一排排摆着，盖子半开，像没叠的床。下去的路要经过伯爵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6200
msgid ""
"The last cell. A woman in a court gown sits on the stone bench with her back to the bars. \"Not too close,\" she says, without turning round."
msgstr "最后一间牢房。一个穿宫廷长裙的女人坐在石凳上，背对着栏杆。“别靠太近，”她头也不回地说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6220
msgid ""
"As you approach the Brew of Pure Power, the Dragon Pharaoh says, \"Get away from that! You'll hurt yourself!\""
msgstr "当你们走近纯粹力量酿，龙法老说：“离那东西远点！你们会伤着自己的！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6227
msgid "You drink. The Brew of Pure Power drinks back. He did warn you."
msgstr "你们喝了。纯粹力量酿反过来喝了你们。他确实警告过你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6240
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Built during the Creation, the Royal Dragon Pyramid has stood the test of time. Visitors have been flocking to see the great monument since it was opened to the public 312 years ago. There is much to see and explore in the Pyramid, so be sure to check the information desk for the latest tour information. And don't forget to stop at the Royal bookstore for (crackle... hissssss) Built during the Creation...\""
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：“皇家龙金字塔建于创世之时，经受住了时间的考验。自 312 年前向公众开放以来，游客纷纷前来参观这座伟大的纪念碑。金字塔里有很多值得观看和探索的地方，所以请务必去服务台查看最新的游览信息。还别忘了去皇家书店——（噼啪……嘶嘶嘶）建于创世之时……”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6255
msgid ""
"Every pad in this hall takes you somewhere. Few of them take you anywhere useful."
msgstr "这个大厅里的每块踏板都能带你去某个地方。很少有哪块带你去有用的地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6262
msgid ""
"Correct! Somewhere behind the Overseer's office, a heavy bolt slides back."
msgstr "正确！监工办公室后面，一道沉重的门闩滑开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6268
msgid ""
"A note on the Overseer's desk: \"For the new staff. The niches, in order: three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten. Every year I forget. -- the Overseer\""
msgstr "监工桌上的字条：“给新员工。壁龛的顺序：三、四、五、六、七、八、九、十。我每年都忘。——监工”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6274
msgid ""
"A map of the pads, pinned to the wall and forgotten: the Overseer's. Sun, eye, scarab: dead ends. The bird, then the second bird."
msgstr "一张踏板地图，钉在墙上被遗忘了：是监工的。太阳、眼睛、圣甲虫：死路。鸟，然后是第二只鸟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6283
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for a single page in the middle that reads: Prime Directive: Obey the Ancients. Secondary Directive: Protect Xeen. Tertiary Directive: Complete the Destiny of Xeen."
msgstr "这本书是空白的，只有中间一页写着：首要指令：服从远古者。次要指令：保护辛恩。第三指令：完成辛恩的命运。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6291
msgid ""
"The lock chimes a short, smug tune, and the door to the maze slides open."
msgstr "锁发出一小段得意的曲子，通往迷宫的门滑开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6297
msgid ""
"A brass plaque: REGISTRY NCC-1701. Below, in a different hand: the lock wants the number, not the letters."
msgstr "一块黄铜牌：注册号 NCC-1701。下面是另一个人的笔迹：锁要的是数字，不是字母。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6303
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Enter the eight numbers to pass the test. They are in a row, so do your best.\""
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：“输入这八个数字才能通过考验。它们在一行里，所以尽力吧。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6309
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"They total fifty-two, the rest is up to you.\""
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：“它们加起来是五十二，其余的靠你们自己。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6317
msgid "The last tumbler drops. The wall safe swings open."
msgstr "最后一个锁簧落下。墙里的保险箱打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6330
msgid ""
"A tapestry of the Dragon Pharaoh among the stars. Woven into its border, over and over: twenty, left; thirty, right; one, left."
msgstr "一幅龙法老在群星中的挂毯。在它的边缘一遍又一遍地织着：二十，左；三十，右；一，左。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6336
msgid ""
"Light all four, and the way is open. Light fewer, and stay where you are."
msgstr "把四支都点亮，路就开了。点得少了，就留在原地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6342
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Don't forget to light four torches before trying the stairs.\""
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：“上楼梯之前，别忘了点亮四支火把。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6350
msgid "The fourth torch catches, and the stair door rumbles open."
msgstr "第四支火把点着了，楼梯门隆隆打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6356
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Welcome to the Royal Pyramid! The Dragon Pharoah is currently indisposed, but a staff member will be with you shortly to discuss whatever business you have that relates to him. Please, have a seat.\""
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：“欢迎来到皇家金字塔！龙法老目前不方便，但工作人员很快会来和您商谈与他有关的任何事务。请坐。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6363 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:60 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:65
msgid "The strange alien device seems to be dormant."
msgstr "这个奇怪的外星装置似乎处于休眠状态。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6369
msgid ""
"Strange energy device. It hums, and holds you a moment too long. Your statistics have all been raised by one, but your age has also increased by five years."
msgstr "奇怪的能量装置。它嗡嗡作响，把你们困住了稍长一点的时间。你们的所有属性都提高了一点，但年龄也增加了五岁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6375
msgid "The bridge door is sealed. No power."
msgstr "舰桥的门封着。没有电力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6381
msgid ""
"The console's screen reads, in plain words: TO RELEASE STASIS, ANSWER THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO WHERE NO MAN HAS GONE BEFORE. Beneath: COMPLETE THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO..."
msgstr "控制台的屏幕上用明白的字写着：要解除停滞，请回答这句话：TO BOLDLY GO WHERE NO MAN HAS GONE BEFORE。下面：请补全这句话：TO BOLDLY GO..."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6387
msgid ""
"LOG. Pursuit of renegade guardian SHELTEM. Target crossed into the X.E.E.N. project. Collision imminent. Entering stasis."
msgstr "日志。追捕叛变的守护者 SHELTEM。目标已进入 X.E.E.N. 计划区域。碰撞迫在眉睫。进入停滞状态。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6393
msgid ""
"LOG. Second pod landed safely. This pod: lava. Stasis holding. Waiting for a reply to the phrase."
msgstr "日志。第二个舱安全着陆。本舱：熔岩。停滞保持中。等待对那句话的回答。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6399
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 1 of 5. Logs 1 to 4: Course set for the Terra project. Objective: deactivate and retrieve the damaged S.H.E.L.T.E.M. unit. Subject retrieved. Then: S.H.E.L.T.E.M. unit escaped; 3.8 years spent in stasis in the ship's brig. Activating the full C.O.R.A.K. personality module. Beginning the search."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 1 条，共 5 条。日志 1 至 4：航线已设定，前往泰拉计划。目标：停用并回收受损的 S.H.E.L.T.E.M. 单元。对象已回收。然后：S.H.E.L.T.E.M. 单元逃脱；在飞船禁闭室里停滞了 3.8 年。激活完整的 C.O.R.A.K. 人格模块。开始搜索。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6405
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 2 of 5. Logs 5 to 7: Sheltem hides his tracks in the Wire. I face an advanced intelligence with no restraints and a will to survive. VARN 6 launched itself into the sun today on Sheltem's command: a hundred thousand lives in minutes. He must be stopped at any cost."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 2 条，共 5 条。日志 5 至 7：谢尔特姆在线网里隐藏行踪。我面对的是一个没有约束又有求生意志的高级智能。VARN 6 今天在谢尔特姆的命令下自己发射进了太阳：几分钟内十万条生命。必须不惜一切代价阻止他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6411
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 3 of 5. Logs 8 to 10: Sheltem was posing as King Alamar; his subjects said the king had acted strangely for four years. He fled to CRON, then back to Terra, where he ambushed me and left my memory core in stasis in a cave. Natives of CRON freed me, and saved CRON from his plan to fly it into the sun."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 3 条，共 5 条。日志 8 至 10：谢尔特姆冒充阿拉玛国王；他的臣民说国王四年来行为古怪。他逃往 CRON，又回到泰拉，在那里伏击了我，把我的记忆核心留在一个洞穴里停滞。CRON 的土著解救了我，并从他把 CRON 开进太阳的计划中拯救了 CRON。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6417
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 4 of 5. Logs 11 to 13: Terra again. Four VARNs have landed, and Sheltem assimilates them, harshly and too fast. He lives in the original seedship, under the sea; its matter transfer sites on the surface are disguised as pyramids. Through the Wire I am inside. I will have to defeat him myself."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 4 条，共 5 条。日志 11 至 13：又回到泰拉。四艘 VARN 已降落，谢尔特姆粗暴而过快地同化它们。他住在海下的原始播种船里；它在地表的物质传输点伪装成金字塔。通过线网，我进入了其中。我得自己击败他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6423
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 5 of 5. Logs 14 and 15: Sheltem escaped in a pod toward the X.E.E.N. project; I follow in another, seconds behind, unarmed. Terrans launched the seedship after us; I told them how to use its matter transfer device. Xeen approaches. Engaging stasis. May the Gods smile upon me."
msgstr "日志计算机。第 5 条，共 5 条。日志 14 和 15：谢尔特姆乘一个舱逃向 X.E.E.N. 计划；我乘另一个舱紧跟在后，只差几秒，没有武装。泰拉人在我们之后发射了播种船；我告诉了他们如何使用它的物质传输装置。辛恩正在逼近。启动停滞。愿众神对我微笑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6431
msgid ""
"The lava round the hatch is black and cool. The hatch slides aside with a sigh, as if it had been waiting."
msgstr "舱口周围的熔岩已经变黑冷却。舱口带着一声叹息滑开，仿佛一直在等待。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6437
msgid ""
"Somewhere aft, machines wake. Lights come on one corridor at a time, and far forward a heavy door unseals."
msgstr "船尾某处，机器苏醒。灯光一条走廊一条走廊地亮起来，很远的前方，一道沉重的门解除了封锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6450
msgid ""
"The field flickers out. The tall figure inside it, in a guardian's armour, opens his eyes. \"Corak. I hunted Sheltem from Terra to here, and he has had centuries to prepare. If I step outside, he will feel me the moment I do. I need somewhere to hide that he cannot see into. The Ancients built such things: Soul Boxes. Find me one.\""
msgstr "力场闪烁着熄灭。里面那个身穿守护者盔甲的高大身影睁开了眼睛。“柯拉克。我从泰拉一路追捕谢尔特姆到这里，而他有几个世纪的时间做准备。我一踏出去，他立刻就会感觉到。我需要一个他看不进去的藏身之处。远古者造过这样的东西：灵魂盒。替我找一个来。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6456
msgid "The field hums. Nothing else happens."
msgstr "力场嗡嗡作响。什么也没发生。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6503
msgid ""
"The rope hangs straight and still in the tree's crown. This time, it seems, it will take you all the way up."
msgstr "绳子笔直而静止地挂在树冠里。这一次，它似乎会把你们一路带上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6511
msgid ""
"Welcome to Olympus. The clouds hold you up, which takes some getting used to. Somewhere up here is Soul Storage."
msgstr "欢迎来到奥林匹斯。云层托着你们，这需要一点时间适应。这上面某处是灵魂存放处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6529
msgid ""
"Soul Storage. Shelf after shelf, all empty but one. On it, a small box of dull metal that is somehow heavier to look at than to lift. The Soul Box."
msgstr "灵魂存放处。一排排架子，只有一个有东西，其余都空着。上面有一只暗淡金属的小盒子，看上去比拿起来更沉。灵魂盒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6535
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: If Pharaoh's realm should take a fall / The Dragon must put forth a call / Mystic orb to the wind is cast / Seeks the hand of heroes last / Four parts castle at five per stage / A score of disks to help the Mage"
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：若法老的王国陷落 / 巨龙必须发出召唤 / 神秘圆球被风抛向远方 / 最后寻求英雄之手 / 城堡四部分，每阶段五块 / 二十块盘去助法师。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6541
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: A Golden bird will sorrow ease / Sweet song will Knight's lost soul appease / Help the rider to soothe the beast / Gain a flight when expected least / The symbol of royal power / Frees the Queen from evil tower"
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：金色的鸟儿将抚慰忧伤 / 甜美的歌声平息骑士迷失的灵魂 / 帮助骑手安抚野兽 / 在最意想不到时获得飞行 / 王权的象征 / 将女王从邪恶之塔中解放。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6547
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon's orb the world shall roam / Yet must again return to home / Pharaoh's magic back in its place / Helps to free the visitor from space / Code's the key to thinking machines / Starman knows the truth about Xeen"
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：龙的圆球将在世界漫游 / 但必须再次返回家园 / 法老的魔法回到原位 / 助访客摆脱太空 / 代码是思考机器的钥匙 / 星际人知道辛恩的真相。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6553
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon once more will get you by / Owns key to city of the sky / Starman needs to hide in a box / Alamar's defenses outfox / Face to face in Alamar's lair / Out the box springs the land's last prayer"
msgstr "雕像底座的牌匾上写着：巨龙将再次助你一臂之力 / 拥有天空之城的钥匙 / 星际人需要藏进盒子 / 骗过阿拉玛的防御 / 在阿拉玛的巢穴里面对面 / 盒中跃出大地最后的祈祷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6561
msgid ""
"All beings have a true name. Alamar's true name, for instance, is Sheltem."
msgstr "所有生灵都有一个真名。例如，阿拉玛的真名是谢尔特姆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6572
msgid ""
"The Soul Box hums very faintly in your pack. Nothing in the castle seems to notice you. That is the point."
msgstr "灵魂盒在你的背包里极其微弱地嗡嗡作响。城堡里似乎没有任何东西注意到你们。这正是它的用处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6586
msgid ""
"Castle Alamar. Every window is lit, and every one of them is looking at you. Enter?"
msgstr "阿拉玛城堡。每扇窗都亮着灯，每一扇窗都在看着你们。进入吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6595 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6604 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6613
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6622
msgid "The Head goes dark. Somewhere above, a field dies."
msgstr "头颅暗了下去。上面某处，一道力场消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6629
msgid ""
"XEEN Power Juice. You have had yours, and your hands are still shaking."
msgstr "辛恩能量果汁。你已经喝过了，手还在发抖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6634
msgid ""
"XEEN Power Juice. It tastes of copper and lightning, and your arms feel like someone else's, someone stronger. (+2 Might, permanent)"
msgstr "辛恩能量果汁。有铜和闪电的味道，你的手臂像是别人的，更强壮的人的。（+2 力量，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6651
msgid ""
"The Soul Box hums very faintly in your pack. The castle below the hatch does not notice you come down. That is the point."
msgstr "灵魂盒在你的背包里极其微弱地嗡嗡作响。舱口下的城堡没有察觉你们下来。这正是它的用处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6668
msgid ""
"You throw the Soul Box to the ground. Corak steps out of it, taller than the room. \"Sheltem.\" \"Corak. You took your time.\" They close on each other, and the castle begins to shake itself apart. Corak's voice, from inside the light: \"The Cube! Take it and run!\" You run, with the Cube of Power, and behind you Castle Alamar folds into the ground."
msgstr "你们把灵魂盒扔到地上。柯拉克从里面走出来，高得顶到了房顶。“谢尔特姆。”“柯拉克。你可真慢。”两人扑向对方，城堡开始自行崩塌。光芒中传来柯拉克的声音：“魔方！拿着它快跑！”你们抱着能量魔方狂奔，身后的阿拉玛城堡塌进了地里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6684
msgid ""
"The time is right. The gate asks Alamar's true name. \"Sheltem,\" you say, and the gate says: Access approved!"
msgstr "时机到了。大门询问阿拉玛的真名。“谢尔特姆，”你们说，大门说：通过许可！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6690
msgid "Wrong! Access denied!"
msgstr "错误！拒绝通过！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6698 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6723 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6755
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6801
msgid ""
"Slick: Get outta my face! You've already won the prize. Go play one of the other games."
msgstr "滑头：离我远点！你已经赢过奖品了。去玩别的吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6706
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row, and you win! (Ten.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr "滑头：只要 10 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。快来快来。连续十次射中靶心就赢！（十环。）你赢得了奖品。现在滚吧，别再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6712
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row. (Seven.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr "滑头：只要 10 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。连续十次射中靶心。（七环。）哎呀！太可惜了。要不再试一次？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6715
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. The arrows are free. The gems are not."
msgstr "滑头：只要 10 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。箭是免费的，宝石可不是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6731
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you can stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes, you win! (You can.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr "滑头：只要 5 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。快来快来。要是你能在跑步机上撑过 2 分钟，就赢！（你撑住了。）你赢得了奖品。现在滚吧，别再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6737
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes. (You can't.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr "滑头：只要 5 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。在跑步机上撑过 2 分钟。（你撑不住。）哎呀！太可惜了。要不再试一次？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:674
msgid ""
"Joe swears he has the situation under control. He has sworn it for two years."
msgstr "乔发誓他把局面控制住了。他已经发誓两年了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6740
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Gems first, treadmill second."
msgstr "滑头：只要 5 颗宝石，就有机会赢娃娃。先给宝石，再上跑步机。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6764
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (DING.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr "滑头：只要 100 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。快来快来，用锤子敲响铃铛！（叮！）你赢得了奖品。现在滚吧，别再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:677
msgid ""
"Welcome to Vertigo. Sadly, most of the population has left because the town is infested with pests. A couple years ago I hired Joe the exterminator to rid the town of this menace, but the problem seems to be getting worse. Perhaps you could help."
msgstr "欢迎来到眩晕镇。可惜，镇上的大部分居民都走了，因为这里闹虫灾。几年前我雇了灭虫师乔来清除这个祸害，可问题似乎越来越严重了。也许你们能帮帮忙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6770
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (thunk.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr "滑头：只要 100 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。快来快来，用锤子敲响铃铛！（咚。）哎呀！太可惜了。要不再试一次？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6773
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. No gold, no hammer."
msgstr "滑头：只要 100 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。没金币，没锤子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6793
msgid ""
"Slick: I see that you have four dolls. A genuine Lord Xeen cupie doll, then. Now get lost, and don't come back."
msgstr "滑头：我看你有四个娃娃了。一个正宗的辛恩领主丘比娃娃，归你了。现在滚吧，别再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6809
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (You are.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr "滑头：只要 1000 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。快来快来。要是你比小妖精快，就赢！（你更快。）你赢得了奖品。现在滚吧，别再回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6815
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (The gremlin waves from the finish.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr "滑头：只要 1000 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。要是你比小妖精快，就赢。（小妖精在终点冲你挥手。）哎呀！太可惜了。要不再试一次？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6818
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. The gremlin doesn't race for free, and neither do you."
msgstr "滑头：只要 1000 金币，就有机会赢娃娃。小妖精不会白白陪你赛跑，你也别想白玩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6826
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Advisor will a dig permit / five coins more you must submit."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：顾问要有挖掘许可 / 你们须再交五枚钱币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6834
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Taxman becomes a faithful vassal / Xeen's bane lies under castle."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：税官成为忠实的家臣 / 辛恩的克星就在城堡之下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6842
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: In clouds above island tower / waits Lord Xeen his final hour."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：在岛塔上方的云中 / 辛恩领主等待着他的末日。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:685
msgid ""
"Thank you for cleaning up Vertigo and discovering Joe's treachery. Now it makes sense why the extermination of the pests was taking so long. I present you with the outstanding citizenship award and this treasure. Congratulations. Oh, one more thing. I have received a message from the dwarves who reside in the Red Dwarf Range. They have urgently requested help and promise great reward to whoever is brave enough to come. Apparently, their mines have been invaded by the Mad Dwarf Clan, preventing them from mining. Help them and report back."
msgstr "谢谢你们清理了眩晕镇，还揭穿了乔的背叛。现在我明白为什么灭虫拖了这么久了。我授予你们杰出市民奖和这份宝物。恭喜。哦，还有一件事。我收到了住在红矮人山脉的矮人们的消息。他们急求援助，并承诺重赏任何有胆前去的人。据说他们的矿井被疯矮人部落占领了，没法采矿。去帮帮他们，然后回来报告。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6850
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Only the sword Xeen's life can take / All his plans of war unmake."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：唯有能夺辛恩性命的剑 / 方能瓦解他的一切战争图谋。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6862
msgid ""
"Slick: Sure-Eye Tonic, two bottles. First round's on the house. Only the first."
msgstr "滑头：神眼补剂，两瓶。第一轮算我请。只有第一轮。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6870
msgid ""
"Castle Xeen. The walls hum with the generators somewhere inside, and the guard machines are already making more guards."
msgstr "辛恩城堡。墙壁在发电机的嗡鸣中震动，发电机就在里面某处，守卫机器正在制造更多的守卫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6878
msgid ""
"The last pylon goes dark, and the field across the crown stair collapses with a crackle."
msgstr "最后一座塔柱熄灭了，王冠阶梯上的力场噼啪一声崩塌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6887
msgid ""
"The air generator whines down to silence. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr "风系发电机呜咽着归于寂静。某处，一道屏障闪了闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6896
msgid "The earth generator grinds to a stop. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr "土系发电机嘎吱停转。某处，一道屏障闪了闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6905
msgid ""
"The fire generator coughs, roars, and goes out. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr "火系发电机咳嗽几声，轰鸣一阵，熄灭了。某处，一道屏障闪了闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6914
msgid ""
"The water generator drains with a long gurgle. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr "水系发电机咕嘟咕嘟地排空了水。某处，一道屏障闪了闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6923
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea what you have broken.\" Lord Xeen falls, and the face he wore at court, Prince Roland's, slides off him like wet paper."
msgstr "“你们不知道自己毁掉了什么。”辛恩领主倒下了，他在朝堂上戴的那张脸——罗兰王子的脸——像湿纸一样从他身上滑落。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6932
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen looks up from his throne and laughs. \"The King's little crusaders, all this way up. Kneel, and I may let you fall gently.\""
msgstr "辛恩领主从王座上抬起头，哈哈大笑。“国王的小十字军们，一路爬到这上面来了。跪下，我也许会让你们摔得轻一点。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6938
msgid ""
"The mirror is protected by some sort of force field that reeks of Lord Xeen's peculiar brand of magic. You are unable to use or touch it."
msgstr "镜子被某种力场保护着，散发着辛恩那独特魔法的气息。你们无法使用或触碰它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6946
msgid "Xeen's Pet lies still. Its cage door was never locked."
msgstr "辛恩的宠物一动不动地躺着。它的笼门从来就没锁过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6966
msgid ""
"You take the Scepter of Temporal Distortion from the throne. Behind it, the Sixth Mirror begins to sing."
msgstr "你们从王座上取走了时间扭曲权杖。在它身后，第六面镜子开始歌唱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6973
msgid ""
"The Scepter of Temporal Distortion lies across the arms of the throne. The whole castle seems to hold its breath. Take it?"
msgstr "时间扭曲权杖横放在王座的扶手上。整座城堡似乎都屏住了呼吸。要拿走它吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6979
msgid "Lord Xeen laughs. Only the Slayer Sword can touch him."
msgstr "辛恩领主哈哈大笑。只有屠戮者之剑能碰到他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6992
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. Somewhere far to the south, something answers it."
msgstr "反射器轻轻嗡鸣。遥远的南方，有什么东西在回应它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7005
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The snow on its housing slides off in one sheet."
msgstr "反射器轻轻嗡鸣。它外壳上的积雪整片滑落。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7018
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The heat of the mountain seems to lean towards it."
msgstr "反射器轻轻嗡鸣。山中的热气似乎向它倾斜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:703
msgid ""
"He...he (hic) breeeds (hicup) Breeeeeds them in the (hic) warehouse (hicup)"
msgstr "他……他（嗝）他繁殖（打嗝）繁殖它们，在（嗝）仓库里（打嗝）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7031
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The creek beside it runs backwards for a moment, then thinks better of it."
msgstr "反射器轻轻嗡鸣。旁边的小溪倒流了一会儿，又改了主意。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7038
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing roars like a gale. You step off."
msgstr "路在虚空中到了尽头。远远的下方，虚空像狂风一样怒吼。你们迈了出去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7045
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing is grey as stone. You step off."
msgstr "路在虚空中到了尽头。远远的下方，虚空灰得像石头。你们迈了出去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7052
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing glows like a forge. You step off."
msgstr "路在虚空中到了尽头。远远的下方，虚空像熔炉一样发光。你们迈了出去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7059
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing heaves like the sea. You step off."
msgstr "路在虚空中到了尽头。远远的下方，虚空像大海一样翻涌。你们迈了出去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7065
msgid "The sky says nothing. The road still ends in nothing."
msgstr "天空默不作声。路依然在虚空中到了尽头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7091
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Two: Awaken the Four Sleepers of Darkside."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：第二步：唤醒暗面的四位沉睡者。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7097
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Three: Bring together the Cube of Power and the Scepter of Temporal Distortion."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：第三步：把能量魔方和时间扭曲权杖合在一起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7103
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step One: When the time is right, activate the machines in the four corners of the other side of the world."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：第一步：时机到来时，启动世界另一面四个角落里的机器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7109
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Four: Travel to the shrine on the Cloud above Darkstone Tower."
msgstr "雕像底座的字条上写着：第四步：前往暗石塔之上云层中的神殿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7125
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr "风系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。格伦菲尔德力场发生器已启动，并报告信心 100%。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:712
msgid "Joe's gone. (hic) Good riddance. (hicup) Who's buying?"
msgstr "乔走了。（嗝）谢天谢地。（打嗝）谁请客？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7129
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr "风系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。等待格伦菲尔德力场启动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7132
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr "风系沉睡者：守护者没有通知我你们是天选者。尽管我很想，但我无法完全苏醒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7148
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr "土系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。格伦菲尔德力场发生器已启动，并报告信心 100%。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7152
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr "土系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。等待格伦菲尔德力场启动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7155
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr "土系沉睡者：守护者没有通知我你们是天选者。尽管我很想，但我无法完全苏醒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7171
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr "火系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。格伦菲尔德力场发生器已启动，并报告信心 100%。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7175
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr "火系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。等待格伦菲尔德力场启动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7178
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr "火系沉睡者：守护者没有通知我你们是天选者。尽管我很想，但我无法完全苏醒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7194
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr "水系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。格伦菲尔德力场发生器已启动，并报告信心 100%。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7198
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr "水系沉睡者：我已苏醒，信心 100%。等待格伦菲尔德力场启动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:720
msgid "Joe's key"
msgstr "乔的钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7201
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr "水系沉睡者：守护者没有通知我你们是天选者。尽管我很想，但我无法完全苏醒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7207
msgid "You accept the test of Air."
msgstr "你们接受了风之试炼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:721
msgid ""
"Joe keeps his warehouse key under the rain barrel in his yard. Everybody knows. Nobody looks."
msgstr "乔把仓库钥匙放在院子的雨水桶下面。人人都知道，没人去找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7243
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7257
msgid ""
"The last guardian falls back into the pit. The gate to the Sleeper's chamber grinds open."
msgstr "最后一个守卫跌回了坑里。通往沉睡者密室的大门嘎吱打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7221
msgid "You accept the test of Earth."
msgstr "你们接受了土之试炼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7235
msgid "You accept the test of Fire."
msgstr "你们接受了火之试炼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7249
msgid "You accept the test of Water."
msgstr "你们接受了水之试炼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:727
msgid "Pests"
msgstr "害虫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:728
msgid ""
"Two years ago, I came to this town on contract to control the vermin infestation. It has been a long, hard job, but I've just about got the situation under control."
msgstr "两年前，我受合同所托来到这个镇上控制虫害。这活儿又长又难，不过我差不多已经把局面控制住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7286
msgid ""
"In the chest, on a velvet cushion: a key of black stone, cold as the bottom of a well. Darkstone Tower's."
msgstr "箱子里的天鹅绒垫上：一把黑石钥匙，冷得像井底。暗石塔的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7294
msgid ""
"The stair under the ruin is sealed with Sheltem's mark. The Cube of Power hums, and the mark goes out."
msgstr "废墟下的楼梯被谢尔特姆的印记封住了。能量魔方嗡鸣一声，印记熄灭了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7302
msgid "You draw the bolt."
msgstr "你们拉开了门闩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7308
msgid "Bolted from the other side."
msgstr "从另一侧闩上了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:731
msgid "Warehouse"
msgstr "仓库"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7318
msgid "Far to the east, a wall grinds down into the floor."
msgstr "远处东边，一堵墙隆隆沉进地板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:732
msgid ""
"My warehouse? Strictly off limits. Dangerous chemicals. I don't even carry the key on me."
msgstr "我的仓库？严禁入内。危险化学品。钥匙我连带都不带在身上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7328
msgid "Far to the west, a wall grinds down into the floor."
msgstr "远处西边，一堵墙隆隆沉进地板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7334
msgid "The message on the plaque reads: Nine is the time."
msgstr "牌匾上的字写着：九点是时辰。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7340
msgid "Its light is out. Its twin stands outside the gate."
msgstr "它的光熄灭了。它的孪生兄弟立在门外。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7356
msgid ""
"The coffin's lid slides back and a man sits up, blinking. \"Allow me to introduce myself. I am Prince Roland, brother to King Burlock. I must thank you for freeing me from that stasis chamber Alamar put me in. Queen Kalindra and I are destined to marry on the cloud world above Darkstone Tower. You hold the key to the Tower, but you will need a key to open the way to the cloud world above it. That key can be found in the Southern Sphinx on the other side of the world. I have here the Amulet of the Southern Sphinx. Take it. I must return to my brother and prepare for the wedding.\""
msgstr "棺盖滑开，一个男人眨着眼坐了起来。“请容我自我介绍。我是罗兰王子，伯洛克国王的弟弟。谢谢你们把我从阿拉玛关我的停滞舱里放出来。卡琳德拉女王和我注定要在暗石塔上方的云界成婚。你们持有塔的钥匙，但还需要一把钥匙才能打开通往塔上云界的路。那把钥匙在世界另一面的南方狮身人面像里。我这里有南方狮身人面像的护身符，拿去吧。我得回到我哥哥身边，准备婚礼。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7364
msgid ""
"You climb down through smoke and rubble to the floor of what was Castle Alamar."
msgstr "你们穿过烟雾和瓦砾，爬到了曾经的阿拉玛城堡的地面上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:737
msgid ""
"The local dwarves have informed me of your great deed and have authorized me to present to you a rare honor: The Red Dwarf Badge of Courage. Congratulations."
msgstr "当地的矮人们告诉了我你们的伟大事迹，并授权我向你们颁发一项难得的荣誉：红矮人勇气徽章。恭喜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7373
msgid "The skull sees the Cube of Power and says, \"Access granted.\""
msgstr "头骨看见了能量魔方，说：“准许通行。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7383
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach: Not only is Alamar a wise and just ruler, Alamar is sporting, as well. Alamar graciously grants clever opponents a chance to defeat him by leaving hints and clues. But know this: Alamar takes pleasure in the failure of his opponents, especially when they come close to success. And you WILL fail."
msgstr "你们走近时，雕像开口了：阿拉玛不仅是睿智公正的统治者，还很有运动家风度。阿拉玛大方地留下提示和线索，给聪明的对手一个击败他的机会。但要知道：阿拉玛乐于见到对手失败，尤其是他们接近成功的时候。而你们必将失败。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7393
msgid ""
"The cauldron roars and boils over: green steam boils up the shaft! Get off the bridge!"
msgstr "大锅轰鸣着沸腾溢出：绿色的蒸汽顺着竖井往上翻涌！离开桥！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7400
msgid "The cage hangs open and empty."
msgstr "笼子敞开着，空空如也。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7407
msgid ""
"You touch the Alacorn to his ears: they shrink back, pink and round. He whoops and runs for home."
msgstr "你们把独角兽角碰到他的耳朵上：耳朵缩了回去，变回粉红圆润的样子。他欢呼一声，往家跑去了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7411
msgid ""
"'I'm not going home with goblin ears!' The boy will not budge. 'They say the witches' Alacorn cures anything. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr "“我才不要带着地精耳朵回家！”男孩死活不肯动。“他们说女巫的独角兽角什么都能治。它在顶上，大锅上面。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7415
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The boy steps out and stops: 'Not with these ears. Mum would die. The witches' Alacorn could cure them. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr "戒指转开了锁，笼子沿着链条哗啦啦升起。男孩走出来，停住了：“不行，顶着这对耳朵不行。妈妈会吓死的。女巫的独角兽角能治好它们。它在顶上，大锅上面。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7427
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A girl with a green tinge to her skin tumbles out and hugs you. 'I'm Rosebud. The door at the top of the north stair has a witch's face on it, and it only opens to the coven's key. They keep it in their stores in the herb loft, past the vats. Don't tell them I told you!' Then she is gone, running for Toad Meadow."
msgstr "戒指转开了锁，笼子沿着链条哗啦啦升起。一个皮肤泛绿的女孩滚了出来，抱住了你们。“我叫玫瑰蕾。北边楼梯顶上的门上有一张女巫的脸，只有用巫团的钥匙才能打开。他们把钥匙放在药草阁楼的储藏室里，过了大桶就是。别说是我告诉你们的！”然后她就不见了，跑向蟾蜍草地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7438
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A boy crawls out of the cage, wiping his nose. \"Thanks for getting me out of there,\" he says. \"I thought the witches were going to turn me into a goblin for sure. I want to go home.\" And he runs. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr "戒指转开了锁，笼子沿着链条哗啦啦升起。一个男孩从笼子里爬出来，擦着鼻子。“谢谢你们把我从那儿救出来，”他说。“我还以为女巫肯定要把我变成地精了。我想回家。”然后他跑了。瓦莉娅会听说这件事的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7449
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The child in the witches' bedchamber slips out and is gone down the stair. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr "戒指转开了锁，笼子沿着链条哗啦啦升起。女巫卧室里的孩子溜了出来，顺着楼梯跑掉了。瓦莉娅会听说这件事的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:747
msgid ""
"The dwarf mines are still being over-run. Please help them. The mine portal is in the hills north-west of town."
msgstr "矮人矿井仍在遭受侵占。请帮帮他们。矿井传送门在镇子西北的山丘上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7471
msgid ""
"Throne of Legends. It is a very good chair, and Picard would like it back."
msgstr "传奇王座。这是一把非常好的椅子，皮卡德想把它要回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7477
msgid "The strange runes read: \"Don't feed the dragons.\""
msgstr "奇怪的符文写着：“不要喂龙。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7486
msgid ""
"Among the jars of embalming fluid on the table stand two flasks of red draught, stoppered and still warm. The embalmers needed strong arms for the lids."
msgstr "桌上的防腐液罐子中间，立着两瓶红色药剂，封着塞子，还是温的。防腐师得有一双有力的手才拧得开盖子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7494
msgid "It was an illusion! An angry voice booms: \"No one steals from ME!\""
msgstr "这是幻象！一个愤怒的声音轰然响起：“没人能从我这里偷东西！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7506
msgid ""
"The mask's eyes glow and dim. Overhead, the blades draw up into their slots and stay there."
msgstr "面具的眼睛亮了一下又暗下去。头顶上，刀刃收回了槽里，不再出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7515
msgid "\"There's one born every minute.\""
msgstr "“每分钟都有一个傻瓜出生。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7521
msgid "\"Begone, then!\""
msgstr "“那就滚吧！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7533
msgid ""
"The mask's eyes glow and dim. Along the run, the blades swing slower, slower, and hang still."
msgstr "面具的眼睛亮了一下又暗下去。沿着通道，刀刃越摆越慢，最后悬着不动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7540
msgid "\"Correct, come on up!\""
msgstr "“正确，上来吧！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7546
msgid "\"Wrong.\""
msgstr "“错误。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:755
msgid ""
"The dwarves are digging again. You can hear their picks from the town wall, which is more than I asked for."
msgstr "矮人们又在挖矿了。从镇墙上就能听见他们的镐声，这可比我要求的还多。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7553
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"A\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“A”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7560
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"C\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“C”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7567
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"D\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“D”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7574
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"I\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“I”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7581
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"P\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“P”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7588
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"R\"."
msgstr "这些奇怪的文字似乎在讲授字母“R”的一课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7595
msgid ""
"The lessons you have studied, in the order of the halls: P, I, C, A, R, D."
msgstr "你们学过的课，按大厅的顺序：P、I、C、A、R、D。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7603
msgid ""
"The Sphinx's stone eyes find Roland's amulet. Its jaw opens on a stair."
msgstr "狮身人面像的石眼找到了罗兰的护身符。它的下颚张开，露出一道楼梯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7611
msgid ""
"The door at the top of the stair opens on a room full of books, and an old man in a very good chair."
msgstr "楼梯顶上的门通向一间堆满书的屋子，里面有个老人坐在一把非常舒服的椅子上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7617
msgid "The strange runes read: \"Study the lessons to learn my name.\""
msgstr "奇怪的符文写着：“研习这些课，学会我的名字。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7623
msgid "A voice booms: \"No Sound No Ground!\""
msgstr "一个声音轰然响起：“No Sound No Ground！”（无声无地！）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7629
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: NEW WORLD THANKS YOU FOR PLAYING MIGHT AND MAGIC"
msgstr "竖着读四块牌匾，上面写着：NEW WORLD THANKS YOU FOR PLAYING MIGHT AND MAGIC"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7635
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: SO ENDS THE SAGA OF CORAK AND SHELTEM!"
msgstr "竖着读四块牌匾，上面写着：SO ENDS THE SAGA OF CORAK AND SHELTEM!"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7641
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: 1994 BEGINS THE NEXT MIGHT AND MAGIC SAGA!"
msgstr "竖着读四块牌匾，上面写着：1994 BEGINS THE NEXT MIGHT AND MAGIC SAGA!"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7648
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four heads say: TYPE \"COMPUTER\" ON LEVEL 4 OF THE DUNGEON OF DEATH. SEE YA SOON!"
msgstr "竖着读四个头颅，上面写着：TYPE \"COMPUTER\" ON LEVEL 4 OF THE DUNGEON OF DEATH. SEE YA SOON!"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:765
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the witches and for that I am grateful. For your gallant deeds, I dub thee all Crusaders! Now I must take the Alacorn, for if I can find Falista, I believe the healing power of the Alacorn is strong enough to resurrect her."
msgstr "你们消灭了女巫，我对此十分感激。为了表彰你们的英勇事迹，我封你们全体为十字军！现在我得带走独角兽角，因为要是我能找到法莉丝塔，我相信独角兽角的治愈之力足以让她复活。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7667
msgid ""
"You strike the Chime of Opening. The note goes on long after it should have stopped, and something you could not see cracks across like ice. The seal has been broken."
msgstr "你们敲响了开启之钟。钟声久久不息，远超它该停的时候，有什么看不见的东西像冰一样裂开了。封印已被打破。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7675
msgid "The black key turns without a sound. So does the door."
msgstr "黑钥匙无声地转动。门也一样。"

