#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:777
msgid ""
"The Alacorn! But the Head Witch still lives, and she will come for it. Finish what you started."
msgstr "独角兽角！但是女巫头目还活着，她会来夺回它的。把你们开始的事做完。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:781
msgid "I am waiting for you to destroy the witches and return the Alacorn."
msgstr "我在等你们消灭女巫，并把独角兽角送回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7831
msgid ""
"You dig where the seven words said. An iron box lies under the sand, left for a Sphinx that never came for it."
msgstr "你们照着那七个词所说的地方挖掘。沙子下面躺着一只铁箱，是留给一个再也没来取它的狮身人面像的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:784
msgid ""
"I am just an old woman but before I die I wish to see the witches of Toad Meadow destroyed. You see, when I was still a young maiden, I fell asleep in Toad Meadow. When I awoke I found a unicorn laying down beside me. Her name was Falista and she was fleeing from a band of witches who were trying to capture her. Since that day I have kept Falista safely hidden. But now she has disappeared. I fear the worst has happened and the witches have killed her for her Alacorn's magic. The witches fear nothing, and lock nothing. Their tower stands south-east of the meadow. Go quickly."
msgstr "我只是个老太婆，但在死之前，我希望看到蟾蜍草地的女巫们被消灭。你们看，我还是少女的时候，在蟾蜍草地睡着了。醒来时发现身边躺着一只独角兽。她叫法莉丝塔，当时正在逃避一群想抓住她的女巫。从那天起，我一直把法莉丝塔安全地藏着。可现在她不见了。我担心最坏的事发生了，女巫们为了独角兽角的魔力杀了她。女巫什么都不怕，什么都不锁。她们的塔在草地东南方。快去吧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7840
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of six words: DIG."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第一个：DIG。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7849
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of six words: BENEATH."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第二个：BENEATH。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7858
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of six words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第三个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7867
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of six words: BROKEN."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第四个：BROKEN。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7876
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of six words: TRAVEL."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第五个：TRAVEL。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7885
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of six words: PYRAMID."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的最后一个：PYRAMID。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7899
msgid ""
"You dig beneath the broken pyramid's capstone. A chest of old Darkside coin waits there, dry as the day it was buried."
msgstr "你们在残破金字塔的顶石下挖掘。那里有一箱暗面的旧钱币，干燥得像是埋下的那天一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7908
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of seven words: SEEK."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第一个：SEEK。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:791
msgid "Falista"
msgstr "法莉丝塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7917
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of seven words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第二个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7926
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of seven words: HOARD."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第三个：HOARD。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:793
msgid ""
"Falista grazes behind my cottage again, Crusaders. She eats the roses. I let her."
msgstr "法莉丝塔又在我小屋后面吃草了，十字军们。她吃玫瑰。我由着她。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7935
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of seven words: BURIED."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第四个：BURIED。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7944
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of seven words: FOR."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第五个：FOR。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7953
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the sixth of seven words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第六个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7962
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of seven words: SPHINX."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的最后一个：SPHINX。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7968
msgid ""
"The balloonist's logbook, last entry: Wind fair. Balloon fairer. Balloon gone."
msgstr "热气球驾驶员的日志，最后一条：风顺。气球更顺。气球没了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7975
msgid "The bell tolls under the waves. Nobody comes."
msgstr "钟在波浪下鸣响。没有人来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7980
msgid ""
"The bell tolls under the waves. Something green rattles in its mouth: an emerald."
msgstr "钟在波浪下鸣响。它的口中有什么绿色的东西在哗啦作响：一颗祖母绿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7987
msgid "Lightning has struck here. Often."
msgstr "这里遭过雷击。很多次。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7992
msgid ""
"Lightning has struck here. Often. In the fused glass, a blue stone has set like a fly in amber."
msgstr "这里遭过雷击。很多次。在熔成一团的玻璃里，一颗蓝色的石头像琥珀里的苍蝇一样凝固着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7998
msgid "A note by the burnt bedroll: Day 3. The boots work. The feet do not."
msgstr "烧焦的铺盖卷旁有张字条：第三天。靴子管用。脚不管用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8005
msgid "You shout into the stone. The plane answers, slowly."
msgstr "你们对着石头大喊。位面缓缓地回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:801
msgid "Children"
msgstr "孩子们"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8010
msgid ""
"You shout into the stone. The plane answers, slowly, and something rolls out of the hollow: a sapphire."
msgstr "你们对着石头大喊。位面缓缓地回应，有什么东西从凹洞里滚了出来：一颗蓝宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8017
msgid "The fire is cool and refreshing. Nothing more happens."
msgstr "火焰清凉爽快。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8023
msgid "The fire is cool and refreshing. (+20 Fire resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "火焰清凉爽快。（休息之前 +20 火系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:803
msgid ""
"Every child is home. Their mothers have stopped crying. Their fathers have started."
msgstr "每个孩子都回家了。他们的母亲不再哭了。他们的父亲开始哭了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8030
msgid "The stone is warm. That is all, today."
msgstr "石头是温的。今天也就这样了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8036
msgid "The stone is warm. (+20 Earth resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "石头是温的。（休息之前 +20 土系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8042
msgid "A slate propped on the half-cut block: Nearly done. Back after lunch."
msgstr "半截石块上靠着一块石板：快做完了。午饭后回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8048
msgid ""
"The ship's log: Day 40. Still no land. Day 41. Found land. It was this."
msgstr "船上日志：第 40 天。仍然没有陆地。第 41 天。发现了陆地。就是这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8057
msgid "Rocks fall from above!"
msgstr "头顶落下了岩石！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8064
msgid "The stones are silent. They sang today already."
msgstr "石头们沉默着。它们今天已经唱过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:807
msgid ""
"All four of them home, and not one of them a goblin! Take this. It is not much, but it is all the meadow could gather."
msgstr "四个孩子都回家了，一个都没变成地精！拿着这个。不算多，但这是草地上能凑出来的全部了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8071
msgid ""
"The stones sing. You feel lighter. (+20 Air resistance and +10 Speed until you rest)"
msgstr "石头们唱起歌来。你们觉得身子轻了。（休息之前 +20 风系抗性、+10 速度）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8078
msgid "The spire hums. Nothing else happens."
msgstr "尖塔嗡嗡作响。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8083
msgid ""
"The spire hums, and a shard of red crystal drops from the seam: a ruby."
msgstr "尖塔嗡嗡作响，一片红色水晶碎片从缝隙里掉下来：一颗红宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8091
msgid "Lightning strikes from a clear sky!"
msgstr "晴空降下了雷击！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8098
msgid "The water is cool and refreshing. Nothing more happens."
msgstr "水清凉爽快。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8104
msgid ""
"The water is cool and refreshing. For once, it is true. (+20 Water resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "水清凉爽快。这一次，名副其实。（休息之前 +20 水系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8112
msgid "A vent flares!"
msgstr "一个喷口喷发了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:812
msgid ""
"The witches catch children and turn them into goblins. They keep the ones they haven't turned yet in cages in the tower. Bring them home if you can."
msgstr "女巫抓孩子，把他们变成地精。她们把还没变的关在塔里的笼子里。能的话，把他们送回家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8120
msgid "A freezing wave breaks over you!"
msgstr "一道冰冷的浪头拍在你们身上！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8132
msgid ""
"Among the gargoyles' shiny things: a jewelled scarab, and a tag on a string: \"Deliver to Asp: one scarab.\""
msgstr "在石像鬼们亮闪闪的东西中间：一只镶宝石的圣甲虫，还有一张系着绳子的标签：“送往毒蛇镇：圣甲虫一只。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8146
msgid ""
"In the housing, still warm: a cluster of blue crystals that crackle when you touch them. Falagar's, no doubt."
msgstr "在外壳里，还是温的：一簇蓝色水晶，一碰就噼啪作响。毫无疑问是法拉加的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:504
msgid "Medin rows you across to the island."
msgstr "梅丁划船把你们送到了岛上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8181
msgid ""
"Medin's boat is tied up. \"Not while those beasts circle the island,\" says Medin."
msgstr "梅丁的船拴着。“野兽还在岛周围打转，我不去，”梅丁说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8196
msgid ""
"You burn everything you can, and what you cannot burn you throw outside. The warren fills with smoke, and the trolls that are left will not come back to it."
msgstr "你们把能烧的都烧了，烧不了的扔到外面。巢穴里烟雾弥漫，剩下的巨魔不会再回来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:820
msgid "The Sixth Mirror. In pieces. It is a pity about the mirror, though."
msgstr "第六面镜子。碎成了片。镜子碎了，真是可惜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8204
msgid "You destroy the outpost. Glom will be pleased."
msgstr "你们摧毁了前哨站。格洛姆会很高兴的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8217
msgid ""
"A hollow full of blue speckled sprite eggs, and among them a slim wand of white wood: Danulf's Wand of Faery Magic."
msgstr "一个洞里满是蓝色斑点的小精灵蛋，蛋中间有一根纤细的白木法杖：达努尔夫的精灵魔法杖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8229
msgid ""
"In the torn pack, under the snow: a book bound in white leather. Tito's Holy Book."
msgstr "在撕破的背包里，雪下面：一本白皮革装订的书。蒂托的圣书。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:825
msgid "NO MIRROR?!? Get out of my sight!"
msgstr "没有镜子？！滚出我的视线！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8251
msgid ""
"Under a heap of curse dolls and unpaid bills: a pendant on a silver chain, humming faintly."
msgstr "在一堆诅咒娃娃和未付的账单下面：一条银链上的吊坠，发出微弱的嗡鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8265
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Disease."
msgstr "雕像的石手张开了。手中躺着一本书：治疗疾病。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8279
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Poison."
msgstr "雕像的石手张开了。手中躺着一本书：解毒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:829
msgid ""
"Ah, more adventurers! I charge you with the quest of finding the Sixth Mirror. My sources tell me that the mirror was last seen near the great volcano. Go forth, now, and bring it to me. I will reward the one who returns it to me with an Earldom."
msgstr "啊，又有冒险者来了！我委托你们去寻找第六面镜子。据我的消息来源，这面镜子最后一次出现在大火山附近。现在就去，把它带给我。谁把它还给我，我就赐他伯爵爵位。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8290
msgid "Half buried in the creek mud: a whistle carved from bone."
msgstr "半埋在小溪的泥里：一只用骨头雕成的哨子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8301
msgid "You have found a Phirna plant. Ok, you dug it up."
msgstr "你们找到了一株菲尔娜植物。好吧，你们把它挖出来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8313
msgid ""
"Celia opens the door with flour on her hands. \"It's you! Derek, look who it is!\""
msgstr "西莉亚手上沾着面粉开了门。“是你们！德里克，快看是谁来了！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8330
msgid ""
"The ogres' lair, in the river bluff. Boulders stacked by the cliff edge, and a smell of cooking you would rather not ask about."
msgstr "食人魔的巢穴，在河边的崖壁上。崖边堆着巨石，还有一股你们不想多问的烹饪味道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8339
msgid "You break everything you can find in the lair."
msgstr "你们把巢穴里能找到的东西都砸了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8348
msgid ""
"You knock the cross-beam out of the rack, and the whole heap of boulders goes thundering over the cliff into the river. That is the end of the ogres' ammunition."
msgstr "你们把横梁从架子里打掉，整堆巨石轰隆隆滚下悬崖掉进河里。食人魔的弹药就这样没了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:835
msgid "Earldom"
msgstr "伯爵爵位"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:836
msgid ""
"An Earldom. Land, a title, a seat at my table. Newcastle's ruins are for sale, I hear, if you can't wait. Ebenezer will sell you anything."
msgstr "伯爵爵位。土地、头衔，还有我桌边的一个座位。听说纽卡斯尔的废墟在出售，要是你等不及的话。埃比尼泽什么都肯卖给你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8362
msgid ""
"Two paces north of the cairn, a strongbox. The map was honest. The ink runs in the damp and the map comes apart in your hands, its work done."
msgstr "在石堆往北两步处，有一只保险箱。地图没骗人。墨迹在潮气中化开，地图在你们手里散了架，使命已完成。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8368
msgid "MAPS BY JOE! Genuine! Only one of its kind!"
msgstr "乔牌地图！正宗！独一无二！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8387
msgid ""
"Pinned under the strongbox, a slip from the Dragon Tax Office: \"Paid in full. Receipt no. 4,118. Valid for one entry.\" He had paid. He had also, it seems, argued."
msgstr "保险箱下压着一张龙税务局的单据：“已全额缴清。收据编号 4,118。限入场一次。”他确实缴了税，看来还争论过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8402
msgid ""
"The Art of Taxation, by Scaldrith. \"Chapter One: Everyone pays. Chapter Two: See Chapter One.\""
msgstr "《税收的艺术》，斯卡尔德里斯著。“第一章：人人纳税。第二章：见第一章。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8409
msgid "The urn is empty and powerless."
msgstr "瓮是空的，没有任何力量。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8412
msgid ""
"A brass urn on the counter, lettered DRAGON TAX. It is empty, and it looks hungry. The collector is behind the office door."
msgstr "柜台上放着一只黄铜瓮，刻着“龙税”。它是空的，看上去很饿。收税官在办公室门后面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4297 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4753 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:842
msgid "The mirror"
msgstr "镜子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8425
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 1: Worms. \"A dragon begins as a worm and ends as a wyrm. The difference is a Y and about nine hundred years.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第一卷：蠕虫。“龙始于蠕虫，终于巨蟒。区别是一个字母 Y，外加大约九百年。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:843
msgid ""
"My brother has wanted the Sixth Mirror since before I left. Find it, and he may even smile. I have not seen it myself."
msgstr "我哥哥从我离开之前就一直想要第六面镜子。找到它，他说不定会笑一笑。我自己没见过它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8438
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 2: Lizards. \"A lizard is a dragon that has given up. Do not tell it so.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第二卷：蜥蜴。“蜥蜴就是放弃了的龙。别告诉它。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8451
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 3: Serpents. \"No legs, no wings, and no patience for reading. They will not have got this far.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第三卷：巨蛇。“没有腿，没有翅膀，也没耐心读书。它们走不到这里来。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8464
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 4: Drakes. \"A drake is a dragon that has not yet been taxed.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第四卷：幼龙。“幼龙就是还没被收过税的龙。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8477
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 5: Dragons. \"There is only one. All the others are practice.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第五卷：龙。“只有一条龙。其余的都是练习。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8484
msgid "Splinters of horn and a scorch mark."
msgstr "角的碎片和一道焦痕。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:849
msgid "Travels"
msgstr "游历"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8493
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr "恶魔头骨像锤子下的煤块一样爆裂了。前方某处，岩石摩擦着岩石：两个头骨守着的通路开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8499
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr "恶魔头骨像锤子下的煤块一样爆裂了。洞穴仍在燃烧，但里面有什么东西不再盯着你们了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:850
msgid ""
"I was away a long time, further than most. The castle seems smaller now. Everything does."
msgstr "我离开了很久，比大多数人都远。现在城堡似乎变小了。什么都变小了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8506
msgid "Splinters of black bone and a smell of sulphur."
msgstr "黑色骨头的碎片和一股硫磺味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8515
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr "魔鬼头骨裂成两半，两半都在尖叫。前方某处，岩石摩擦着岩石：两个头骨守着的通路开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8521
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr "魔鬼头骨裂成两半，两半都在尖叫。洞穴仍在燃烧，但里面有什么东西不再盯着你们了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8527
msgid ""
"The lever stone drops into its socket. Down the gate run, a slab of black rock grinds into the floor."
msgstr "拉杆石落进了凹槽。大门下方，一块黑色岩板隆隆沉进地面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8533 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:318 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:713
msgid "The lever is down."
msgstr "拉杆已拉下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8541
msgid "Beyond the last cave, cool air, and the smell of grass."
msgstr "最后一个洞穴之外，是清凉的空气和青草的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8547
msgid ""
"The robbers' den, under the great bridge. Somewhere in here the boss keeps Princess Roxanne's tiara. Dice on the tables, wet boots by the bunks, and the river loud overhead."
msgstr "强盗的巢穴，在大桥底下。老大把罗克珊公主的头冠藏在这里某处。桌上有骰子，铺位旁有湿靴子，头顶上河水轰鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8561
msgid "The Robber Boss falls. A ring of heavy keys hangs at his belt."
msgstr "强盗老大倒下了。他腰间挂着一串沉重的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:858
msgid ""
"Crodo is free. Good. The King was pleased for almost a minute, and then asked about the mirror."
msgstr "克罗多自由了。很好。国王高兴了差不多一分钟，然后就问起了镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8590
msgid ""
"The clan master falls. You have dishonored the Ninjas by entering the Pagoda. They surely will not return to reclaim it."
msgstr "忍者宗师倒下了。你们闯入宝塔玷污了忍者的荣誉，他们肯定不会回来夺回它了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8603
msgid ""
"A message appears in the stone: The southwest corner is where to start / Begin with red to tell them apart. Alternate the colors around the well / Then the machine can no longer repel."
msgstr "石头上浮现出一条信息：西南角是起点 / 从红色开始以示区分。围着水井交替颜色 / 那机器便再也无法抵挡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8609 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:147
msgid "The pedestal is cool to the touch."
msgstr "基座摸上去冰凉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:862
msgid "You haven't found Crodo yet. Keep searching."
msgstr "你们还没找到克罗多。继续找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8625
msgid ""
"The transformer sparks, shudders and dies. Far above, in a cellar in Asp, someone stops hissing in mid-word."
msgstr "变压器冒出火花，颤抖着死去了。远在上方毒蛇镇的一间地窖里，有人说到一半停止了嘶嘶声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8631
msgid "Acme Ghost Visualization System."
msgstr "艾克米幽灵可视化系统。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8637
msgid "We have great treasure you can see. Bang the gong and set us free."
msgstr "我们有看得见的大宝藏。敲响铜锣，放我们自由。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8644
msgid "The gong booms over an empty, honest town. Nothing answers."
msgstr "铜锣声在空荡荡、老实巴交的小镇上空回响。没有任何回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8649
msgid ""
"The note rolls over the empty roofs, and the cold goes out of the air. Mayor Randon will want to hear of it."
msgstr "钟声滚过空荡荡的屋顶，空气里的寒意消散了。兰登镇长会想知道这件事的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8652
msgid ""
"The note dies in the fog. Somewhere a ghost laughs: \"You'll never win this game of war. The dead shall rule forevermore.\""
msgstr "钟声消散在雾中。某处，一个幽灵在笑：“这场战争游戏你们永远赢不了。亡者将永世为王。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8658
msgid ""
"Bang twice on each northern gong is all you have to do. The well can make you strong, but the order is up to you."
msgstr "每面北边的铜锣敲两下就行了。水井能让你变强，但顺序由你自己定。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:866
msgid ""
"Years ago King Burlock met Crodo, a kindly old sorcerer who became the King's friend. Baron Darzog, who was the King's master sorcerer, became very jealous of this friendship. I tried to warn the King that Darzog's jealousy would lead to no good, but he wouldn't listen to me. Now Crodo and Darzog have both disappeared and I fear that Crodo has been abducted. Perhaps Darzog has imprisoned him in his tower. If King Burlock were not so obsessed with the search for the Sixth Mirror, I'm sure he would have you search for him there."
msgstr "多年前，伯洛克国王遇见了克罗多，一位和蔼的老巫师，成了国王的朋友。达佐格男爵当时是国王的首席法师，对这份友谊非常嫉妒。我曾试图警告国王，达佐格的嫉妒不会有好结果，可他不听我的。现在克罗多和达佐格都失踪了，我担心克罗多被绑架了。也许达佐格把他囚禁在自己的塔里。要不是伯洛克国王这么痴迷于寻找第六面镜子，我相信他会让你们去那里找他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8664
msgid ""
"1) Destroy all ghosts. 2) Bang southern gong. 3) Re-visit Randon. 4) Repeat as necessary."
msgstr "1）消灭所有幽灵。2）敲响南边的铜锣。3）再去见兰登。4）必要时重复。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8670
msgid "Lives of a cat."
msgstr "猫有几条命。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8676
msgid "A stitch in time."
msgstr "及时的一针。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8686
msgid ""
"The lid slides aside. There is no Count in the coffin: only a stair, going down, and the smell of old earth."
msgstr "棺盖滑开了。棺材里没有伯爵：只有一道向下的楼梯，和陈年泥土的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8696
msgid ""
"Count Draco crumbles to dust, and his dust crumbles to less. Up in Nightshadow, shutters open for the first time in years."
msgstr "德拉科伯爵化为灰烬，灰烬又碎成更少的灰。在夜影镇上方，百叶窗多年来第一次被打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8705
msgid ""
"If the dials are properly set, the count will definitely be upset. Open his coffin and bid him farewell; only then can you use the magic of the well."
msgstr "刻度盘若设得对，伯爵必定会心碎。打开他的棺材，向他告别；只有这样，你才能用上水井的魔力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:871
msgid ""
"See the King first. Everyone sees the King first. Then they come to me."
msgstr "先去见国王。人人都先去见国王。然后才来找我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8711
msgid "Only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr "只有夜里，你才能与他一战。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8717
msgid "The Count wakes at nine and sleeps at nine."
msgstr "伯爵九点醒来，九点入睡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8724
msgid ""
"The water is clear and cold, and tastes faintly of garlic. You feel healthier, and somehow more likeable."
msgstr "水清澈冰凉，微微有大蒜的味道。你们觉得更健康了，不知怎么还更讨人喜欢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:305
msgid ""
"The water is black and tastes of iron. You decide you are not thirsty."
msgstr "水是黑的，有铁的味道。你们决定自己并不渴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8736
msgid ""
"\"There wolf,\" you say. Something on the other side growls approvingly, and the bolts draw back."
msgstr "“There wolf，”你们说。门另一边有什么东西满意地低吼了一声，门闩缩了回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8742
msgid "\"Wrong,\" says the door, and something behind it laughs like a dog."
msgstr "“错了，”门说，门后有什么东西像狗一样笑了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8748
msgid ""
"A thin man rattles his chain. \"Upstairs door? 'There wolf.' I heard them say it a hundred times. And the Sphinx's name is Golux; they argue about it at dinner. Now get me out of here.\""
msgstr "一个瘦削的男人哗啦啦地晃着锁链。“楼上的门？‘There wolf’。我听他们说过上百遍了。狮身人面像的名字是戈拉克斯；他们吃饭时还为这个争论。现在快把我弄出去。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8758
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for saving me!\" He is through the door and up the stairs before you can ask his name."
msgstr "“谢谢你们救了我！”还没等你们问他的名字，他就穿过门，跑上楼梯了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:876
msgid ""
"The pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo. Show it the sigil. Where it takes you, the King prefers not to know, so I don't tell him."
msgstr "眩晕镇以东小丘上的金字塔。给它看印记。它会把你们带到哪里，国王不愿知道，所以我没告诉他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8768
msgid ""
"A scroll bound in grey ribbon, labelled INSIGHT in a tidy hand. Someone has been reading it upside down."
msgstr "一卷用灰丝带捆着的卷轴，整齐的字迹标着“洞察”。有人一直在倒着读它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8775
msgid ""
"Scroll of Aging. The ink is fresh. Your hands, as you put it down, are not. You have been aged ten years!"
msgstr "衰老卷轴。墨迹还是新的。你们放下它时，双手却不新了。你们老了十岁！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8782
msgid ""
"Scroll of Confusion. The lines wander, and you wander after them. (Drunk)"
msgstr "混乱卷轴。字行游移，你们也跟着晃荡。（醉酒）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8789
msgid ""
"Scroll of Death. You read your own name on it, and the floor comes up to meet you. (Unconscious)"
msgstr "死亡卷轴。你们在上面读到了自己的名字，地板迎面撞了上来。（昏迷）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:879
msgid ""
"The old pyramids are said to lead to the land below the land. The Prince went there, they say, before he came home. The King will not hear of it. So, quietly: the Pyramid Sigil. Try the pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo."
msgstr "据说古老的金字塔通向大地之下的土地。他们说，王子回家之前去过那里。国王不愿听到这事。所以悄悄告诉你们：金字塔印记。去眩晕镇以东小丘上的金字塔试试。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8796
msgid ""
"Scroll of Depression. Halfway down the page you understand that nothing will ever be all right again. (Afraid)"
msgstr "沮丧卷轴。读到一半，你们就明白一切再也不会好了。（恐惧）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8803 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8815 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8833
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8852 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8864 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8876
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8888
msgid "You have read this scroll before. It has nothing more to give you."
msgstr "你们读过这卷轴了。它再没有什么能给你们的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8808
msgid ""
"Scroll of Electricity. Your hair stands up while you read, and stays wary after. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "电击卷轴。你们读的时候头发竖了起来，读完后依然戒备着。（+5 风系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8820
msgid ""
"Scroll of Energy. It hums in your hands, then in you, then stops. (+5 Earth resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "能量卷轴。它在你们手中嗡鸣，然后在你们体内嗡鸣，然后停了。（+5 土系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8826
msgid "The writing has faded."
msgstr "字迹已经褪去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8838
msgid ""
"Scroll of Fire. The letters glow, then cool, and so does your skin. (+5 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "火焰卷轴。字母发光，然后冷却，你们的皮肤也一样。（+5 火系抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8845
msgid ""
"Scroll of Insanity. It makes perfect sense. That is the trouble. (Insane)"
msgstr "疯狂卷轴。它完全说得通。麻烦就在这里。（疯狂）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8857
msgid ""
"Scroll of Intellect. You read it twice, and the second time it makes sense. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "智力卷轴。你们读了两遍，第二遍就读懂了。（+2 智力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8869
msgid ""
"Scroll of Magic. The spells written on it slide off you as you read. (+5 Mind resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "魔法卷轴。你们读的时候，上面的法术从你们身上滑开了。（+5 心智抗性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8881
msgid ""
"Scroll of Personality. You read it aloud, and the room seems to like you better for it. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr "个性卷轴。你们把它念出声，屋里的人似乎因此更喜欢你们了。（+2 个性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:889 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:618
msgid "Newcastle"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8893
msgid ""
"Scroll of Speed. You finish it before you have quite started it. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "速度卷轴。你们还没真正开始，就已经读完了。（+2 速度，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8900
msgid "Scroll of Weakness. Your arms forget what they were for. (Weak)"
msgstr "虚弱卷轴。你们的手臂忘了自己是干什么用的。（虚弱）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8909
msgid ""
"The stone between the paws slides aside, as if it had been waiting for someone to knock."
msgstr "两爪之间的石头滑开了，仿佛一直在等人来敲门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:891
msgid ""
"If you want to make some improvements here you should see the King's engineers. Emerson, at Castle Burlock. I am sure he will be able to help you."
msgstr "如果你想在这里做些改进，应该去找国王的工程师。爱默生，在伯洛克城堡。我相信他能帮到你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8915
msgid ""
"Hieroglyphs, and under them the message reads: My first is in giant but not in defiant. My second is in mole but not in mule. My third is in lich but not in stitch. My fourth is in guard but not in Girard. My fifth is in XEEN but not in Queen."
msgstr "象形文字，下面的信息写着：My first is in giant but not in defiant. My second is in mole but not in mule. My third is in lich but not in stitch. My fourth is in guard but not in Girard. My fifth is in XEEN but not in Queen."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8928
msgid ""
"\"Golux,\" the Sphinx repeats, pleased. \"Nobody ever asks how I am. Sit where you like.\" The doors to the thrones open."
msgstr "“戈拉克斯，”狮身人面像高兴地重复道。“从没人问过我过得怎么样。随便坐吧。”王座厅的门打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8934
msgid "\"No,\" says the Sphinx, and the floor agrees with it."
msgstr "“不对，”狮身人面像说，地板也同意它的话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:894
msgid ""
"Wanna buy the land this lovely castle rests upon? Only twelve thousand gold! The rubble is included. So are the wood golems in the foundations."
msgstr "想买下这座可爱城堡坐落的地皮吗？只要一万两千金币！废墟包含在内。地基里的木魔像也一并奉送。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8940
msgid ""
"The message reads: You're looking for my name, it's five letters long. I think you'll like my name. Try not to get it wrong. A voice booms, \"What is my name?\""
msgstr "信息写着：You're looking for my name, it's five letters long. I think you'll like my name. Try not to get it wrong. 一个声音轰然响起：“我的名字是什么？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8950 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8965 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8980
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8995
msgid ""
"You have sat here before. The throne remembers, and is not impressed twice."
msgstr "你们之前坐过这里。王座记得，不会被同一个人打动两次。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8955
msgid ""
"You sit on the King's throne. It fits better than it should. (+2 Might, permanent)"
msgstr "你们坐上了国王的王座。它比应有的更合身。（+2 力量，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8970
msgid ""
"The throne of legends. Old names are carved in it, and there is room for yours. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr "传奇王座。上面刻着古老的名字，还有给你们的名字留的位置。（+2 耐力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8985
msgid ""
"You sit on the Queen's throne, and for a moment everyone in the hall looks at you. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr "你们坐上了女王的王座，有那么一刻，大厅里所有人都在看着你们。（+2 个性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:899
msgid ""
"Thanks a lot! You won't regret your decision. Sign here. And here. The golems are yours too, of course."
msgstr "太感谢了！你们不会后悔的。在这里签字。还有这里。魔像当然也是你们的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9000
msgid ""
"The Prince of Thieves' throne. Your hands feel lighter, and somebody's purse feels closer. (+2 Accuracy, permanent)"
msgstr "神偷王子的王座。你们觉得双手变轻了，别人的钱袋也变近了。（+2 准确，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:33 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9006
msgid ""
"A burrow under the wall, with a tiny door and a tiny sign: THE COURT. KNOCK LOUDLY. WE WILL IGNORE YOU."
msgstr "墙下的一个洞穴，有一扇小小的门和一块小小的牌子：法庭。大声敲门。我们会无视你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9021
msgid ""
"BY ORDER OF THE MAYOR: the treasury will pay to end the Gremlins' mischief. Their court is the burrow under the wall, east of this gate. Pass holders apply within. Everyone else, apply to the gremlins."
msgstr "镇长令：国库将出资终结小妖精的恶作剧。他们的法庭在城门以东墙下的洞穴里。持通行证者请入内申请。其他人，请向小妖精申请。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9039
msgid ""
"The last guard falls. On the throne, Gettlewaithe has gone a much paler shade of green."
msgstr "最后一名卫兵倒下了。王座上的格特尔韦特，脸色变成了淡得多的绿色。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:905
msgid ""
"Twelve thousand gold, not a copper less. The King's tax is the King's tax."
msgstr "一万两千金币，一个铜板都不能少。国王的税就是国王的税。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9057
msgid "You find 3 Energy Disks under the late Gettlewaithe's throne."
msgstr "你们在已故的格特尔韦特的王座下找到了 3 块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9063
msgid ""
"Only a scrap of the original text remains legible: ...set the Western dials to 1, Northern to 2, and Eastern to 3. To join the Way of Bark, pull lever and drink of the Crystal Water."
msgstr "原文只剩一小片还能辨认：……把西边的刻度盘设为 1，北边的设为 2，东边的设为 3。想加入树皮之道，请拉动拉杆并饮下水晶之水。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9074
msgid ""
"Shaalth's key turns in the cage lock. The princess steps out and straightens her wings."
msgstr "沙尔思的钥匙在笼锁里转动。公主走出来，整理好她的翅膀。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9086
msgid "You are hereby dubbed a Disciple of Bark!"
msgstr "特此封你们为树皮门徒！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9092
msgid ""
"The poisonous water burns your throat as you take a long drink. Violent tremors wrack your body. They pass, which is more than the water intended."
msgstr "你们痛饮了毒水，喉咙火烧火燎。你们的身体剧烈颤抖。颤抖过去了，这比水本来的意图要好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9098
msgid ""
"Other beings say that we Orcs just aren't civilized. I now invite you in for a cup of tea to debate on this issue."
msgstr "别的生灵都说我们兽人不开化。现在我请你们进来喝杯茶，就这件事辩一辩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9104
msgid ""
"The tea is hot, sweet and poisonous. The debate is over, and the Orcs won it."
msgstr "茶又热又甜还有毒。辩论结束了，兽人赢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9110
msgid ""
"The limb swallows the gem. Deep in the trunk, something very large and very wooden wakes up."
msgstr "树枝吞下了宝石。树干深处，有什么极其巨大、极其木质的东西醒了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9138
msgid "The root drinks the gem. The bark parts on an Energy Disc."
msgstr "树根喝下了宝石。树皮裂开，露出一块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:913
msgid ""
"We want to make sure you approve of the work we have already done. Please go and take a look at your castle."
msgstr "我们想确认你们对我们已经完成的工作满意。请去看看你们的城堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9168
msgid ""
"In this treehouse there once lived many sprites, but someone murdered the lot of them. You find two energy disks."
msgstr "这座树屋里曾经住着许多小精灵，但有人把它们全杀了。你们找到了两块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:917 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:974
msgid ""
"Thanks! We'll have the work done by the time you get back to the site."
msgstr "谢谢！等你们回到工地时，我们就能完工了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9174
msgid ""
"A voice bellows: 'Feed the roots and the tree shall bear fruit! Feed the limbs and suffer the wrath of BARKMAN!'"
msgstr "一个声音咆哮着：“喂根，树才结果！喂枝，便遭巴克曼之怒！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9207
msgid "The fort collapses in a heap of burning timbers and smoldering ash."
msgstr "堡垒在燃烧的木料和阴燃的灰烬中塌成一堆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9197
msgid "You search the fort and find 2 energy disks."
msgstr "你们搜查了堡垒，找到了 2 块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9224
msgid ""
"Smoke rises into the sky as you put the camp to the torch. Among the ashes, the tribe's small hoard of gold."
msgstr "你们放火烧了营地，烟柱升上天空。灰烬里有部落那一小堆金子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9243
msgid ""
"Sacks of gold, each stamped THIEVES' GUILD. Nobody else labels their gold."
msgstr "一袋袋金子，每袋都盖着“盗贼公会”的戳。除了他们没人给金子贴标签。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9250 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:121
msgid "Hobstadt falls across the foot of his throne. The throne is vacant."
msgstr "霍布施塔特倒在他的王座脚下。王座空着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9260
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: The Trolls have stolen our gold. Get it back no matter the cost!"
msgstr "盗贼公会信笺上的一条信息写着：致全体会员：巨魔偷了我们的金子。不惜一切代价夺回来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9271
msgid ""
"Your troll sits on the throne of Hobstadt. It fits. He stands up a War Troll."
msgstr "你的巨魔坐上了霍布施塔特的王座。正合适。他站起来时成了战争巨魔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9277
msgid "You let yourselves down into the troll hole."
msgstr "你们顺着巨魔洞下去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9283
msgid ""
"Troll Juice. This stuff is poisonous, but the experience improves you."
msgstr "巨魔汁。这东西有毒，但这番经历让你们变得更好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9289
msgid "You have had enough Troll Juice for one lifetime."
msgstr "你们这辈子喝的巨魔汁已经够多了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:930
msgid ""
"You don't have enough Megacredits. Five. Craftsmen don't count in gold."
msgstr "你们的兆信用点不够。要五个。工匠不收金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9302
msgid "Morgana is dead. Her robes keep glowing for a while, out of habit."
msgstr "摩根娜死了。她的长袍出于习惯，还亮了好一阵子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9309 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9321 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9857
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9869 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9881 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:445
msgid "You have had your fill."
msgstr "你们已经喝够了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9314
msgid ""
"Orange Potion. It tastes of marmalade and arithmetic. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "橙色药水。有橘子酱和算术的味道。（+2 智力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9326
msgid ""
"Purple Potion. Your feet are already halfway to the next room. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "紫色药水。你们的脚已经有一半迈向下一个房间了。（+2 速度，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9334
msgid "Xenoc falls, still in the middle of a sentence about his betters."
msgstr "泽诺克倒下了，话还停在一句关于他的上级的话中间。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:934
msgid ""
"Every defensible piece of land needs a wall around it. I can have craftsmen and laborers working on your land for 5 King's Megacredits. Bring them and we'll start."
msgstr "每块可防守的土地都需要一圈围墙。你们付 5 个国王兆信用点，我就能让工匠和劳工在你们的土地上干活。把它们带来，我们就开工。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9348
msgid ""
"In a nest of spoons, buckles and broken mirrors: a magnifying glass, with 'CALEB' scratched on the handle. Very small."
msgstr "在一堆勺子、带扣和破镜子的窝里：一枚放大镜，手柄上刻着“CALEB”。很小。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9357
msgid ""
"With great effort, you pound roosting rocks to powder and scatter the dust to the wind."
msgstr "你们费了好大的劲，把栖息的岩石捣成粉末，把尘土撒向风中。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9365 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9380
msgid "The People turn on you as one."
msgstr "众人齐齐转而攻击你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:938
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I cannot do any work on land that you do not own! Buy some land and we'll talk."
msgstr "对不起，我不能在不属于你们的土地上干活！买块地，我们再谈。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9386
msgid ""
"A standing stone cut with the People's law, in letters a hand deep: ALAMAR'S PLANS WILL DESTROY ALL CREATURES ON DARKSIDE. NO SANE PEOPLE SUPPORT A TYRANT."
msgstr "一块刻着众人法律的立石，字有一掌深：阿拉玛的计划将毁灭暗面所有生灵。没有理智的人会支持暴君。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9393
msgid "The bloody throne. Nothing left on it but the blood."
msgstr "血腥王座。上面什么都不剩了，只有血。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9397
msgid ""
"A throne of black wood, big enough for four of you. Gurodel would notice."
msgstr "一把黑木王座，大得能坐下你们四个。古罗德尔会发现的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9402
msgid ""
"The bloody throne. Whatever the People had to give, they gave you in friendship."
msgstr "血腥王座。众人所能给予的，他们都以友谊给了你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9410
msgid "You search the bloody throne and find two energy disks."
msgstr "你们搜查了血腥王座，找到了两块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9419
msgid "We recognize you as enemies! Prepare to defend yourselves!"
msgstr "我们认出你们是敌人！准备自卫吧！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9426
msgid ""
"\"A fool and his money are soon parted.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“傻子和他的钱很快就会分开。”（A fool and his money are soon parted.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:943
msgid ""
"While building the rest of your castle, a worker came back from the tundra white as a sheet. The Golem Dungeon, by the lagoon, is stuffed with Megacredits, he says. And golems. Mostly golems."
msgstr "在建造你们城堡的其余部分时，一名工人从冻原回来，脸白得像张纸。他说，泻湖边的魔像地牢里塞满了兆信用点。还有魔像。主要是魔像。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9430
msgid ""
"\"A fool and his money are soon parted.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and you feel a little less of a fool. (+1 Intellect, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“傻子和他的钱很快就会分开。”书页自己补全了元音，你们觉得自己没那么傻了。（+1 智力，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9437
msgid ""
"\"Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“别去看赠马的嘴。”（Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9441
msgid ""
"\"Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your eye settles on what matters. (+1 Accuracy, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“别去看赠马的嘴。”书页自己补全了元音，你们的目光落在了要紧之处。（+1 准确，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9448
msgid ""
"\"He who laughs last, laughs best.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“笑到最后的人笑得最好。”（He who laughs last, laughs best.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9452
msgid ""
"\"He who laughs last, laughs best.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and somewhere below a knight laughs once, last. (+1 Personality, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“笑到最后的人笑得最好。”书页自己补全了元音，下方某处，一个骑士最后笑了一声。（+1 个性，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9459
msgid ""
"\"Love of money is the root of all evil.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“爱财是万恶之源。”（Love of money is the root of all evil.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9463
msgid ""
"\"Love of money is the root of all evil.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and you feel fortune look kindly on a purse held loosely. (+1 Luck, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“爱财是万恶之源。”书页自己补全了元音，你们觉得命运善待那只松松握着的钱袋。（+1 运气，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9470
msgid ""
"\"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“多数人的需要胜过少数人的需要。”（The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9474
msgid ""
"\"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your arms feel ready to carry the many. (+1 Might, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“多数人的需要胜过少数人的需要。”书页自己补全了元音，你们的手臂觉得自己扛得起众人。（+1 力量，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:948
msgid ""
"The workers have finished cleaning out the rubble and patching up the stone work. You should go inside and have a look around. Oh, one more thing. One of the workers swears the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors, out in the lagoon, is full of Megacredits. He won't go back for them. I thought you might."
msgstr "工人们已经清理完了瓦砾，修补好了石砌工程。你们该进去看看。哦，还有一件事。有个工人发誓说，泻湖里的千重恐怖之墓里全是兆信用点。他不肯再回去拿。我想你们可能愿意。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9481
msgid ""
"\"Let sleeping dogs lie.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“别惊醒沉睡的狗。”（Let sleeping dogs lie.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9485
msgid ""
"\"Let sleeping dogs lie.\" The page fills in its own vowels as you watch, and you feel you could sleep through anything. (+1 Endurance, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“别惊醒沉睡的狗。”你们眼看着书页自己补全元音，觉得自己什么都睡得着。（+1 耐力，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9492
msgid ""
"\"If wishes were horses, beggars would ride.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“如果愿望是马，乞丐也能骑。”（If wishes were horses, beggars would ride.）无元音骑士团如是说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9496
msgid ""
"\"If wishes were horses, beggars would ride.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your feet feel like they have somewhere to be. (+1 Speed, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“如果愿望是马，乞丐也能骑。”书页自己补全了元音，你们觉得脚下有了该去的地方。（+1 速度，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9502
msgid "The book slams shut in disgust...your answer must have been wrong."
msgstr "书厌恶地啪地合上了……你们的答案一定错了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9515
msgid ""
"A chalice of silver with white gold tracery, humming faintly. Nobody stops you taking it. Nobody says anything at all."
msgstr "一只银杯，镶着白金花纹，发出微弱的嗡鸣。没人阻止你们拿走。没人说话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:952
msgid ""
"If you have enough Megacredits you should think about building up your castle. The King's engineers should be able to help you."
msgstr "如果你们有足够的兆信用点，应该考虑扩建你们的城堡。国王的工程师应该能帮你们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9522 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9600
msgid "You're not worthy!"
msgstr "你不配！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9529
msgid "It feels so good!"
msgstr "感觉真好！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9534
msgid "You feel euphoric! (+1 to every statistic, permanent)"
msgstr "你们感到欣喜若狂！（所有属性 +1，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9552
msgid ""
"You set the Chalice before the plaque and say the oath, every word without a vowel. The knights come out of the walls. They say nothing, which you now understand as approval, and hand you two humming disks. The warriors among you leave as Black Knights and Villains."
msgstr "你们把圣杯放在牌匾前，说出誓言，每个词都没有元音。骑士们从墙里走出来。他们一言不发，你们现在明白这就是赞许，并交给你们两块嗡鸣的盘。你们当中的战士离开时成了黑骑士和恶棍。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9560
msgid "The new member says the oath without a vowel, and the knights nod."
msgstr "新成员说出了无元音的誓言，骑士们点了点头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9567
msgid "You feel confused. (Drunk)"
msgstr "你们觉得头晕目眩。（醉酒）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9574
msgid "You feel depressed. (Afraid)"
msgstr "你们觉得郁闷。（恐惧）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9581
msgid "You feel heart broken. (Weak)"
msgstr "你们觉得心碎。（虚弱）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9588
msgid "You feel insane. (Insane)"
msgstr "你们觉得发疯。（疯狂）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9594
msgid "Over the door: \"Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts\"."
msgstr "门上写着：“Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:960
msgid ""
"Three places. The Temple of Yak in Rivercity's south woods. The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors in the lagoon. The Golem Dungeon in the tundra, by the lagoon. Evil people hoard Megacredits. Don't ask me why."
msgstr "三个地方。里弗城南边树林里的牛神庙。泻湖里的千重恐怖之墓。冻原上泻湖边的魔像地牢。邪恶的人囤积兆信用点。别问我为什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9607
msgid "\"Very Good! Lv Lng nd prspr!\" The iron door beside you swings open."
msgstr "“Very Good! Lv Lng nd prspr!”你们身边的铁门荡开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9613
msgid "That's not why you are here! Study your lessons."
msgstr "你们来这里不是为了这个！去研习你们的功课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9619
msgid "Have you learned nothing of the Voweless Knights? Begone!"
msgstr "你们对无元音骑士团一无所知吗？滚！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9626
msgid "Your intellect is already fantastic!"
msgstr "你们的智力已经很惊人了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:963
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits. The King mints them for his engineers, and somehow they all end up in evil places: the Temple of Yak, the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors and the Golem Dungeon. Fetch them; I build. Walls, keep and dungeon, five each."
msgstr "国王兆信用点。国王为他的工程师铸造它们，不知怎么它们全都流落到了邪恶的地方：牛神庙、千重恐怖之墓和魔像地牢。你们去取，我来建。围墙、主堡和地牢，各五个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9631
msgid ""
"The Book of Fantastic Knowledge. You close it knowing a little more than you did, and suspecting a great deal more. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "奇妙知识之书。你们合上书时，知道得比之前多了一点，怀疑得多得多。（+2 智力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9640
msgid "The fountain removes all effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr "喷泉消除了一切非自然衰老的影响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9643
msgid ""
"The water is venom-green and smells of it. Thaddeus shakes his head at you from his door."
msgstr "水是毒绿色的，闻起来也是。撒迪厄斯在他的门口冲你们摇头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9649
msgid ""
"A magic aura around the book pushes you back. The book answers to no one living."
msgstr "书周围的魔法光环把你们推开了。这本书不听任何活人的话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9667
msgid ""
"Disc. Two Energy Disks, wired into a mage's experiment that no longer needs them."
msgstr "圆盘。两块能量盘，接在一个已不再需要它们的法师实验装置上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9678
msgid ""
"A letter sealed with Ellinger's mark, addressed 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster'. He left it where only those who could climb this tower would find it."
msgstr "一封盖着埃林格印记的信，收件人是“桑德堡公会会长”。他把它放在只有能爬上这座塔的人才会发现的地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9690
msgid ""
"Fountain of Minimal Abilities. Your statistics have increased! (+1 to every statistic, permanent)"
msgstr "最低能力之泉。你们的属性提高了！（所有属性 +1，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:970
msgid ""
"The keep's up. Smith on the ground floor, a training hall above. Ebenezer says the workers have news. They're always finding something."
msgstr "主堡建好了。一楼是铁匠，楼上是训练厅。埃比尼泽说工人们有消息。他们总能找到点什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9705
msgid ""
"The lid swings up. Among the thieves' takings, a receipt: 'Paid in full. One jewel. Delivered to the Eastern Tower.'"
msgstr "盖子掀起。在盗贼的赃物中有一张收据：“已全额付清。珠宝一件。已送往东塔。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9711
msgid "The gong booms three times and a door grinds open somewhere."
msgstr "铜锣响了三声，某处一扇门嘎吱打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9717
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: Ring each gong three times. Three's the charm. The Ali Baba chest's word is 'open sesame'. Do NOT write this down."
msgstr "盗贼公会信笺上的一条信息写着：致全体会员：每面铜锣敲三下。三是吉数。阿里巴巴箱子的口令是“open sesame”。千万不要写下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9728
msgid ""
"Energy Disc. Two, wrapped in a thieves' guild invoice made out to nobody."
msgstr "能量盘。两块，裹在一张开给无名氏的盗贼公会发票里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9738
msgid ""
"Ledger. One (1) Griffin Statuette, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower. One (1) Dragon Statuette, sold to Head Witch of Lakeside. One (1) Pegasus Statuette, sold to Head Heretical Cleric. One (1) Jewel of Ages, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower."
msgstr "账本。狮鹫雕像一尊，售予大东塔的法师们。龙雕像一尊，售予湖畔镇的女巫头目。天马雕像一尊，售予异端神甫头目。世纪宝石一颗，售予大东塔的法师们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9751
msgid "For the eyes of the prince only!"
msgstr "仅供王子过目！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9755
msgid "You know the Prince Book by heart. You learn nothing new."
msgstr "你已把王子之书背得滚瓜烂熟。没学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9760
msgid ""
"The Prince Book: the private rules of the Prince of Thieves, written for one reader. You read them, and your luck seems to read over your shoulder. (+2 Luck, permanent)"
msgstr "王子之书：神偷王子的私人守则，只为一位读者而写。你们读了它，运气似乎在你们肩后一起读。（+2 运气，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9766
msgid ""
"The Manual of Master Thievery. Locks, lures, ledgers, and how to leave a room so that nobody remembers you were in it. You will remember it."
msgstr "《神偷大师手册》。锁、诱饵、账本，以及如何离开房间而不让任何人记得你来过。你们会记得它的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9772
msgid "You learn nothing new."
msgstr "你们没学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9790
msgid ""
"You wrench the bars out of the old mortar. Jasper squeezes through, says something grateful and muffled, and runs for his brother's house."
msgstr "你们把栏杆从旧灰浆里撬了出来。贾斯珀挤了出来，含混而感激地说了几句，就跑向他哥哥的家了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9807
msgid ""
"Statuette. A golden griffin in a mage's curio cabinet, labelled in a neat hand: 'Griffin, gold. Thaumic value: none. Bought anyway.'"
msgstr "雕像。一只金色的狮鹫，在法师的珍品柜里，用工整的字迹标着：“狮鹫，金。魔法价值：无。照买不误。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9828
msgid "Under the third log you find a heavy iron ring, warm to the touch."
msgstr "在第三根原木下面，你们找到一只沉重的铁环，摸上去是温的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9839
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you for rescuing me! The witches were going to use me for spare parts in their potions."
msgstr "噢，谢谢你们救了我！女巫们本来打算把我当零件放进她们的药水里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9850
msgid ""
"Thanks for getting me out of there. The witches turn people into monsters: the good ones guard Castle Blackfang, the rejects end up on the Isle of Lost Souls. There are others. Find them."
msgstr "谢谢你们把我弄出来。女巫们把人变成怪物：好的守着布莱克方城堡，次品最后去了失魂岛。还有别的。去找找看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9862
msgid ""
"Cauldron. It tastes of iron and old boots, and you feel you could take a beating. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr "大锅。有铁和旧靴子的味道，你们觉得自己能挨一顿打。（+2 耐力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:987
msgid "You don't have enough Megacredits."
msgstr "你们的兆信用点不够。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9874
msgid ""
"Cauldron. You taste the brew, and the witches' charm rubs off on you a little. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr "大锅。你们尝了尝药汤，女巫的魅力稍微沾到了你们身上。（+2 个性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9886
msgid ""
"Cauldron. The brew is gone before you taste it, and so, nearly, are you. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "大锅。药汤没等你们尝就没了，你们也差点没了。（+2 速度，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9899
msgid ""
"My first is in water but not in tear. My second is in hire but not in hear. My third is in tree but not in peer. My fourth is in race but not in fear. My last is in sharp but not in spear."
msgstr "My first is in water but not in tear. My second is in hire but not in hear. My third is in tree but not in peer. My fourth is in race but not in fear. My last is in sharp but not in spear."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:990
msgid "How about a keep to go with those walls? Just 5 Megacredits!"
msgstr "给那些围墙配一座主堡怎么样？只要 5 个兆信用点！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9907
msgid ""
"Correct! As a reward, I give you free membership to the guild. Members use the cellar door round the back."
msgstr "正确！作为奖励，我免费给你们公会会员资格。会员走后面的地窖门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9914
msgid ""
"Wrong! Begone fools! The floor of the porch drops away, and you land in the sewer under the Guild."
msgstr "错误！滚吧，蠢货！门廊地板塌了，你们掉进了公会下面的下水道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9930
msgid ""
"Another of the green ways drinks. The witches clap, politely. Warlock."
msgstr "又一个走绿色之道的喝了。女巫们礼貌地鼓掌。术士。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9934
msgid "You have had some. It is still toad."
msgstr "你们已经喝过了。它还是蟾蜍味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9939
msgid ""
"The brew tastes of toad and ambition. 'Welcome, sisters,' says a witch, whatever you are. Those of you who walk the green ways come up from the cauldron Warlocks. Members may also help themselves to the Head Witch's chest. Politely."
msgstr "药汤有蟾蜍和野心的味道。“欢迎，姐妹们，”一个女巫说，不管你们是什么人。你们当中走绿色之道的，从大锅里出来就成了术士。会员也可以随意取用女巫头目的箱子。要礼貌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9950
msgid ""
"(yawn) Thank you for saving me from my hideous fate. I am forever in your debt. I'll be going now. See you."
msgstr "（哈欠）谢谢你们把我从可怕的命运中救出来。我永远欠你们的情。我这就走了。回头见。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9961
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving me. I'm tired of adventuring and I'm going home, but the dragon statuette is in the sewer below us. The witches caught me just as I was reaching for it."
msgstr "谢谢你们救了我。我受够了冒险，要回家了，不过龙雕像就在我们下面的下水道里。我正伸手去拿时，女巫抓住了我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9978
msgid "A sign on the barrel says: Food for the dead, keep warm."
msgstr "桶上的牌子写着：亡者的食物，保持温热。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:999
msgid ""
"The Tower of High Magic stands in the lagoon. Mind the top floors: the wizards brewed things up there they never named."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔矗立在泻湖里。当心顶楼：巫师们在那里酿出了从未命名的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9996
msgid "Dead Food. You have all had some. Nobody wants seconds."
msgstr "亡者食物。你们都吃了一些。没人想要第二份。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:1002
msgid ""
"A letter on the lid reads: O. It will not shut. All nine lids spring open again."
msgstr "盖子上的字母写着：O。它合不上。九个盖子又全部弹开了。"

