#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:606
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach: I am the statue dedicated to honoring Alamar's efforts to protect Terra from interference from the Ancients. In spite of the Ancients' attempts to separate Alamar from his rightful guardianship of Terra, Alamar has persevered in his heroic struggle to return to Terra to protect the planet from harm, both internal and external. Though many years have passed, Alamar's resolve to return to his sacred duty persists."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:611 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:620
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach: I am the statue dedicated to honoring Alamar's skillful rulership of the realms he has controlled. In all kingdoms lucky enough to benefit from Alamar's wise counsel and firm guidance, crime has decreased and production increased. Further, social deviance has virtually disappeared while complete obedience, a behavior desirable in lower life forms, has risen dramatically."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:625 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:634
msgid ""
