msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:132
msgid "Frozen door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:128
msgid ""
"The door is frozen shut: a sheet of blue ice covers it from lintel to sill, and its hinges are lost in it. A steam pipe runs cold along the wall to its frame, back toward the reagent store."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:157
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:185
msgid "Lift gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:181
msgid ""
"The lift gate is bolted. The lever beside it on the wall works the bolt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:166
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:198
msgid "Gate lever"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:190
msgid "The lever is down and the gate stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE TOWER OF HIGH MAGIC. The Enchanted Key from the Cave of Illusion turns, and the door shuts again behind you with a sound like a held breath. Artemus was plain about it: the Skeleton Key that opens Darzog's Tower lies with the Archmage who built this place, in his study at the very top. Six laboratories climb the floors between, and their keepers will not welcome you. The stairs go up the east and west sides in turn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:153 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:197
msgid ""
"The bolt shoots back and the brass gate rises. Beyond it the cage will answer you now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:20 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:22
msgid "The Art of Magic"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:207
msgid "Librarian's door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:203
msgid ""
"The door is locked. Its keyhole is cut in the shape of an open book: the Librarian's Key, which the Head Sorceress keeps about her in the magic lab."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:21
msgid ""
"THE ART OF MAGIC. 'Every spell is a door, and every door a lock. The novice forces the lock; the master learns the shape of the key. Fire wants feeding, water wants a vessel, air will go where it likes, earth will not go at all. Learn what each wants, and it will come to your hand as a dog comes to its name.' The rest is the Archmage's notes in the margins, in a hand too small to read."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:249
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:256 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:290
msgid "Brass cage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:239
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the first floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:289
msgid "The cage creaks on its chains and moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:227
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the first floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:267
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:301 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:313
msgid "Chains rattle in the shaft and the cage moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:273
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the second floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:261
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the second floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:307
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the top floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:295
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the top floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:319
msgid "MYSTERIES OF LIGHT, says the brass plate on the cabinet's door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:333
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:336
msgid "Pandorian Box"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:335
msgid "The box is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:43
msgid "Cold Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:363
msgid "Steam valve"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:355
msgid "The valve is open as far as it goes; steam hisses in the pipes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:362
msgid ""
"You heave the steam valve round. The pipes knock and hiss along the walls, and from the garden beyond the still comes the crack and drip of thawing ice: the frozen door of the west stair stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:37
msgid "You have drunk the Cold Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:42
msgid ""
"COLD BREW. Frost creeps up the ladle. It is like swallowing a winter, and afterwards the cold cannot find you: +5 Water resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:54
msgid "Electric Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:48
msgid ""
"You have drunk the Electric Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:53
msgid ""
"ELECTRIC BREW. The brew crackles blue between the coils and stings your tongue like a storm: +5 Air resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:57 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:65
msgid "Energy Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:59
msgid "You have drunk the Energy Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:64
msgid ""
"ENERGY BREW. It glows yellow in the ladle and hums in your bones for a long moment: +5 Earth resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:76
msgid "Fire Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:70
msgid "You have drunk the Fire Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:75
msgid ""
"FIRE BREW. A red brew that smokes in its cauldron by the athanor. It burns going down, and the heat stays in you: +5 Fire resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:87
msgid "Magic Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:81
msgid "You have drunk the Magic Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:86
msgid ""
"MAGIC BREW. Violet, and stranger than it looks: for a moment you hear your own thoughts from outside. Then the mind closes, stronger: +5 Mind resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:98
msgid "Poison Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:92
msgid "You have drunk the Poison Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:97
msgid ""
"POISON BREW. Nightshade and hemlock, boiled down until they cure what they once caused. Bitter, and then nothing at all: +5 Body resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:126
msgid ""
"Seven figures in the Baron's robes turn as one. 'Which of us,' they ask together, 'will you kill first?'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:153
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:436 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:447
msgid "Darzog's disc"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:189
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:438
msgid ""
"A disc of black stone hangs in the Well behind this grille, the Baron's rune glowing on its rim. It answers to Darzog alone while he lives."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:149 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:169
msgid "The disc hums and glides along the Well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:155
msgid ""
"You press the stone. Far above, at the top of the Well, a rune flares and dies: whatever it calls is bound by its master, up on his own floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:184
msgid "Call the disc"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:183
msgid "The disc rises up the Well to the landing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:193
msgid "Black grille"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:192
msgid ""
"The grille opens when the disc is here. Step onto the disc and touch it to ride down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:205
msgid "Darzog's doors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:226
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:235
msgid "Study door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:21 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:29
msgid "Book of Accuracy"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:217
msgid "Apprentices' door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:220 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:223
msgid "Smelter door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:23
msgid "You have already learned what the book of accuracy can teach."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:251
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:257
msgid ""
"You fall from the tower and crash down on the island. Battered, you pick yourselves up by the tower door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:279
msgid "Darzog's journal"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:278
msgid ""
"DARZOG'S JOURNAL, the last page: '... The old fool Crodo sits behind my own portrait in my bedchamber, where he may admire me while he rots. Let him send his dreams to Newcastle's tinkers; no spell leaves this tower, and no spell enters it but mine. My new master in the clouds is pleased. When the King's precious \"brother\" sits the throne, I shall have Crodo's place at last.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:28
msgid ""
"BOOK OF ACCURACY. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Accuracy (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:296
msgid "The library stair door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:289
msgid ""
"Locked. The keyhole is cut as a sorcerer's sigil. The Chief Librarian keeps the key to the upper stair in his cabinet in the great library, south of the Well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:295
msgid "The library key turns in the carved lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:306
msgid "Darzog's portrait"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:301
msgid ""
"The Baron in oils, haughty and gaunt. Behind the painted eyes something moves: an old man's face, pressed to the other side, then gone. The frame will not shift while Darzog's spell holds it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:305
msgid ""
"With Darzog dead, the portrait is only paint and wood. It slides up into the wall on a cell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:319
msgid ""
"Wind, and the whole of Lake Darzog below. Above the roof a stair of cloud climbs into the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:40
msgid "Book of Endurance"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:336
msgid "Leave Darzog's Tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:335
msgid "You pull the tower door open on the wind off the lake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:34
msgid "You have already learned what the book of endurance can teach."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:341 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:353
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:365
msgid ""
"The cracked flags give way under you! You drop through to the works below."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:370
msgid ""
"A note, pinned at the head of the stair in a hurried hand: 'MIND THE CRACKED FLAGS. The Master's hatches drop you straight down to the works, and the hands down there are not friendly. Walk round them. -- Wil'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:381
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:385 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:392
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:395 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:399 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:402
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:406
